            ["Understanding magic takes care, resolve, and a great deal of knowledge. I built the gizmonitor to help keep that knowledge within reach. When we fled Gnomeregan, I left it behind in a chest. I worry about its power supply. There is much more at stake than a collection of impressive sparks."] = "female\\lore5144_learned_1.ogg",
