            ["Remember: we pull together, we win together. I mostly cheer together."] = "male\\dungeon_4.ogg",
            ["It's dark in here. I don't love the dark."] = "male\\npc_dungeon_4.ogg",
            ["Ooh, spooky. Let's make some brave memories."] = "male\\dungeon_5.ogg",
            ["Stay together. Nobody wander off."] = "male\\npc_dungeon_5.ogg",
            ["Look at these guns! Your guns!"] = "male\\flexBack_1.ogg",
            ["Very impressive."] = "male\\npc_flexBack_1.ogg",
            ["Strong like a gnome!"] = "male\\flexBack_2.ogg",
            ["Don't hurt yourself."] = "male\\npc_flexBack_2.ogg",
            ["We are so mighty."] = "male\\flexBack_3.ogg",
            ["Put those away before someone gets hurt."] = "male\\npc_flexBack_3.ogg",
            ["New gear! And it fits me perfectly. Funny how that works."] = "male\\gear_1.ogg",
            ["That looks good on you."] = "male\\npc_gear_1.ogg",
            ["Ooh, shiny! We look fantastic."] = "male\\gear_2.ogg",
            ["New armor? Very sharp."] = "male\\npc_gear_2.ogg",
            ["Do you like it? I like it. We have great taste."] = "male\\gear_3.ogg",
            ["You'll turn heads in that."] = "male\\npc_gear_3.ogg",
            ["Check us out! Spin for the crowd!"] = "male\\gear_4.ogg",
            ["Shiny! Did you polish that yourself?"] = "male\\npc_gear_4.ogg",
            ["That's a good look on us. A very good look."] = "male\\gear_5.ogg",
            ["That suits you. Very heroic."] = "male\\npc_gear_5.ogg",
            ["New armor? I feel sturdier already."] = "male\\gear_6.ogg",
            ["Now you look the part."] = "male\\npc_gear_6.ogg",
            ["Ooh la la."] = "male\\gear_7.ogg",
            ["Matching outfits! Always matching outfits!"] = "male\\gear_8.ogg",
            ["I'd say it brings out my eyes, but they're your eyes."] = "male\\gear_9.ogg",
            ["Fancy! Should we go show somebody?"] = "male\\gear_10.ogg",
            ["Corpse run! My favorite. Not my favorite."] = "male\\ghost_1.ogg",
            ["Come on, your body's this way."] = "male\\npc_ghost_1.ogg",
            ["I can see through my hands! Our hands!"] = "male\\ghost_2.ogg",
            ["I'll walk with you. Don't mind the chill."] = "male\\npc_ghost_2.ogg",
            ["Which way was the body again?"] = "male\\ghost_3.ogg",
            ["You look a bit see-through. It's fine. Mostly fine."] = "male\\npc_ghost_3.ogg",
            ["Spooky. I feel very spooky right now."] = "male\\ghost_4.ogg",
            ["Follow the road. I'll be right here."] = "male\\npc_ghost_4.ogg",
            ["Walk it off, {name}. Literally."] = "male\\ghost_5.ogg",
            ["Is it cold, being a ghost? You look cold."] = "male\\npc_ghost_5.ogg",
            ["Being a ghost is fine. It's the walking I mind."] = "male\\ghost_6.ogg",
            ["Hi, {name}! It's me, you! Well, a smaller you."] = "male\\greet_1.ogg",
            ["Ahoy, matey! Room for one more in your crew?"] = "male\\lore12997_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are! Eaten yet? We can put that right before we go."] = "male\\lore13018_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Oh! I know you. Are we going somewhere together?"] = "male\\lore14041_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Come and have a look, my friend. I have an awkward stone and a very small tower. Your suggestion may be just what it needs. Or we can walk while I explain the difficulty in considerable detail."] = "male\\lore273065_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. I'd know those footsteps anywhere. Shall we see what we can hear today?"] = "male\\lore274917_greet_1.ogg",
            ["An outing? Fine. Try to return looking much as you do now. Gaxim will ask questions."] = "male\\lore4081_greet_1.ogg",
            ["You have come back. Good. Have something worth asking, and we may make useful progress. The yellow ribbon is not the subject of today's inquiry. It marks my place. I recommend the practice to anyone who wishes to survive being interrupted quite so frequently."] = "male\\lore460_greet_1.ogg",
            ["A practical excursion. Excellent. Theory benefits from the occasional walk."] = "male\\lore5174_greet_1.ogg",
            ["I've packed the essentials. If we need a drawer, we'll have to improvise."] = "male\\lore5175_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Out we go. I can finish that calculation while we walk. Unless something more interesting turns up, which it very well might."] = "male\\lore5518_greet_1.ogg",
            ["A walk sounds good. If you hear me keeping time, don't mind it. The stockroom's a very musical place when nobody's looking."] = "male\\lore5519_greet_1.ogg",
            ["An outing! Splendid. We may find something worth celebrating before we're back."] = "male\\lore5569_greet_1.ogg",
            ["An outing! Splendid! I may have a thought or two along the way. Or twelve!"] = "male\\lore6169_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Ready! If anyone asks, my hair was considerably taller than this."] = "male\\lore6569_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Shall we? I could use a look at something beyond these plans. Tell me what catches your eye."] = "male\\lore7937_greet_1.ogg",
            ["An excursion! Excellent. There is always something beyond the workbench worth understanding."] = "male\\lore7944_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Ready. Have we packed everything? Check once more. Then we can be ready properly."] = "male\\lore7950_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Lead the way, {name}."] = "male\\npc_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Ready for an adventure, {name}? I packed snacks. Tiny ones."] = "male\\greet_2.ogg",
            ["Glad to come along, {name}!"] = "male\\npc_greet_2.ogg",
            ["There you are, {name}! I was starting to think you'd gone without me."] = "male\\greet_3.ogg",
            ["Where are we off to today?"] = "male\\npc_greet_3.ogg",
            ["Hello again, {name}! Same armor, same face, half the height."] = "male\\greet_4.ogg",
            ["I told the others I'd be out for a while. Let's make it count."] = "male\\npc_greet_4.ogg",
            ["Reporting for duty! Pocket-sized, fully charged."] = "male\\greet_5.ogg",
            ["It's good to get away from the counter for once."] = "male\\npc_greet_5.ogg",
            ["Good to see you, {name}! Shall we go befriend somebody?"] = "male\\greet_6.ogg",
            ["Ready when you are, {name}."] = "male\\npc_greet_6.ogg",
            ["I polished my boots while you were gone. Well, your boots. Our boots."] = "male\\greet_7.ogg",
            ["Some fresh air will do me good."] = "male\\npc_greet_7.ogg",
            ["Oh good, you're back. I ran out of things to say to myself."] = "male\\greet_8.ogg",
            ["Don't walk too fast. I'm not used to all this adventuring."] = "male\\npc_greet_8.ogg",
            ["Ta-da! Your favorite gnome, at your service."] = "male\\greet_9.ogg",
            ["Well met, {name}! Good to see a friendly face."] = "male\\npc_greet_9.ogg",
            ["Let's make today a good one, {name}."] = "male\\greet_10.ogg",
            ["Right behind you. Where to first?"] = "male\\npc_greet_10.ogg",
            ["I dreamed we were tall. It was terrifying."] = "male\\greet_11.ogg",
            ["I packed a lunch. Just in case."] = "male\\npc_greet_11.ogg",
            ["Back in action! Where to first?"] = "male\\greet_12.ogg",
            ["Off on an adventure! Don't tell my boss."] = "male\\npc_greet_12.ogg",
            ["Hey hey! Did you miss me? Don't answer that."] = "male\\greet_13.ogg",
            ["Fresh boots, fresh start. Let's go."] = "male\\npc_greet_13.ogg",
            ["You look great today. I would know. I look exactly like you."] = "male\\greet_14.ogg",
            ["I've been looking forward to this all week."] = "male\\npc_greet_14.ogg",
            ["Another day, another adventure, another friend to make!"] = "male\\greet_15.ogg",
            ["Stretching! Gnome legs need a warm-up."] = "male\\greet_16.ogg",
            ["Good afternoon, {name}! Perfect time for a little wandering."] = "male\\greetAfternoon_1.ogg",
            ["Afternoon! I've been saving up chatter all morning."] = "male\\greetAfternoon_2.ogg",
            ["Evening, {name}! Perfect time for a little adventuring."] = "male\\greetEvening_1.ogg",
            ["The lamps are coming on. Cozy adventuring hours!"] = "male\\greetEvening_2.ogg",
            ["A whole evening ahead of us. Let's not waste it."] = "male\\greetEvening_3.ogg",
            ["Good morning, {name}! The early gnome gets the worm. I don't want the worm."] = "male\\greetMorning_1.ogg",
            ["Morning already? I just got comfortable."] = "male\\greetMorning_2.ogg",
            ["Rise and shine! Somebody out there needs a friend today."] = "male\\greetMorning_3.ogg",
            ["A fresh morning, a fresh start. Let's go meet people!"] = "male\\greetMorning_4.ogg",
            ["Up late, {name}? Me too. I'm always up when you're up."] = "male\\greetNight_1.ogg",
            ["Night owls, the both of us. Hoo hoo."] = "male\\greetNight_2.ogg",
            ["It's late! Just one more quest. Then another. You know how it goes."] = "male\\greetNight_3.ogg",
            ["The best friendships are made after midnight. I read that somewhere. Maybe."] = "male\\greetNight_4.ogg",
            ["A group! More friends! This is the best day."] = "male\\group_1.ogg",
            ["More company! Wonderful."] = "male\\npc_group_1.ogg",
            ["Ooh, company! Hi, everyone. I'm the small one."] = "male\\group_2.ogg",
            ["Strength in numbers."] = "male\\npc_group_2.ogg",
            ["Party time! The other kind of party."] = "male\\group_3.ogg",
            ["New faces! Hello, everyone."] = "male\\npc_group_3.ogg",
            ["Teamwork makes the dream work. And the quests go faster."] = "male\\group_4.ogg",
            ["A whole party. Now it's an adventure."] = "male\\npc_group_4.ogg",
            ["New group! I'll try not to steal the spotlight."] = "male\\group_5.ogg",
            ["Home, here we come!"] = "male\\hearth_1.ogg",
            ["Home again!"] = "male\\npc_hearth_1.ogg",
            ["Hearthing! See you there. Well, I'll see you everywhere."] = "male\\hearth_2.ogg",
            ["Off to the inn. My treat. Well, your treat."] = "male\\npc_hearth_2.ogg",
            ["Back to the inn! I call the comfy chair."] = "male\\hearth_3.ogg",
            ["Home sweet home."] = "male\\npc_hearth_3.ogg",
            ["Poof! I love that part."] = "male\\hearth_4.ogg",
            ["Back to a warm bed. Finally."] = "male\\npc_hearth_4.ogg",
            ["Aww! Hug accepted!"] = "male\\hugged_1.ogg",
            ["Oh! Well. That's nice."] = "male\\npc_hugged_1.ogg",
            ["You're the best, {name}."] = "male\\hugged_2.ogg",
            ["Aw, thank you."] = "male\\npc_hugged_2.ogg",
            ["A hug! From me, to me!"] = "male\\hugged_3.ogg",
            ["Oh, you big softie."] = "male\\npc_hugged_3.ogg",
            ["Did you know gnomes invented most things? Look it up. Actually, don't."] = "male\\idle_1.ogg",
            ["Count the crew before you leave. Then look back for anyone you missed."] = "male\\lore12997_idle_1.ogg",
            ["People will try all sorts on an adventure, then get fussy about lunch."] = "male\\lore13018_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A little cheese, a place to sit, someone to talk to. That's a good afternoon."] = "male\\lore14041_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The awkward stone is my favorite. It has brought down several towers. I keep trying it again because I want to know where it will fit. A very small problem can occupy a very pleasant afternoon."] = "male\\lore273065_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Rain against a window. That's my favorite. Yes, really. You don't have to invent a better sound than that."] = "male\\lore274917_idle_1.ogg",
            ["That old note? Useful scrap. No, you can't have it. I haven't finished finding a use for it."] = "male\\lore4081_idle_1.ogg",
            ["It is a ribbon. An ordinary, bright yellow ribbon. I can find the page at once when I return to my reading. If that disappoints your expectations of forbidden mysteries, you are welcome to consider the terrible secrets of not wasting my time."] = "male\\lore460_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Cold tea again. I may have explained the principle rather more thoroughly than necessary."] = "male\\lore5174_idle_1.ogg",
            ["This wooden puzzle is clearly missing a gear. No, I haven't proved that."] = "male\\lore5175_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The bread carrier required three pages. The basket required a handle. Yes, I took the basket. I still enjoyed the three pages."] = "male\\lore5518_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I wasn't drumming. I was checking the tins. Thoroughly. In a rather catchy sequence. Yes, all right, I was drumming."] = "male\\lore5519_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The best part? When the light catches everyone's faces. You can't put that in a box."] = "male\\lore5569_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I meant to say thank you calmly. Then I saw what they'd brought me. Impossible!"] = "male\\lore6169_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A comb? Certainly. One must be prepared for a scientific breakthrough."] = "male\\lore6569_idle_1.ogg",
            ["It's only a little doorway in the margin. No mechanism. Sometimes I like to draw something that simply lets people in."] = "male\\lore7937_idle_1.ogg",
            ["If Techbot can be put right, I think welcome back will be quite enough of a speech."] = "male\\lore7944_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Yes, I copied the little drawing too. Some things matter without being useful."] = "male\\lore7950_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Nice day for it."] = "male\\npc_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Your armor looks great on me. On you. On us."] = "male\\idle_2.ogg",
            ["{zone} is lovely this time of year."] = "male\\npc_idle_2.ogg",
            ["Is it just me, or is everything really tall today?"] = "male\\idle_3.ogg",
            ["Don't mind me. I'm enjoying the company."] = "male\\npc_idle_3.ogg",
            ["If you need me, I'll be right here. Standing. Being adorable."] = "male\\idle_4.ogg",
            ["You know, I don't get out nearly enough."] = "male\\npc_idle_4.ogg",
            ["{zone} sure is nice this time of year."] = "male\\idle_5.ogg",
            ["My feet are already sore. In a good way."] = "male\\npc_idle_5.ogg",
            ["Fun fact: I'm exactly as brave as you are, just closer to the ground."] = "male\\idle_6.ogg",
            ["I wonder how things are back home without me."] = "male\\npc_idle_6.ogg",
            ["Let's go make some friends! I'll do the waving."] = "male\\idle_7.ogg",
            ["Every road looks different when you're not working."] = "male\\npc_idle_7.ogg",
            ["We've made {friends} friends so far. Who's next?"] = "male\\idle_8.ogg",
            ["Have you ever just stopped and listened to the wind?"] = "male\\npc_idle_8.ogg",
            ["Just practicing my moves."] = "male\\idle_9.ogg",
            ["I could get used to this."] = "male\\npc_idle_9.ogg",
            ["I wonder what the gryphons think about all day."] = "male\\idle_10.ogg",
            ["Don't tell anyone, but this beats standing in one spot all day."] = "male\\npc_idle_10.ogg",
            ["Somewhere out there, a merchant is waiting to be our best friend."] = "male\\idle_11.ogg",
            ["If you need a hand, just say the word."] = "male\\npc_idle_11.ogg",
            ["Gnomish proverb: the smaller the gnome, the bigger the plan."] = "male\\idle_12.ogg",
            ["Good company makes the miles shorter."] = "male\\npc_idle_12.ogg",
            ["Do you think I could ride a squirrel? Asking for me."] = "male\\idle_13.ogg",
            ["Mind if I stretch? Old bones."] = "male\\npc_idle_13.ogg",
            ["Hmm. Hmmmm. Nope, lost the thought."] = "male\\idle_14.ogg",
            ["Getting late. The stars will be out soon."] = "male\\npc_idle_14.ogg",
            ["I counted the clouds. There were some."] = "male\\idle_15.ogg",
            ["Quiet night. I like quiet nights."] = "male\\npc_idle_15.ogg",
            ["Sometimes I think about Gnomeregan. Then I think about something nicer."] = "male\\idle_16.ogg",
            ["We've been at it for a while. You're tireless, you know that?"] = "male\\npc_idle_16.ogg",
            ["If I had a coin for every step I take, I'd have a lot of very tiny coins."] = "male\\idle_17.ogg",
            ["I used to wonder what was past the next hill. Now I know: another hill."] = "male\\npc_idle_17.ogg",
            ["Look at us. A matching set!"] = "male\\idle_18.ogg",
            ["Do you ever get used to all this walking?"] = "male\\npc_idle_18.ogg",
            ["I tried being tall once. Hated it. Too much weather up there."] = "male\\idle_19.ogg",
            ["I've heard stories about you, you know. Some of them are even nice."] = "male\\npc_idle_19.ogg",
            ["You know what this place needs? More gnomes."] = "male\\idle_20.ogg",
            ["Smell that? Somebody's cooking something good nearby."] = "male\\npc_idle_20.ogg",
            ["Every NPC is just a friend we haven't met yet."] = "male\\idle_21.ogg",
            ["If anyone asks, I'm on important business."] = "male\\npc_idle_21.ogg",
            ["I've been practicing my /bow. Want to see? Too late, I'm shy now."] = "male\\idle_22.ogg",
            ["You're easy company. I mean that kindly."] = "male\\npc_idle_22.ogg",
            ["Fact: no one has ever regretted making a friend. Except maybe with murlocs."] = "male\\idle_23.ogg",
            ["I keep thinking I left something on the stove."] = "male\\npc_idle_23.ogg",
            ["I'd tell you a joke about engineering, but it might explode."] = "male\\idle_24.ogg",
            ["Look at that sky."] = "male\\npc_idle_24.ogg",
            ["Sing it with me! La la la. You're not singing."] = "male\\idle_25.ogg",
            ["Back home they'll never believe where I've been."] = "male\\npc_idle_25.ogg",
            ["If you're not using that backpack, I could live in it."] = "male\\idle_26.ogg",
            ["I should have brought a better pair of boots."] = "male\\npc_idle_26.ogg",
            ["Wouldn't it be nice if every road went downhill?"] = "male\\idle_27.ogg",
            ["Funny how a quiet road can feel like a holiday."] = "male\\npc_idle_27.ogg",
            ["Somebody somewhere is having a very good day. Let's be them."] = "male\\idle_28.ogg",
            ["Do adventurers ever take a day off? Asking for a friend. The friend is me."] = "male\\npc_idle_28.ogg",
            ["Thinking about lunch. Thinking about second lunch."] = "male\\idle_29.ogg",
            ["I've counted twelve birds since we set out. Thirteen. Never mind."] = "male\\npc_idle_29.ogg",
            ["Our {class} skills are really coming along. Mostly yours."] = "male\\idle_30.ogg",
            ["One of these days you'll have to tell me how you got started."] = "male\\npc_idle_30.ogg",
            ["Remember when you were a {race}? I'm still getting used to the ears."] = "male\\idle_31.ogg",
            ["You can tell a lot about someone by how they walk. You walk like you mean it."] = "male\\npc_idle_31.ogg",
            ["Mages always say the best adventures start with a portal. Or a fireball. Mostly a fireball."] = "male\\idle_32.ogg",
            ["I'm not complaining. I'm just saying my feet have opinions."] = "male\\npc_idle_32.ogg",
            ["Is it hard keeping track of all that mana? I can barely keep track of my socks."] = "male\\idle_33.ogg",
            ["Sorry, I've had the same tune stuck in my head all day."] = "male\\npc_idle_33.ogg",
            ["One day you'll have to teach me to make water. I'd only use it for good."] = "male\\idle_34.ogg",
            ["If we pass a merchant, remind me I need thread."] = "male\\npc_idle_34.ogg",
            ["Your shield is bigger than I am. I find that comforting."] = "male\\idle_35.ogg",
            ["I wonder what the folks back home are gossiping about."] = "male\\npc_idle_35.ogg",
            ["Every time you charge, I get a little dizzy."] = "male\\idle_36.ogg",
            ["Every time I think I've seen it all, you take me somewhere new."] = "male\\npc_idle_36.ogg",
            ["The Light is warm today. Or that's just the sun."] = "male\\idle_37.ogg",
            ["It's peaceful out here. Until it isn't."] = "male\\npc_idle_37.ogg",
            ["I'm trying to look holy. Is it working?"] = "male\\idle_38.ogg",
            ["I could do with a cup of something warm."] = "male\\npc_idle_38.ogg",
            ["I bet you could heal a paper cut from across the room."] = "male\\idle_39.ogg",
            ["Morning air's the best air."] = "male\\npc_idle_39.ogg",
            ["I promise I'm not hiding. I'm just short."] = "male\\idle_40.ogg",
            ["Early start, eh? I approve."] = "male\\npc_idle_40.ogg",
            ["Quick, teach me how to stealth! Am I invisible? I feel invisible."] = "male\\idle_41.ogg",
            ["The light's going gold. Best time of day."] = "male\\npc_idle_41.ogg",
            ["Where's your pet? I want to pet the pet."] = "male\\idle_42.ogg",
            ["Stars are out. Makes you feel small, doesn't it?"] = "male\\npc_idle_42.ogg",
            ["Every time a bow twangs, I duck. Old habit."] = "male\\idle_43.ogg",
            ["Shouldn't we both be in bed by now?"] = "male\\npc_idle_43.ogg",
            ["Your imp keeps looking at me funny."] = "male\\idle_44.ogg",
            ["Long day. Good day, though."] = "male\\npc_idle_44.ogg",
            ["Are the shards in your bag supposed to whisper?"] = "male\\idle_45.ogg",
            ["Still going? I'll say this for you: you don't quit."] = "male\\npc_idle_45.ogg",
            ["Can you turn into a squirrel? I'd ride a squirrel."] = "male\\idle_46.ogg",
            ["The trees here like you. I can tell."] = "male\\idle_47.ogg",
            ["The elements say hello. Well, the wind does. Constantly."] = "male\\idle_48.ogg",
            ["It's quiet. Too quiet. Wait, that's just Westfall."] = "male\\idle_49.ogg",
            ["Those harvest golems give me the creeps."] = "male\\idle_50.ogg",
            ["Smell that? Fresh Elwynn air. And a little bit of kobold."] = "male\\idle_51.ogg",
            ["So many guards in Stormwind. Good thing we're charming."] = "male\\idle_52.ogg",
            ["Ironforge! The ceilings are high enough even for you."] = "male\\idle_53.ogg",
            ["Brr! Dun Morogh never warms up, does it?"] = "male\\idle_54.ogg",
            ["Somewhere under all this snow is Gnomeregan. I'm not going back."] = "male\\idle_55.ogg",
            ["Duskwood always feels like someone's watching us."] = "male\\idle_56.ogg",
            ["Redridge! Gnolls everywhere, and every one of them grumpy."] = "male\\idle_57.ogg",
            ["Loch Modan is so pretty. Let's never go swimming in it."] = "male\\idle_58.ogg",
            ["The trees in Teldrassil are so tall I'm getting a neck ache."] = "male\\idle_59.ogg",
            ["Darnassus is lovely, but I keep getting lost."] = "male\\idle_60.ogg",
            ["The Wetlands! My boots are already soggy."] = "male\\idle_61.ogg",
            ["Stranglethorn is loud. Every bush has an opinion."] = "male\\idle_62.ogg",
            ["The Barrens. There's a lot of it, isn't there."] = "male\\idle_63.ogg",
            ["It's late. The stars are out. Even gnomes get sleepy."] = "male\\idle_64.ogg",
            ["Nice morning for it. Whatever it is."] = "male\\idle_65.ogg",
            ["Evening light makes everything look heroic. Including me."] = "male\\idle_66.ogg",
            ["We've been at it for a while now. Stretch break?"] = "male\\idle_67.ogg",
            ["Two hours in! You're a legend. I'm a tiny legend."] = "male\\idle_68.ogg",
            ["Still going strong! Should we hydrate? I'll hydrate."] = "male\\idle_69.ogg",
            ["Low level, big dreams. That's the gnome way."] = "male\\idle_70.ogg",
            ["We're getting good at this. Like, really good."] = "male\\idle_71.ogg",
            ["Ha! Okay, my turn. Why did the gnome cross the road? To be on the other side, which was taller."] = "male\\jokeBack_1.ogg",
            ["Ha! I'll have to remember that one."] = "male\\npc_jokeBack_1.ogg",
            ["Heh. Classic."] = "male\\jokeBack_2.ogg",
            ["Oh, that's terrible. Tell it again."] = "male\\npc_jokeBack_2.ogg",
            ["I'm stealing that one."] = "male\\npc_jokeBack_3.ogg",
            ["Oh! Oh my. I'm blushing."] = "male\\kissed_1.ogg",
            ["Oh my."] = "male\\npc_kissed_1.ogg",
