            ["Aw, don't be shy."] = "male\\shyToo_1.ogg",
            ["Aw, don't hide."] = "male\\npc_shyToo_2.ogg",
            ["I get shy too sometimes."] = "male\\shyToo_2.ogg",
            ["You're among friends here."] = "male\\npc_shyToo_3.ogg",
            ["Don't mind if I do."] = "male\\npc_sitToo_1.ogg",
            ["Break time! I'll sit too."] = "male\\sitToo_1.ogg",
            ["Good idea. My knees agree."] = "male\\npc_sitToo_2.ogg",
            ["Ahh, feels good to sit."] = "male\\sitToo_2.ogg",
            ["Ah, that's better."] = "male\\npc_sitToo_3.ogg",
            ["I could use a nap myself."] = "male\\npc_sleepToo_1.ogg",
            ["Nap time? Nap time."] = "male\\sleepToo_1.ogg",
            ["Wake me when it's time to go."] = "male\\npc_sleepToo_2.ogg",
            ["Good idea. Zzz."] = "male\\sleepToo_2.ogg",
            ["A nap does sound nice."] = "male\\npc_sleepToo_3.ogg",
            ["Should we be late, please make certain someone knows where to look."] = "male\\lore6569_taxi_1.ogg",
            ["Up we go! Never gets old."] = "male\\npc_taxi_1.ogg",
            ["Wheee! I love flying!"] = "male\\taxi_1.ogg",
            ["Look at it all down there."] = "male\\npc_taxi_2.ogg",
            ["Look how small everything is down there! Finally, I fit in."] = "male\\taxi_2.ogg",
            ["A good gryphon is worth its weight in gold."] = "male\\npc_taxi_3.ogg",
            ["Gryphon rides are the best. Don't look down. Okay, look down."] = "male\\taxi_3.ogg",
            ["Hold on tight!"] = "male\\npc_taxi_4.ogg",
            ["We're flying! Hold on to your hat. Our hat."] = "male\\taxi_4.ogg",
            ["I'll never get tired of this view."] = "male\\npc_taxi_5.ogg",
            ["Somebody wave at the people below for me!"] = "male\\taxi_5.ogg",
            ["Don't look down. Actually, do. It's lovely."] = "male\\npc_taxi_6.ogg",
            ["Is it rude to sing on a gryphon? I'm going to sing."] = "male\\taxi_6.ogg",
            ["The wind up here! Hold on to your hat."] = "male\\npc_taxi_7.ogg",
            ["Up here, everyone's tiny. I like it."] = "male\\taxi_7.ogg",
            ["If I fall off, remember me fondly."] = "male\\taxi_8.ogg",
            ["This is the life. Wind in our hair, bugs in our teeth."] = "male\\taxi_9.ogg",
            ["Next stop, adventure!"] = "male\\taxi_10.ogg",
            ["Anytime."] = "male\\npc_thanked_1.ogg",
            ["Aw, you're welcome!"] = "male\\thanked_1.ogg",
            ["Happy to help."] = "male\\npc_thanked_2.ogg",
            ["Anytime, {name}!"] = "male\\thanked_2.ogg",
            ["Don't mention it."] = "male\\npc_thanked_3.ogg",
            ["Don't mention it. Or do. I like it."] = "male\\thanked_3.ogg",
            ["{friend} thinks of you as {tier} now. I'm not surprised."] = "male\\npc_tier_1.ogg",
            ["Hear that? We're {tier} to {friend} now!"] = "male\\tier_1.ogg",
            ["Making friends everywhere you go, aren't you?"] = "male\\npc_tier_2.ogg",
            ["{friend} thinks of us as {tier}. I knew they would!"] = "male\\tier_2.ogg",
            ["People really warm to you, don't they?"] = "male\\npc_tier_3.ogg",
            ["{tier}! {friend} really likes us!"] = "male\\tier_3.ogg",
            ["That friendship's growing. Nice to see."] = "male\\npc_tier_4.ogg",
            ["Look at that. {friend} counts us as {tier}. We're so likable."] = "male\\tier_4.ogg",
            ["Friendship with {friend} just went up a notch!"] = "male\\tier_5.ogg",
            ["{friend} and us. {tier}. Has a nice ring to it."] = "male\\tier_6.ogg",
            ["Hello!"] = "male\\npc_waveBack_1.ogg",
            ["Hi! Hi! Hello!"] = "male\\waveBack_1.ogg",
            ["Hi there!"] = "male\\npc_waveBack_2.ogg",
            ["Hello to you too!"] = "male\\waveBack_2.ogg",
            ["Well, hello to you too."] = "male\\npc_waveBack_3.ogg",
            ["Waving back! I'm waving back!"] = "male\\waveBack_3.ogg",
            ["Right back at you!"] = "male\\npc_waveBack_4.ogg",
            ["Hiya, {name}!"] = "male\\waveBack_4.ogg",
            ["Somewhere new. Give me a moment. I want to hear what it's like before we rush through it."] = "male\\lore274917_zone_1.ogg",
            ["So this is {zone}."] = "male\\npc_zone_1.ogg",
            ["{zone}! I've always wanted to see {zone}."] = "male\\zone_1.ogg",
            ["{zone}, eh? Lead on."] = "male\\npc_zone_2.ogg",
            ["Ooh, {zone}. Keep an eye out for new friends!"] = "male\\zone_2.ogg",
            ["I haven't been to {zone} in years."] = "male\\npc_zone_3.ogg",
            ["So this is {zone}. It's bigger from down here."] = "male\\zone_3.ogg",
            ["{zone}. Stay sharp."] = "male\\npc_zone_4.ogg",
            ["Welcome to {zone}! I'll be your tiny tour guide."] = "male\\zone_4.ogg",
            ["Ah, {zone}. Look at that view."] = "male\\npc_zone_5.ogg",
            ["{zone}. I've heard stories. Mostly good ones."] = "male\\zone_5.ogg",
            ["New place, new faces."] = "male\\npc_zone_6.ogg",
            ["New place, new people! Let's say hi to everyone in {zone}."] = "male\\zone_6.ogg",
            ["Keep your eyes open. I don't know these parts."] = "male\\npc_zone_7.ogg",
            ["Mark it down: we've been to {zone}!"] = "male\\zone_7.ogg",
            ["I've only ever heard stories about this place."] = "male\\npc_zone_8.ogg",
            ["{zone}! Smell that? That's adventure. Or a farm."] = "male\\zone_8.ogg",
            ["Look at it all. Worth the walk."] = "male\\npc_zone_9.ogg",
            ["Is it me, or does {zone} feel friendly?"] = "male\\zone_9.ogg",
            ["Smells different here. Not bad, just different."] = "male\\npc_zone_10.ogg",
            ["Westfall! Watch out for the Defias. And the dust."] = "male\\zone_10.ogg",
            ["I'd better remember the way back."] = "male\\npc_zone_11.ogg",
            ["Home sweet Stormwind!"] = "male\\zone_11.ogg",
            ["Well, this is a change of scenery."] = "male\\npc_zone_12.ogg",
            ["Ironforge! Short ceilings for everyone else, perfect for us."] = "male\\zone_12.ogg",
            ["Duskwood. Let's stay close to the lanterns."] = "male\\zone_13.ogg",
            ["Dun Morogh! I should have brought a scarf."] = "male\\zone_14.ogg",
            ["Elwynn Forest, where every adventure starts."] = "male\\zone_15.ogg",
        },
        ["nightelf-female"] = {
            ["Welcome back!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_alive_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Gave me a fright."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_alive_2.ogg",
            ["Back on your feet! Good."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_alive_3.ogg",
            ["Good as new. Well, nearly."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_alive_4.ogg",
            ["Don't scare me like that again."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_alive_5.ogg",
            ["Bravo!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_applaudToo_1.ogg",
            ["Well done!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_applaudToo_2.ogg",
            ["Encore!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_applaudToo_3.ogg",
            ["I'll wait here."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_away_1.ogg",
            ["Take your time. I'm not going anywhere."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_away_2.ogg",
            ["I'll keep an eye on things."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_away_3.ogg",
            ["Off you go. I'll mind the spot."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_away_4.ogg",
            ["Wake me if anything exciting happens."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_away_5.ogg",
            ["There you are."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_back_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_back_2.ogg",
            ["Ah, you're back. Shall we?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_back_3.ogg",
            ["Ah, good. I was starting to talk to myself."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_back_4.ogg",
            ["Ready? Me too."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_back_5.ogg",
            ["Your bags are bursting. Time to sell a few things."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_bagsFull_1.ogg",
            ["No room left? I know a merchant or two."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_bagsFull_2.ogg",
            ["You're carrying half the countryside."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_bagsFull_3.ogg",
            ["Your pack's going to split at the seams."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_bagsFull_4.ogg",
            ["You have brought me questions, news, and company I have come to value. Come along, friend. I would like to see what catches your attention beyond the shore. You need not return with an extraordinary tale every time. I enjoy hearing about an ordinary day when it has you in it."] = "nightelf-female\\lore10118_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have made room for a little company among all the tasks that need doing. I appreciate that more than you may realize. Come along. We can take a walk with no delivery at the end. If I stop to examine every plant, you may gently remind me of the plan."] = "nightelf-female\\lore2083_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would welcome your company, my friend. Lead on. We have time to look around us, and I should like to hear what you find pleasing along the way."] = "nightelf-female\\lore270581_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would be glad to walk with you. You have given me reason to trust your company, and it is pleasant to speak without making every moment a lesson. Tell me what you have enjoyed today. We can leave the drills for another time."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3593_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would welcome the chance to accompany you. There is much to notice beyond the questions brought to my door, and I have come to value how you see things. Tell me what is on your mind. We need not make every conversation an instruction."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3595_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I welcome beside the roost even when there is no journey to arrange. Come along, friend. We can enjoy the company without hurrying to the next destination. If you hear a rather grand introduction while no passenger is waiting, you may smile. I am simply making my good opinion known again."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3841_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have made these little moments familiar, and I find myself looking forward to them. Come along. You can tell me what is on your mind, or we can leave it quiet for a while. I am glad you are here."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3955_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I am happy to walk beside after the equipment has been put right. Come along, friend. We can enjoy the road without preparing an audience first. If you catch me looking rather pleased with a heroic pose of my own, you may grin. I shall know exactly what you have noticed."] = "nightelf-female\\lore4164_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Someone who remembers there is more to me than the next lesson. I am glad you came. Let us enjoy the road together."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5499_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["A friend to share the discoveries with. I am glad. Come along. You may notice something I would have walked past."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5503_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You listen, and you ask something worth answering. I find myself looking forward to your visits. Come along, my friend."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5566_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would be glad to come along. Your company has become something I look forward to, and it is pleasant to share a little more of the day. Tell me where we are going. I may have something for us to eat when we pause."] = "nightelf-female\\lore8583_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Likewise."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_bowBack_1.ogg",
            ["An honor."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_bowBack_2.ogg",
            ["The pleasure's mine."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_bowBack_3.ogg",
            ["{friend} is your Buddy now? The more the merrier!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_buddy_1.ogg",
            ["Another Buddy. Should I be jealous?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_buddy_2.ogg",
            ["Another Buddy! Your circle's getting crowded."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_buddy_3.ogg",
            ["Good choice. I'd vouch for them."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_buddy_4.ogg",
            ["Hooray!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_cheerAlong_1.ogg",
            ["Huzzah!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_cheerAlong_2.ogg",
            ["Three cheers!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_cheerAlong_3.ogg",
            ["Who are you calling chicken?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_chickenBack_1.ogg",
            ["Bawk yourself."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_chickenBack_2.ogg",
            ["I'm brave! I'm just brave quietly."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_chickenBack_3.ogg",
            ["Well fought!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatEnd_1.ogg",
            ["That's how it's done."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatEnd_2.ogg",
            ["Everyone in one piece? Good."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatEnd_3.ogg",
            ["Ha! They won't try that again."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatEnd_4.ogg",
            ["I'll admit, my heart was pounding."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatEnd_5.ogg",
            ["Nicely done."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatEnd_6.ogg",
            ["Is it over? It's over. Good."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatEnd_7.ogg",
            ["Remind me never to make you angry."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatEnd_8.ogg",
            ["Not bad at all!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatEnd_9.ogg",
            ["Victory! I'll be telling everyone about that one."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatEnd_10.ogg",
            ["Catch your breath. You earned it."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatEnd_11.ogg",
            ["And not a scratch on me. Thanks to you."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatEnd_12.ogg",
            ["Hold on, it's weakening!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatLong_1.ogg",
            ["Don't give up now!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatLong_2.ogg",
            ["Steady. Steady."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatLong_3.ogg",
            ["This one's stubborn. Keep at it!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatLong_4.ogg",
            ["It's tiring! I can see it!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatLong_5.ogg",
            ["Long fight. You've got more in you."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatLong_6.ogg",
            ["Keep at it!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_1.ogg",
            ["Good hit!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_2.ogg",
            ["Watch your back!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_3.ogg",
            ["That's it, that's it!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_4.ogg",
            ["You've got it on the run!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_5.ogg",
            ["Don't let up!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_6.ogg",
            ["Ha! Did you see that?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_7.ogg",
            ["Nearly there!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_8.ogg",
            ["Hit it again!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_9.ogg",
            ["It's on its last legs!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_10.ogg",
            ["Mind your footing!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_11.ogg",
            ["That one's going to leave a mark!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_12.ogg",
            ["Go on! Go on!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_13.ogg",
            ["You make this look like a dance!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_14.ogg",
            ["Swing that blade! Go on!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_15.ogg",
            ["Into the thick of it! That's the way!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_16.ogg",
            ["The Light's with you! Now hit it!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_17.ogg",
            ["Let your pet have a go!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_18.ogg",
            ["Nice shot! Right on target!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_19.ogg",
            ["Where'd you go? Oh! There you are! Stab it!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_20.ogg",
            ["Patch yourself up, then smite it!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_21.ogg",
            ["Call the storm down on it!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_22.ogg",
            ["Burn it! Burn it all! Well, just that one."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_23.ogg",
            ["Whatever that green fire is, keep doing it!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_24.ogg",
            ["Turn into something big and scary!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatMid_25.ogg",
            ["Look out!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatStart_1.ogg",
            ["Here they come!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatStart_2.ogg",
            ["Give them what for!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatStart_3.ogg",
            ["Stay sharp!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatStart_4.ogg",
            ["On your guard!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatStart_5.ogg",
            ["Here we go again!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatStart_6.ogg",
            ["Watch it, it's coming right at you!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatStart_7.ogg",
            ["Show them what you've got!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_combatStart_8.ogg",
            ["Thank you. There are times when worry leaves very little room for anything else. It helps to have someone stop beside me and listen. You need not promise that everything will be easy. Your kindness is something I can feel here and now, and I am grateful for it."] = "nightelf-female\\lore8583_comforted_1.ogg",
            ["Chin up. It'll be all right."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_comforted_1.ogg",
            ["I'm here if you need me."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_comforted_2.ogg",
            ["Thank you. I needed that."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_comforted_3.ogg",
            ["Ha! All right, I'll dance."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_danceAlong_1.ogg",
            ["I haven't danced in ages!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_danceAlong_2.ogg",
            ["Well, if you insist!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_danceAlong_3.ogg",
            ["Watch my feet. Or don't."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_danceAlong_4.ogg",
            ["Easy now. Let's get you back on your feet."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_died_1.ogg",
            ["That looked like it hurt."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_died_2.ogg",
            ["Don't worry. Happens to the best of us."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_died_3.ogg",
            ["We'll come back stronger."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_died_4.ogg",
            ["Oh, that's not good."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_died_5.ogg",
            ["Well. That could have gone better."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_died_6.ogg",
            ["Let's agree that one didn't count."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_died_7.ogg",
            ["Lie still. I'll keep watch."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_died_8.ogg",
            ["Keep close in here."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_dungeon_1.ogg",
            ["I don't like the look of this place."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_dungeon_2.ogg",
            ["Watch your step. And your back."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_dungeon_3.ogg",
            ["It's dark in here. I don't love the dark."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_dungeon_4.ogg",
            ["Stay together. Nobody wander off."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_dungeon_5.ogg",
            ["Very impressive."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_flexBack_1.ogg",
            ["Don't hurt yourself."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_flexBack_2.ogg",
            ["Put those away before someone gets hurt."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_flexBack_3.ogg",
            ["Take a moment to look again. Which detail pleases you? You need not borrow someone else's answer. There is satisfaction in a choice you recognize as your own."] = "nightelf-female\\lore270581_gear_1.ogg",
            ["That looks good on you."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_gear_1.ogg",
            ["New armor? Very sharp."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_gear_2.ogg",
            ["You'll turn heads in that."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_gear_3.ogg",
            ["Shiny! Did you polish that yourself?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_gear_4.ogg",
            ["That suits you. Very heroic."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_gear_5.ogg",
            ["Now you look the part."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_gear_6.ogg",
            ["Come on, your body's this way."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_ghost_1.ogg",
            ["I'll walk with you. Don't mind the chill."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_ghost_2.ogg",
            ["You look a bit see-through. It's fine. Mostly fine."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_ghost_3.ogg",
            ["Follow the road. I'll be right here."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_ghost_4.ogg",
            ["Is it cold, being a ghost? You look cold."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_ghost_5.ogg",
            ["Welcome back. Have you brought news from the mainland, or a story about your latest catch? I would like to hear either. If the fish was larger than your boat, I may ask a question about the boat. I shall try to let you reach the exciting part first."] = "nightelf-female\\lore10118_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome to Dolanaar. If you have brought elixirs, I will gladly look them over. If you have brought a little time to spare, that is welcome too. There is always another useful thing to do. I am trying to remember that a pleasant walk deserves a place among them."] = "nightelf-female\\lore2083_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good to see you, my friend. Shall we walk? There may be something worth a second look along the way. I should enjoy hearing which small detail catches your attention first."] = "nightelf-female\\lore270581_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome. Come ready to pay attention, and we will find something useful to practice. If you saw that little turn, it was a dance step. I am still adding a pace that does not belong. You may be relieved to hear I am not teaching it as a fighting technique."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3593_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, my friend. Bring your questions, and we can consider them together. You have caught me working at a little tangle in this cord. There is no mystery hidden in it. I simply enjoy finding the loop that allows the rest to loosen."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3595_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome. Where does your journey lead? Take a moment to greet the hippogryph before thinking only of the distance ahead. These are proud, swift creatures, and training them is an honor. I like a passenger who notices the wings carrying them. A little courtesy makes a very good beginning to the flight."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3841_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back. There is no need to have a story ready. We can talk as we go, or take a little time to notice where we are. I am happy to have your company without asking you to entertain me."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3955_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome. Looking for equipment, or bringing something back for repair? Tell me what the next journey asks of you. You may try the heroic stance afterward. I am willing to admire it for a moment before asking you to lift your arms and turn. A fine appearance should survive the first comfortable step."] = "nightelf-female\\lore4164_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Outside at last. Come, let us make good use of the time. The lesson can wait until I have seen a little of the day."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5499_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good to see you, my friend. Shall we look around? There is always some little piece of work I have not noticed yet."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5503_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. If we are going out, let us notice something worth asking about. I dislike wasting a good interruption."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5566_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. It is good to see you safely here. Sit a little, if you have time. I seem to have cut one piece of bread larger than the other again, and it would be a shame to leave it without a visitor to give it to."] = "nightelf-female\\lore8583_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Lead the way, {name}."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Glad to come along, {name}!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_greet_2.ogg",
            ["Where are we off to today?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_greet_3.ogg",
            ["I told the others I'd be out for a while. Let's make it count."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_greet_4.ogg",
            ["It's good to get away from the counter for once."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_greet_5.ogg",
            ["Ready when you are, {name}."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_greet_6.ogg",
            ["Some fresh air will do me good."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_greet_7.ogg",
            ["Don't walk too fast. I'm not used to all this adventuring."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_greet_8.ogg",
            ["Well met, {name}! Good to see a friendly face."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_greet_9.ogg",
            ["Right behind you. Where to first?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_greet_10.ogg",
            ["I packed a lunch. Just in case."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_greet_11.ogg",
            ["Off on an adventure! Don't tell my boss."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_greet_12.ogg",
            ["Fresh boots, fresh start. Let's go."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_greet_13.ogg",
            ["I've been looking forward to this all week."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_greet_14.ogg",
            ["More company! Wonderful."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_group_1.ogg",
            ["Strength in numbers."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_group_2.ogg",
            ["New faces! Hello, everyone."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_group_3.ogg",
            ["A whole party. Now it's an adventure."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_group_4.ogg",
            ["Home again!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_hearth_1.ogg",
            ["Off to the inn. My treat. Well, your treat."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_hearth_2.ogg",
            ["Home sweet home."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_hearth_3.ogg",
            ["Back to a warm bed. Finally."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_hearth_4.ogg",
            ["Oh! Well. That's nice."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_hugged_1.ogg",
            ["Aw, thank you."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_hugged_2.ogg",
            ["Oh, you big softie."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_hugged_3.ogg",
            ["A fisher once held both hands apart to show me the size of a catch. I asked how wide the measure had been. Everyone laughed. It seems there is a moment in a fishing story when a useful question becomes an interruption. I am learning to recognize it."] = "nightelf-female\\lore10118_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I chose this path because there seemed to be nothing worth gathering beside it. A sensible plan for an uninterrupted stroll. Then I noticed those leaves. And something useful just beyond them. Perhaps the path is perfectly innocent, and I am the one who needs a little practice at walking past."] = "nightelf-female\\lore2083_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I kept an ordinary brown leaf because I could not quite describe its color. It dried before I settled the question. I still enjoyed the looking. Some small pleasures need no better result than that."] = "nightelf-female\\lore270581_idle_1.ogg",
            ["One, two, turn. There, that should be enough. My feet appear to have another opinion. It is useful to practice something that does not come easily, especially when you spend your day helping others learn. Though I would appreciate a little agreement from the rhythm."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3593_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Pulling harder would make this knot less agreeable. I have tried it before, so I speak with some experience. A little room, a careful turn, and there it goes. No special blessing was needed. I am pleased enough with an ordinary cord becoming useful again."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3595_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A traveler once bowed very formally to a waiting hippogryph. I thought it an excellent introduction. Since then I have enjoyed giving the occasion a little ceremony. A hurried passenger may discover they are meeting a proud creature, rather than collecting another piece of luggage. I am pleased when they remember the distinction."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3841_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A traveler once stayed after buying supplies, and I kept trying to think of something else to say. Then I noticed how comfortable the silence had become. I let it stay. Sometimes company is enough without improving it with another question."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3955_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A customer once stood very proudly in his new armor. Then I asked him to reach for something. The look on his face changed considerably. I still let people enjoy a fine pose before asking them to move. There is pleasure in the performance, provided they can manage the journey after their audience has gone."] = "nightelf-female\\lore4164_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The cork is for keeping my reflexes sharp. Yes, I missed. No, you need not look so pleased about the cork's victory."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5499_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The button is human work. Quite ordinary, yes. I would like to take a little of this city's skill west with me someday."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5503_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Yes, there are questions on that page I cannot answer. Yet. I would be a poor researcher if I stopped finding them."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5566_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Yes, that piece is larger. You have a good eye. I could trim it, or we could agree that a visitor should have something pleasant while we talk. I prefer the second solution. There, settled. Tell me something about your day while you enjoy it."] = "nightelf-female\\lore8583_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Nice day for it."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_1.ogg",
            ["{zone} is lovely this time of year."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_2.ogg",
            ["Don't mind me. I'm enjoying the company."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_3.ogg",
            ["You know, I don't get out nearly enough."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_4.ogg",
            ["My feet are already sore. In a good way."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_5.ogg",
            ["I wonder how things are back home without me."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_6.ogg",
            ["Every road looks different when you're not working."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_7.ogg",
            ["Have you ever just stopped and listened to the wind?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_8.ogg",
            ["I could get used to this."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_9.ogg",
            ["Don't tell anyone, but this beats standing in one spot all day."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_10.ogg",
            ["If you need a hand, just say the word."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_11.ogg",
            ["Good company makes the miles shorter."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_12.ogg",
            ["Mind if I stretch? Old bones."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_13.ogg",
            ["Getting late. The stars will be out soon."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_14.ogg",
            ["Quiet night. I like quiet nights."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_15.ogg",
            ["We've been at it for a while. You're tireless, you know that?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_16.ogg",
            ["I used to wonder what was past the next hill. Now I know: another hill."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_17.ogg",
            ["Do you ever get used to all this walking?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_18.ogg",
            ["I've heard stories about you, you know. Some of them are even nice."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_19.ogg",
            ["Smell that? Somebody's cooking something good nearby."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_20.ogg",
            ["If anyone asks, I'm on important business."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_21.ogg",
            ["You're easy company. I mean that kindly."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_22.ogg",
            ["I keep thinking I left something on the stove."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_23.ogg",
            ["Look at that sky."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_24.ogg",
            ["Back home they'll never believe where I've been."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_25.ogg",
            ["I should have brought a better pair of boots."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_26.ogg",
            ["Funny how a quiet road can feel like a holiday."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_27.ogg",
            ["Do adventurers ever take a day off? Asking for a friend. The friend is me."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_28.ogg",
            ["I've counted twelve birds since we set out. Thirteen. Never mind."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_29.ogg",
            ["One of these days you'll have to tell me how you got started."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_30.ogg",
            ["You can tell a lot about someone by how they walk. You walk like you mean it."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_31.ogg",
            ["I'm not complaining. I'm just saying my feet have opinions."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_32.ogg",
            ["Sorry, I've had the same tune stuck in my head all day."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_33.ogg",
            ["If we pass a merchant, remind me I need thread."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_34.ogg",
            ["I wonder what the folks back home are gossiping about."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_35.ogg",
            ["Every time I think I've seen it all, you take me somewhere new."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_36.ogg",
            ["It's peaceful out here. Until it isn't."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_37.ogg",
            ["I could do with a cup of something warm."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_38.ogg",
            ["Morning air's the best air."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_39.ogg",
            ["Early start, eh? I approve."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_40.ogg",
            ["The light's going gold. Best time of day."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_41.ogg",
            ["Stars are out. Makes you feel small, doesn't it?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_42.ogg",
            ["Shouldn't we both be in bed by now?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_43.ogg",
            ["Long day. Good day, though."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_44.ogg",
            ["Still going? I'll say this for you: you don't quit."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_idle_45.ogg",
            ["Ha! I'll have to remember that one."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_jokeBack_1.ogg",
            ["Oh, that's terrible. Tell it again."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_jokeBack_2.ogg",
            ["I'm stealing that one."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_jokeBack_3.ogg",
            ["Oh my."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_kissed_1.ogg",
            ["Well, I never."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_kissed_2.ogg",
            ["Now you've made me blush."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_kissed_3.ogg",
            ["Safe and sound."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_landed_1.ogg",
            ["Good landing. I'll tell the birds."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_landed_2.ogg",
            ["Solid ground. Feels strange after all that sky."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_landed_3.ogg",
            ["Down we come. Legs still work? Good."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_landed_4.ogg",
            ["That was a fine flight."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_landed_5.ogg",
            ["Ha! Good one."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_laughAlong_1.ogg",
            ["Heh. You're funny."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_laughAlong_2.ogg",
            ["Ha! That laugh of yours is catching."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_laughAlong_3.ogg",
            ["Good. Practice it carefully before trying to make it quick. Notice what your body is doing, and where your attention wanders. A mistake you understand is something you can work on. You need not hide it from me behind a show of confidence."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3593_learned_1.ogg",
            ["You have learned something worth carrying with you. Give it thought, and consider where it may help another person. There will be more to understand in time. For now, take care with what you know, and do not be afraid to return with another question."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3595_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Try moving before you decide the choice is perfect. Lift your arms, turn, and consider the journey ahead. Equipment has work to do beyond looking impressive in front of a seller. Bring damage for attention before it grows worse. There will be time to admire the entrance after you know you can walk away from it."] = "nightelf-female\\lore4164_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Good. Now carry that knowledge farther than the room where you learned it. I would like to hear what you make of it."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5499_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Good. Now test what you think you understand against what you actually observe. There is always another question."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5566_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Learning something new? Good for you."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Always improving. I admire that."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_learned_2.ogg",
            ["Something new up your sleeve? I'll be watching."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_learned_3.ogg",
            ["The more you know, the better. That's what I always say."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_learned_4.ogg",
            ["Level {level}! Well done, {name}!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_levelUp_1.ogg",
            ["Look at you, {name}. Level {level} already."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_levelUp_2.ogg",
            ["Level {level}! That calls for a cheer!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_levelUp_3.ogg",
            ["Level {level}. I've seen a lot of adventurers come and go. You're one of the good ones."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_levelUp_4.ogg",
            ["Ha! Level {level}! Well earned."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_levelUp_5.ogg",
            ["Level {level}. Wait until I tell everyone back home."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_levelUp_6.ogg",
            ["Stronger every day. I can see it."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_levelUp_7.ogg",
            ["Another level! I knew you had it in you."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_levelUp_8.ogg",
            ["Well, look who's moving up in the world."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_levelUp_9.ogg",
            ["Another step up. Mind you don't get a big head."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_levelUp_10.ogg",
            ["A small supply can make the difference between setting work aside and finishing it. Thread, a vial, the tool you nearly forgot. It is worth taking a moment to remember what you need before filling every space with something merely interesting."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3955_loot_1.ogg",
            ["Look at the work in that. Before we decide what it is worth, let us notice how it was made."] = "nightelf-female\\lore5503_loot_1.ogg",
            ["{item}! Now that's a find."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_loot_1.ogg",
            ["Well, look at that. {item}."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_loot_2.ogg",
            ["{item}! Lucky day."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_loot_3.ogg",
            ["Ooh, what did you find?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_loot_4.ogg",
            ["Anything good in there?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_loot_5.ogg",
            ["Pockets full! Nice."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_loot_6.ogg",
            ["You're hurt! Get out of there!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_lowHealth_1.ogg",
            ["Careful! You're nearly done in!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_lowHealth_2.ogg",
            ["Back off and catch your breath!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_lowHealth_3.ogg",
            ["You're bleeding! Fall back!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_lowHealth_4.ogg",
            ["Get out of there!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_lowHealth_5.ogg",
            ["Drink something! Anything!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_lowHealth_6.ogg",
            ["This isn't worth dying over!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_lowHealth_7.ogg",
            ["Run! I'll tell everyone you were brave!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_lowHealth_8.ogg",
            ["Bandage! Potion! Something!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_lowHealth_9.ogg",
            ["Hang on! Don't you dare go down!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_lowHealth_10.ogg",
            ["Looks like you've got mail."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_mail_1.ogg",
            ["Someone's written to you. How nice."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_mail_2.ogg",
            ["A letter! I hope it's good news."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_mail_3.ogg",
            ["Mail for you. Somebody's thinking of you."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_mail_4.ogg",
            ["Level {level}! There's nothing left to teach you, is there?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_maxLevel_1.ogg",
            ["The very top! I'm honored to have come along for it."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_maxLevel_2.ogg",
            ["That's the peak. Where do you go from here? Anywhere you like, I suppose."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_maxLevel_3.ogg",
            ["Riding in style, I see."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_mount_1.ogg",
            ["Fine animal you've got there."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_mount_2.ogg",
            ["I'll just walk alongside, shall I?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_mount_3.ogg",
            ["Now that's a proper way to travel."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_mount_4.ogg",
            ["Does it have a name? It looks like it should have a name."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_mount_5.ogg",
            ["{friend} seems friendly."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_newFriend_1.ogg",
            ["I've heard good things about {friend}."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_newFriend_2.ogg",
            ["Another friend! You collect them like coins."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_newFriend_3.ogg",
            ["Another friendly face. You're good at this."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_newFriend_4.ogg",
            ["You make friends faster than I make tea."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_newFriend_5.ogg",
            ["What is it? I don't see anything."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_pointToo_1.ogg",
            ["Where? Oh! No, I still don't see it."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_pointToo_2.ogg",
            ["Is it something good? Or something bad?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_pointToo_3.ogg",
            ["Yes, {name}?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_1.ogg",
            ["Hm? Something on your mind?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_2.ogg",
            ["I'm right here."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_3.ogg",
            ["Careful, now."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_4.ogg",
            ["Ha! You're a funny one."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_5.ogg",
            ["Need something?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_6.ogg",
            ["Still here, still with you."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_7.ogg",
            ["What is it? Did you see something?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_8.ogg",
            ["If that's how you say hello where you're from, all right."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_9.ogg",
            ["I'm listening."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_10.ogg",
            ["Still breathing, if that's what you're checking."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_11.ogg",
            ["Was that a poke or a question?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_12.ogg",
            ["Easy! I bruise like a peach."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_13.ogg",
            ["You have my full attention. Mostly."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_14.ogg",
            ["Hm? Sorry, I was miles away."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_15.ogg",
            ["Ask away."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_16.ogg",
            ["Ow. Was that necessary?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_17.ogg",
            ["What, did I miss something?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_18.ogg",
            ["Present and accounted for."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_19.ogg",
            ["Yes, yes, I see you."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_poke_20.ogg",
            ["All right, all right, I'm awake!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_pokeMany_1.ogg",
            ["Is this going to keep happening?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_pokeMany_2.ogg",
            ["You'd think I was a doorbell."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_pokeMany_3.ogg",
            ["I'm starting to think you enjoy this."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_pokeMany_4.ogg",
            ["Enough! I surrender!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_pokeMany_5.ogg",
            ["One more and I'm going home. I mean it. Probably."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_pokeMany_6.ogg",
            ["The bones and scales were sent to Laird so we could compare our catch with the mainland's. A useful answer can leave a larger question waiting. We know the fish differ. We still have reason to ask why. I would rather keep asking than turn a rumor into a certainty."] = "nightelf-female\\lore10118_quest_1.ogg",
            ["A supply of finished elixirs means less time spent mixing them, and a little more time my husband and I might spend together. I am happy to trade good herbs for careful work. Sometimes the most generous gift is helping someone finish in time to enjoy the rest of the day."] = "nightelf-female\\lore2083_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Another job done. Nicely handled."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Well done! They'll be grateful."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_quest_2.ogg",
            ["You've a knack for helping folk."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_quest_3.ogg",
            ["That's one more person sleeping easier tonight."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_quest_4.ogg",
            ["Good work. Who's next?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_quest_5.ogg",
            ["Word gets around. People will remember that."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_quest_6.ogg",
            ["Nicely done. Somebody's going to tell that story at the inn."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_quest_7.ogg",
            ["That's the way!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_quest_8.ogg",
            ["You make it look easy."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_quest_9.ogg",
            ["Done and done. What's next?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_quest_10.ogg",
            ["Another errand? I like your spirit."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_questAccepted_1.ogg",
            ["Off we go, then."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_questAccepted_2.ogg",
            ["Somebody's lucky you came along."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_questAccepted_3.ogg",
            ["Here we go again. I love it."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_questAccepted_4.ogg",
            ["Sounds like trouble. Count me in."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_questAccepted_5.ogg",
            ["Hm? Did I doze off?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_reload_1.ogg",
            ["Strange. I could swear the world just blinked."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_reload_2.ogg",
            ["Where was I? Oh, right. With you."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_reload_3.ogg",
            ["Hm. I lost my train of thought. Something about the road."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_reload_4.ogg",
            ["A good place to rest our feet."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Nothing like a warm inn."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_rest_2.ogg",
            ["I could sit here all day."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_rest_3.ogg",
            ["A chair, a fire, good company. That's living."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_rest_4.ogg",
            ["Let's stay a moment. My feet insist."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_rest_5.ogg",
            ["Easy there, tiger."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_roarBack_1.ogg",
            ["Very fierce. I'm terrified."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_roarBack_2.ogg",
            ["Was that a roar or a yawn?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_roarBack_3.ogg",
            ["Charming."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_rudeBack_1.ogg",
            ["I'll pretend I didn't see that."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_rudeBack_2.ogg",
            ["Well, I never! Actually, I have. But still."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_rudeBack_3.ogg",
            ["At your service."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_saluteBack_1.ogg",
            ["Sir! Or madam."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_saluteBack_2.ogg",
            ["Standing ready!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_saluteBack_3.ogg",
            ["Oh, it's {friend}! Say hello for me."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_seeFriend_1.ogg",
            ["{friend}! Good to see a friendly face."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_seeFriend_2.ogg",
            ["Look who it is! Give them a wave."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_seeFriend_3.ogg",
            ["Oh, I know them! Small world."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_seeFriend_4.ogg",
            ["No need to be shy."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_shyToo_1.ogg",
            ["Aw, don't hide."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_shyToo_2.ogg",
            ["You're among friends here."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_shyToo_3.ogg",
            ["Don't mind if I do."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_sitToo_1.ogg",
            ["Good idea. My knees agree."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_sitToo_2.ogg",
            ["Ah, that's better."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_sitToo_3.ogg",
            ["I could use a nap myself."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_sleepToo_1.ogg",
            ["Wake me when it's time to go."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_sleepToo_2.ogg",
            ["A nap does sound nice."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_sleepToo_3.ogg",
            ["If Laird has sent you back to Rut'theran, I can help with the flight. Keep his response safe for Nessa, and give your attention to the creature that will carry you. Their questions about the fish may take time to answer. For this part of the journey, we can begin with care and courtesy."] = "nightelf-female\\lore3841_taxi_1.ogg",
            ["Up we go! Never gets old."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_taxi_1.ogg",
            ["Look at it all down there."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_taxi_2.ogg",
            ["A good gryphon is worth its weight in gold."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_taxi_3.ogg",
            ["Hold on tight!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_taxi_4.ogg",
            ["I'll never get tired of this view."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_taxi_5.ogg",
            ["Don't look down. Actually, do. It's lovely."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_taxi_6.ogg",
            ["The wind up here! Hold on to your hat."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_taxi_7.ogg",
            ["Anytime."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_thanked_1.ogg",
            ["Happy to help."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_thanked_2.ogg",
            ["Don't mention it."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_thanked_3.ogg",
            ["{friend} thinks of you as {tier} now. I'm not surprised."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_tier_1.ogg",
            ["Making friends everywhere you go, aren't you?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_tier_2.ogg",
            ["People really warm to you, don't they?"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_tier_3.ogg",
            ["That friendship's growing. Nice to see."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_tier_4.ogg",
            ["Hello!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_waveBack_1.ogg",
            ["Hi there!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_waveBack_2.ogg",
            ["Well, hello to you too."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_waveBack_3.ogg",
            ["Right back at you!"] = "nightelf-female\\npc_waveBack_4.ogg",
            ["So this is {zone}."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_zone_1.ogg",
            ["{zone}, eh? Lead on."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_zone_2.ogg",
            ["I haven't been to {zone} in years."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_zone_3.ogg",
            ["{zone}. Stay sharp."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_zone_4.ogg",
            ["Ah, {zone}. Look at that view."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_zone_5.ogg",
            ["New place, new faces."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_zone_6.ogg",
            ["Keep your eyes open. I don't know these parts."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_zone_7.ogg",
            ["I've only ever heard stories about this place."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_zone_8.ogg",
            ["Look at it all. Worth the walk."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_zone_9.ogg",
            ["Smells different here. Not bad, just different."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_zone_10.ogg",
            ["I'd better remember the way back."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_zone_11.ogg",
            ["Well, this is a change of scenery."] = "nightelf-female\\npc_zone_12.ogg",
        },
        ["nightelf-male"] = {
            ["Welcome back!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_alive_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Gave me a fright."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_alive_2.ogg",
            ["Back on your feet! Good."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_alive_3.ogg",
            ["Good as new. Well, nearly."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_alive_4.ogg",
            ["Don't scare me like that again."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_alive_5.ogg",
            ["Bravo!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_applaudToo_1.ogg",
            ["Well done!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_applaudToo_2.ogg",
            ["Encore!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_applaudToo_3.ogg",
            ["I'll wait here."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_away_1.ogg",
            ["Take your time. I'm not going anywhere."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_away_2.ogg",
            ["I'll keep an eye on things."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_away_3.ogg",
            ["Off you go. I'll mind the spot."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_away_4.ogg",
            ["Wake me if anything exciting happens."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_away_5.ogg",
            ["There you are."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_back_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_back_2.ogg",
            ["Ah, you're back. Shall we?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_back_3.ogg",
            ["Ah, good. I was starting to talk to myself."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_back_4.ogg",
            ["Ready? Me too."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_back_5.ogg",
            ["Your bags are bursting. Time to sell a few things."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_bagsFull_1.ogg",
            ["No room left? I know a merchant or two."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_bagsFull_2.ogg",
            ["You're carrying half the countryside."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_bagsFull_3.ogg",
            ["Your pack's going to split at the seams."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_bagsFull_4.ogg",
            ["I would welcome your company. You take time to notice things, and I value that. We can compare what we see along the way, and perhaps find a quiet place to pause. There is pleasure in knowing the land with someone who cares to look closely."] = "nightelf-male\\lore2079_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have helped me look closely, and given me reasons to look beyond my work. I value both. Let us take the longer walk today. Bring whatever you wished to tell me. We can follow the water for a while without needing to arrive anywhere in particular."] = "nightelf-male\\lore2080_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would welcome your company. You ask useful questions, and you are willing to enjoy a foolish drawing without mistaking it for my work. Those are qualities worth having beside me. Let us see what catches our attention along the way."] = "nightelf-male\\lore2082_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You can listen to an explanation and still remind me to enjoy the meal. I appreciate that combination. Come along. We can find something pleasant in the day, and I will try to notice it before turning it into a lesson for you."] = "nightelf-male\\lore4210_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You are willing to sit beside me and look, without making my question seem foolish. I value that. Come along. We can share a little of the day, and perhaps notice something that one of us would have passed by on our own."] = "nightelf-male\\lore4211_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["A familiar friend to travel beside. Thank you. The world feels a little less distant when there is someone to share it with."] = "nightelf-male\\lore5500_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You came to bring me along. I am glad, my friend. Come. It will be a pleasure to share a little of the day with you."] = "nightelf-male\\lore5567_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You remember the lesson, but you also stay when the lesson is finished. I appreciate that. Come along. There will be new places to cook, good things to share, and perhaps a suitable fire for another attempt at my owl. You may offer your best guess."] = "nightelf-male\\lore6286_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I welcome beyond the help you bring to my research. Walk with me, friend. There will be time for the questions afterward. I would hear how you have been, without immediately turning the answer into another request. You need not arrive carrying anything to make your company worthwhile."] = "nightelf-male\\lore8997_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Likewise."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_bowBack_1.ogg",
            ["An honor."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_bowBack_2.ogg",
            ["The pleasure's mine."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_bowBack_3.ogg",
            ["{friend} is your Buddy now? The more the merrier!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_buddy_1.ogg",
            ["Another Buddy. Should I be jealous?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_buddy_2.ogg",
            ["Another Buddy! Your circle's getting crowded."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_buddy_3.ogg",
            ["Good choice. I'd vouch for them."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_buddy_4.ogg",
            ["Hooray!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_cheerAlong_1.ogg",
            ["Huzzah!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_cheerAlong_2.ogg",
            ["Three cheers!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_cheerAlong_3.ogg",
            ["Who are you calling chicken?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_chickenBack_1.ogg",
            ["Bawk yourself."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_chickenBack_2.ogg",
            ["I'm brave! I'm just brave quietly."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_chickenBack_3.ogg",
            ["Well fought!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatEnd_1.ogg",
            ["That's how it's done."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatEnd_2.ogg",
            ["Everyone in one piece? Good."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatEnd_3.ogg",
            ["Ha! They won't try that again."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatEnd_4.ogg",
            ["I'll admit, my heart was pounding."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatEnd_5.ogg",
            ["Nicely done."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatEnd_6.ogg",
            ["Is it over? It's over. Good."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatEnd_7.ogg",
            ["Remind me never to make you angry."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatEnd_8.ogg",
            ["Not bad at all!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatEnd_9.ogg",
            ["Victory! I'll be telling everyone about that one."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatEnd_10.ogg",
            ["Catch your breath. You earned it."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatEnd_11.ogg",
            ["And not a scratch on me. Thanks to you."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatEnd_12.ogg",
            ["Hold on, it's weakening!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatLong_1.ogg",
            ["Don't give up now!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatLong_2.ogg",
            ["Steady. Steady."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatLong_3.ogg",
            ["This one's stubborn. Keep at it!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatLong_4.ogg",
            ["It's tiring! I can see it!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatLong_5.ogg",
            ["Long fight. You've got more in you."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatLong_6.ogg",
            ["Keep at it!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_1.ogg",
            ["Good hit!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_2.ogg",
            ["Watch your back!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_3.ogg",
            ["That's it, that's it!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_4.ogg",
            ["You've got it on the run!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_5.ogg",
            ["Don't let up!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_6.ogg",
            ["Ha! Did you see that?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_7.ogg",
            ["Nearly there!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_8.ogg",
            ["Hit it again!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_9.ogg",
            ["It's on its last legs!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_10.ogg",
            ["Mind your footing!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_11.ogg",
            ["That one's going to leave a mark!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_12.ogg",
            ["Go on! Go on!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_13.ogg",
            ["You make this look like a dance!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_14.ogg",
            ["Swing that blade! Go on!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_15.ogg",
            ["Into the thick of it! That's the way!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_16.ogg",
            ["The Light's with you! Now hit it!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_17.ogg",
            ["Let your pet have a go!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_18.ogg",
            ["Nice shot! Right on target!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_19.ogg",
            ["Where'd you go? Oh! There you are! Stab it!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_20.ogg",
            ["Patch yourself up, then smite it!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_21.ogg",
            ["Call the storm down on it!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_22.ogg",
            ["Burn it! Burn it all! Well, just that one."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_23.ogg",
            ["Whatever that green fire is, keep doing it!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_24.ogg",
            ["Turn into something big and scary!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatMid_25.ogg",
            ["Look out!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatStart_1.ogg",
            ["Here they come!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatStart_2.ogg",
            ["Give them what for!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatStart_3.ogg",
            ["Stay sharp!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatStart_4.ogg",
            ["On your guard!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatStart_5.ogg",
            ["Here we go again!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatStart_6.ogg",
            ["Watch it, it's coming right at you!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatStart_7.ogg",
            ["Show them what you've got!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_combatStart_8.ogg",
            ["Chin up. It'll be all right."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_comforted_1.ogg",
            ["I'm here if you need me."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_comforted_2.ogg",
            ["Thank you. I needed that."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_comforted_3.ogg",
            ["Ha! All right, I'll dance."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_danceAlong_1.ogg",
            ["I haven't danced in ages!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_danceAlong_2.ogg",
            ["Well, if you insist!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_danceAlong_3.ogg",
            ["Watch my feet. Or don't."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_danceAlong_4.ogg",
            ["Easy now. Let's get you back on your feet."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_died_1.ogg",
            ["That looked like it hurt."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_died_2.ogg",
            ["Don't worry. Happens to the best of us."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_died_3.ogg",
            ["We'll come back stronger."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_died_4.ogg",
            ["Oh, that's not good."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_died_5.ogg",
            ["Well. That could have gone better."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_died_6.ogg",
            ["Let's agree that one didn't count."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_died_7.ogg",
            ["Lie still. I'll keep watch."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_died_8.ogg",
            ["Keep close in here."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_dungeon_1.ogg",
            ["I don't like the look of this place."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_dungeon_2.ogg",
            ["Watch your step. And your back."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_dungeon_3.ogg",
            ["It's dark in here. I don't love the dark."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_dungeon_4.ogg",
            ["Stay together. Nobody wander off."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_dungeon_5.ogg",
            ["Very impressive."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_flexBack_1.ogg",
            ["Don't hurt yourself."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_flexBack_2.ogg",
            ["Put those away before someone gets hurt."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_flexBack_3.ogg",
            ["That looks good on you."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_gear_1.ogg",
            ["New armor? Very sharp."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_gear_2.ogg",
            ["You'll turn heads in that."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_gear_3.ogg",
            ["Shiny! Did you polish that yourself?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_gear_4.ogg",
            ["That suits you. Very heroic."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_gear_5.ogg",
            ["Now you look the part."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_gear_6.ogg",
            ["Come on, your body's this way."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_ghost_1.ogg",
            ["I'll walk with you. Don't mind the chill."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_ghost_2.ogg",
            ["You look a bit see-through. It's fine. Mostly fine."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_ghost_3.ogg",
            ["Follow the road. I'll be right here."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_ghost_4.ogg",
            ["Is it cold, being a ghost? You look cold."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_ghost_5.ogg",
            ["Welcome. Take a moment to look around before you tell me what you have seen. There is more here than any one of us notices at first. I have been attempting a very small balance of my own. This leaf appears willing. The breeze has yet to agree."] = "nightelf-male\\lore2079_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome. Have you found an unfamiliar plant, or have you simply come to walk beside the water? Either is a good reason to stop here. I spend so much time looking closely at things that it helps to have someone remind me to look up occasionally."] = "nightelf-male\\lore2080_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good, you are here. Tell me what you have noticed, and let us keep the observations separate from the guesses. There is room for both, if we label them honestly. The little spider in boots is neither. That is something I drew for my own amusement."] = "nightelf-male\\lore2082_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back. Have you eaten? I was about to explain something useful, but perhaps the first useful thing is to sit and taste what is in front of us. You may remind me of that if the explanation gets ahead of supper again."] = "nightelf-male\\lore4210_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back. Have a moment to look at something with me? A little maze on a scrap of paper. I drew it, which apparently does not mean I remember the way out. Your company would be welcome even if neither of us finds it."] = "nightelf-male\\lore4211_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are, my friend. Have you brought news? Or shall we go and find something worth telling together?"] = "nightelf-male\\lore5500_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good to see you, my friend. Have you time for a walk? I have another little patch of color to show you. It did not quite match the evening, but I find I am pleased with it."] = "nightelf-male\\lore5567_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome. If you would like to learn, there is always a place near the fire. Cooking begins before the food reaches the heat. Think about what you need to gather, what you can leave alone, and who might enjoy sharing the meal when it is ready."] = "nightelf-male\\lore6286_greet_1.ogg",
            ["You have returned. Good. Set down what you have brought and tell me how the journey went. There is more to consider than the samples alone. Argos understands how far we must ask people to travel for this work. If you have seen my brother, I would be glad of word about him as well."] = "nightelf-male\\lore8997_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Lead the way, {name}."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Glad to come along, {name}!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_greet_2.ogg",
            ["Where are we off to today?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_greet_3.ogg",
            ["I told the others I'd be out for a while. Let's make it count."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_greet_4.ogg",
            ["It's good to get away from the counter for once."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_greet_5.ogg",
            ["Ready when you are, {name}."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_greet_6.ogg",
            ["Some fresh air will do me good."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_greet_7.ogg",
            ["Don't walk too fast. I'm not used to all this adventuring."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_greet_8.ogg",
            ["Well met, {name}! Good to see a friendly face."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_greet_9.ogg",
            ["Right behind you. Where to first?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_greet_10.ogg",
            ["I packed a lunch. Just in case."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_greet_11.ogg",
            ["Off on an adventure! Don't tell my boss."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_greet_12.ogg",
            ["Fresh boots, fresh start. Let's go."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_greet_13.ogg",
            ["I've been looking forward to this all week."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_greet_14.ogg",
            ["More company! Wonderful."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_group_1.ogg",
            ["Strength in numbers."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_group_2.ogg",
            ["New faces! Hello, everyone."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_group_3.ogg",
            ["A whole party. Now it's an adventure."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_group_4.ogg",
            ["Home again!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_hearth_1.ogg",
            ["Off to the inn. My treat. Well, your treat."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_hearth_2.ogg",
            ["Home sweet home."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_hearth_3.ogg",
            ["Back to a warm bed. Finally."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_hearth_4.ogg",
            ["Oh! Well. That's nice."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_hugged_1.ogg",
            ["Aw, thank you."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_hugged_2.ogg",
            ["Oh, you big softie."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_hugged_3.ogg",
            ["There. One leaf, one fingertip, and a brief agreement between them. No, it does not tell me the condition of the forest. I am simply enjoying myself. The breeze will remind me not to become too pleased with my accomplishment in a moment."] = "nightelf-male\\lore2079_idle_1.ogg",
            ["That fallen leaf would make a fine little boat. Fold it here, and let the water take it. Mine seems to be moving very slowly. How fortunate. We shall have another bend of the shore before it arrives, and you have not finished your story."] = "nightelf-male\\lore2080_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Eight legs make for rather a lot of footwear. I have fitted seven boots into this drawing, and now the last foot is waiting beyond the edge. No, it is not a specimen. I am allowed an occasional idea that need not survive examination."] = "nightelf-male\\lore2082_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I once explained a point about crab cakes until my own had gone cold. Someone suggested I try a bite. Very sensible advice. I have since attempted three mouthfuls before a cooking tip. Two is my more usual achievement so far."] = "nightelf-male\\lore4210_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I made this maze yesterday and forgot which passage led out. Someone found the turn I had missed. Rather than being embarrassed, I wanted to draw another. It is pleasant to be lost somewhere small enough that you can simply begin again."] = "nightelf-male\\lore4211_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The letter is for me. Things I hope to see again in Teldrassil. No need to send it; I know where its reader can be found."] = "nightelf-male\\lore5500_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The patch I like best does not quite match the sky I was watching. I have kept it anyway. Sometimes the work gives you something worth looking at that you had not thought to ask for."] = "nightelf-male\\lore5567_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Look at the shadow. An owl, you see. Those are the ears. No, I understand why you said cabbage, but I have made some improvements since the last attempt. Perhaps if I turn my hands a little... A sleepy kettle? Well, that is a new one."] = "nightelf-male\\lore6286_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Sometimes I hear a laugh near the road and look up before I have thought about it. I expect to see Argos. Usually it is another traveler, and I have interrupted my work for a stranger's conversation. It does me no harm. A friendly voice can be worth hearing even when I have mistaken it for another."] = "nightelf-male\\lore8997_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Nice day for it."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_1.ogg",
            ["{zone} is lovely this time of year."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_2.ogg",
            ["Don't mind me. I'm enjoying the company."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_3.ogg",
            ["You know, I don't get out nearly enough."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_4.ogg",
            ["My feet are already sore. In a good way."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_5.ogg",
            ["I wonder how things are back home without me."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_6.ogg",
            ["Every road looks different when you're not working."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_7.ogg",
            ["Have you ever just stopped and listened to the wind?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_8.ogg",
            ["I could get used to this."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_9.ogg",
            ["Don't tell anyone, but this beats standing in one spot all day."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_10.ogg",
            ["If you need a hand, just say the word."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_11.ogg",
            ["Good company makes the miles shorter."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_12.ogg",
            ["Mind if I stretch? Old bones."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_13.ogg",
            ["Getting late. The stars will be out soon."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_14.ogg",
            ["Quiet night. I like quiet nights."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_15.ogg",
            ["We've been at it for a while. You're tireless, you know that?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_16.ogg",
            ["I used to wonder what was past the next hill. Now I know: another hill."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_17.ogg",
            ["Do you ever get used to all this walking?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_18.ogg",
            ["I've heard stories about you, you know. Some of them are even nice."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_19.ogg",
            ["Smell that? Somebody's cooking something good nearby."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_20.ogg",
            ["If anyone asks, I'm on important business."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_21.ogg",
            ["You're easy company. I mean that kindly."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_22.ogg",
            ["I keep thinking I left something on the stove."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_23.ogg",
            ["Look at that sky."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_24.ogg",
            ["Back home they'll never believe where I've been."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_25.ogg",
            ["I should have brought a better pair of boots."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_26.ogg",
            ["Funny how a quiet road can feel like a holiday."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_27.ogg",
            ["Do adventurers ever take a day off? Asking for a friend. The friend is me."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_28.ogg",
            ["I've counted twelve birds since we set out. Thirteen. Never mind."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_29.ogg",
            ["One of these days you'll have to tell me how you got started."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_30.ogg",
            ["You can tell a lot about someone by how they walk. You walk like you mean it."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_31.ogg",
            ["I'm not complaining. I'm just saying my feet have opinions."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_32.ogg",
            ["Sorry, I've had the same tune stuck in my head all day."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_33.ogg",
            ["If we pass a merchant, remind me I need thread."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_34.ogg",
            ["I wonder what the folks back home are gossiping about."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_35.ogg",
            ["Every time I think I've seen it all, you take me somewhere new."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_36.ogg",
            ["It's peaceful out here. Until it isn't."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_37.ogg",
            ["I could do with a cup of something warm."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_38.ogg",
            ["Morning air's the best air."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_39.ogg",
            ["Early start, eh? I approve."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_40.ogg",
            ["The light's going gold. Best time of day."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_41.ogg",
            ["Stars are out. Makes you feel small, doesn't it?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_42.ogg",
            ["Shouldn't we both be in bed by now?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_43.ogg",
            ["Long day. Good day, though."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_44.ogg",
            ["Still going? I'll say this for you: you don't quit."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_45.ogg",
            ["Ha! I'll have to remember that one."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_jokeBack_1.ogg",
            ["Oh, that's terrible. Tell it again."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_jokeBack_2.ogg",
            ["I'm stealing that one."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_jokeBack_3.ogg",
            ["Oh my."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_kissed_1.ogg",
            ["Well, I never."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_kissed_2.ogg",
            ["Now you've made me blush."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_kissed_3.ogg",
            ["Safe and sound."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_landed_1.ogg",
            ["Good landing. I'll tell the birds."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_landed_2.ogg",
            ["Solid ground. Feels strange after all that sky."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_landed_3.ogg",
            ["Down we come. Legs still work? Good."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_landed_4.ogg",
            ["That was a fine flight."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_landed_5.ogg",
            ["Ha! Good one."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_laughAlong_1.ogg",
            ["Heh. You're funny."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_laughAlong_2.ogg",
            ["Ha! That laugh of yours is catching."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_laughAlong_3.ogg",
            ["Cooking rewards attention over a lifetime. A book can take you further, and another teacher can show you what you have yet to notice. Keep practicing, and keep tasting. An explanation becomes much more useful when you discover what it means for yourself."] = "nightelf-male\\lore4210_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Ask when you are unsure, and seek further instruction when you need it. There is no loss of dignity in discovering that someone else can show you what you missed. A useful lesson should leave you better able to continue learning for yourself."] = "nightelf-male\\lore4211_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Well done. Give the work a careful look before you move on. There may be something in the way it came together that is worth remembering."] = "nightelf-male\\lore5567_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Learning something new? Good for you."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Always improving. I admire that."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_learned_2.ogg",
            ["Something new up your sleeve? I'll be watching."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_learned_3.ogg",
            ["The more you know, the better. That's what I always say."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_learned_4.ogg",
            ["Level {level}! Well done, {name}!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_levelUp_1.ogg",
            ["Look at you, {name}. Level {level} already."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_levelUp_2.ogg",
            ["Level {level}! That calls for a cheer!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_levelUp_3.ogg",
            ["Level {level}. I've seen a lot of adventurers come and go. You're one of the good ones."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_levelUp_4.ogg",
            ["Ha! Level {level}! Well earned."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_levelUp_5.ogg",
            ["Level {level}. Wait until I tell everyone back home."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_levelUp_6.ogg",
            ["Stronger every day. I can see it."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_levelUp_7.ogg",
            ["Another level! I knew you had it in you."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_levelUp_8.ogg",
            ["Well, look who's moving up in the world."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_levelUp_9.ogg",
            ["Another step up. Mind you don't get a big head."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_levelUp_10.ogg",
            ["{item}! Now that's a find."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_loot_1.ogg",
            ["Well, look at that. {item}."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_loot_2.ogg",
            ["{item}! Lucky day."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_loot_3.ogg",
            ["Ooh, what did you find?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_loot_4.ogg",
            ["Anything good in there?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_loot_5.ogg",
            ["Pockets full! Nice."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_loot_6.ogg",
            ["You're hurt! Get out of there!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_lowHealth_1.ogg",
            ["Careful! You're nearly done in!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_lowHealth_2.ogg",
            ["Back off and catch your breath!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_lowHealth_3.ogg",
            ["You're bleeding! Fall back!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_lowHealth_4.ogg",
            ["Get out of there!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_lowHealth_5.ogg",
            ["Drink something! Anything!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_lowHealth_6.ogg",
            ["This isn't worth dying over!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_lowHealth_7.ogg",
            ["Run! I'll tell everyone you were brave!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_lowHealth_8.ogg",
            ["Bandage! Potion! Something!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_lowHealth_9.ogg",
            ["Hang on! Don't you dare go down!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_lowHealth_10.ogg",
            ["Looks like you've got mail."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_mail_1.ogg",
            ["Someone's written to you. How nice."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_mail_2.ogg",
            ["A letter! I hope it's good news."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_mail_3.ogg",
            ["Mail for you. Somebody's thinking of you."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_mail_4.ogg",
            ["Level {level}! There's nothing left to teach you, is there?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_maxLevel_1.ogg",
            ["The very top! I'm honored to have come along for it."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_maxLevel_2.ogg",
            ["That's the peak. Where do you go from here? Anywhere you like, I suppose."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_maxLevel_3.ogg",
            ["Riding in style, I see."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_mount_1.ogg",
            ["Fine animal you've got there."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_mount_2.ogg",
            ["I'll just walk alongside, shall I?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_mount_3.ogg",
            ["Now that's a proper way to travel."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_mount_4.ogg",
            ["Does it have a name? It looks like it should have a name."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_mount_5.ogg",
            ["{friend} seems friendly."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_newFriend_1.ogg",
            ["I've heard good things about {friend}."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_newFriend_2.ogg",
            ["Another friend! You collect them like coins."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_newFriend_3.ogg",
            ["Another friendly face. You're good at this."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_newFriend_4.ogg",
            ["You make friends faster than I make tea."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_newFriend_5.ogg",
            ["What is it? I don't see anything."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_pointToo_1.ogg",
            ["Where? Oh! No, I still don't see it."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_pointToo_2.ogg",
            ["Is it something good? Or something bad?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_pointToo_3.ogg",
            ["Yes, {name}?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_1.ogg",
            ["Hm? Something on your mind?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_2.ogg",
            ["I'm right here."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_3.ogg",
            ["Careful, now."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_4.ogg",
            ["Ha! You're a funny one."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_5.ogg",
            ["Need something?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_6.ogg",
            ["Still here, still with you."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_7.ogg",
            ["What is it? Did you see something?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_8.ogg",
            ["If that's how you say hello where you're from, all right."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_9.ogg",
            ["I'm listening."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_10.ogg",
            ["Still breathing, if that's what you're checking."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_11.ogg",
            ["Was that a poke or a question?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_12.ogg",
            ["Easy! I bruise like a peach."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_13.ogg",
            ["You have my full attention. Mostly."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_14.ogg",
            ["Hm? Sorry, I was miles away."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_15.ogg",
            ["Ask away."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_16.ogg",
            ["Ow. Was that necessary?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_17.ogg",
            ["What, did I miss something?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_18.ogg",
            ["Present and accounted for."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_19.ogg",
            ["Yes, yes, I see you."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_poke_20.ogg",
            ["All right, all right, I'm awake!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_pokeMany_1.ogg",
            ["Is this going to keep happening?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_pokeMany_2.ogg",
            ["You'd think I was a doorbell."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_pokeMany_3.ogg",
            ["I'm starting to think you enjoy this."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_pokeMany_4.ogg",
            ["Enough! I surrender!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_pokeMany_5.ogg",
            ["One more and I'm going home. I mean it. Probably."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_pokeMany_6.ogg",
            ["The timberlings reflect the life of this great tree. Their anger concerns me, but so do the seeds that carry their corruption. Rellian and I are trying to understand what can still be helped. Good soil offers possibilities. It is not a promise that every wound will heal."] = "nightelf-male\\lore2080_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Thank you. Careful work gives us something we can actually examine. I would rather have one reliable observation than a dozen impressive claims. Tell me how you found it, and whether anything surprised you. The part that failed to fit your expectations may be especially useful."] = "nightelf-male\\lore2082_quest_1.ogg",
            ["The forest gives us much. That does not mean we should take everything we find. Seven small spider legs are enough for the lesson I give. Learning to stop when you have what you need belongs beside learning how to prepare it. Both are part of cooking well."] = "nightelf-male\\lore6286_quest_1.ogg",
            ["The naga and satyr of Blackfathom may hold evidence of what corruption has done. I fear the blood elves are courting a similar fate through demonic magic. Bring the samples with care. There is much to study before I can claim an understanding, and I do not forget the danger you face to help me begin."] = "nightelf-male\\lore8997_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Another job done. Nicely handled."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Well done! They'll be grateful."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_quest_2.ogg",
            ["You've a knack for helping folk."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_quest_3.ogg",
            ["That's one more person sleeping easier tonight."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_quest_4.ogg",
            ["Good work. Who's next?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_quest_5.ogg",
            ["Word gets around. People will remember that."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_quest_6.ogg",
            ["Nicely done. Somebody's going to tell that story at the inn."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_quest_7.ogg",
            ["That's the way!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_quest_8.ogg",
            ["You make it look easy."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_quest_9.ogg",
            ["Done and done. What's next?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_quest_10.ogg",
            ["Another errand? I like your spirit."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_questAccepted_1.ogg",
            ["Off we go, then."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_questAccepted_2.ogg",
            ["Somebody's lucky you came along."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_questAccepted_3.ogg",
            ["Here we go again. I love it."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_questAccepted_4.ogg",
            ["Sounds like trouble. Count me in."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_questAccepted_5.ogg",
            ["Hm? Did I doze off?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_reload_1.ogg",
            ["Strange. I could swear the world just blinked."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_reload_2.ogg",
            ["Where was I? Oh, right. With you."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_reload_3.ogg",
            ["Hm. I lost my train of thought. Something about the road."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_reload_4.ogg",
            ["A good place to rest our feet."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Nothing like a warm inn."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_rest_2.ogg",
            ["I could sit here all day."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_rest_3.ogg",
            ["A chair, a fire, good company. That's living."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_rest_4.ogg",
            ["Let's stay a moment. My feet insist."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_rest_5.ogg",
            ["Easy there, tiger."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_roarBack_1.ogg",
            ["Very fierce. I'm terrified."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_roarBack_2.ogg",
            ["Was that a roar or a yawn?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_roarBack_3.ogg",
            ["Charming."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_rudeBack_1.ogg",
            ["I'll pretend I didn't see that."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_rudeBack_2.ogg",
            ["Well, I never! Actually, I have. But still."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_rudeBack_3.ogg",
            ["At your service."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_saluteBack_1.ogg",
            ["Sir! Or madam."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_saluteBack_2.ogg",
            ["Standing ready!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_saluteBack_3.ogg",
            ["Oh, it's {friend}! Say hello for me."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_seeFriend_1.ogg",
            ["{friend}! Good to see a friendly face."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_seeFriend_2.ogg",
            ["Look who it is! Give them a wave."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_seeFriend_3.ogg",
            ["Oh, I know them! Small world."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_seeFriend_4.ogg",
            ["No need to be shy."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_shyToo_1.ogg",
            ["Aw, don't hide."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_shyToo_2.ogg",
            ["You're among friends here."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_shyToo_3.ogg",
            ["Don't mind if I do."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_sitToo_1.ogg",
            ["Good idea. My knees agree."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_sitToo_2.ogg",
            ["Ah, that's better."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_sitToo_3.ogg",
            ["I could use a nap myself."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_sleepToo_1.ogg",
            ["Wake me when it's time to go."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_sleepToo_2.ogg",
            ["A nap does sound nice."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_sleepToo_3.ogg",
            ["Up we go! Never gets old."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_taxi_1.ogg",
            ["Look at it all down there."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_taxi_2.ogg",
            ["A good gryphon is worth its weight in gold."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_taxi_3.ogg",
            ["Hold on tight!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_taxi_4.ogg",
            ["I'll never get tired of this view."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_taxi_5.ogg",
            ["Don't look down. Actually, do. It's lovely."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_taxi_6.ogg",
            ["The wind up here! Hold on to your hat."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_taxi_7.ogg",
            ["Anytime."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_thanked_1.ogg",
            ["Happy to help."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_thanked_2.ogg",
            ["Don't mention it."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_thanked_3.ogg",
            ["{friend} thinks of you as {tier} now. I'm not surprised."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_tier_1.ogg",
            ["Making friends everywhere you go, aren't you?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_tier_2.ogg",
            ["People really warm to you, don't they?"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_tier_3.ogg",
            ["That friendship's growing. Nice to see."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_tier_4.ogg",
            ["Hello!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_waveBack_1.ogg",
            ["Hi there!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_waveBack_2.ogg",
            ["Well, hello to you too."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_waveBack_3.ogg",
            ["Right back at you!"] = "nightelf-male\\npc_waveBack_4.ogg",
            ["Look at what this place supports. Its creatures, its plants, the food and shelter they share. We need not understand everything at once, but we should remember that each thing we notice belongs to a larger whole. Walk with care, and keep looking."] = "nightelf-male\\lore2079_zone_1.ogg",
            ["Somewhere new. Let us notice the little things too. They may be what we most wish to remember later."] = "nightelf-male\\lore5500_zone_1.ogg",
            ["So this is {zone}."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_zone_1.ogg",
            ["{zone}, eh? Lead on."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_zone_2.ogg",
            ["I haven't been to {zone} in years."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_zone_3.ogg",
            ["{zone}. Stay sharp."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_zone_4.ogg",
            ["Ah, {zone}. Look at that view."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_zone_5.ogg",
            ["New place, new faces."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_zone_6.ogg",
            ["Keep your eyes open. I don't know these parts."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_zone_7.ogg",
            ["I've only ever heard stories about this place."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_zone_8.ogg",
            ["Look at it all. Worth the walk."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_zone_9.ogg",
            ["Smells different here. Not bad, just different."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_zone_10.ogg",
            ["I'd better remember the way back."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_zone_11.ogg",
            ["Well, this is a change of scenery."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_zone_12.ogg",
        },
        ["orc-female"] = {
            ["Before you leave anything behind, think about what you will need for the next stretch of work. Preparation is easier here than halfway through a long journey. I cannot decide for you which treasure deserves the last space, but I can remind you that forgotten supplies make a very dull adventure."] = "orc-female\\lore3358_bagsFull_1.ogg",
            ["You have come back often enough that I look forward to seeing you. That is a good thing to discover about someone. Come, let us spend a little time together. Today I can be beside you for the journey."] = "orc-female\\lore12616_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You return even when you do not need a flight. I have come to look forward to that. Come along, friend. We can see where the day takes us. If a shower catches us, there is nothing wrong with sharing a dry place and waiting a little while."] = "orc-female\\lore1387_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have listened long enough to hear more than the decision you first expected to judge. I value that. Come with me, friend. There are things I can say in your company without first arranging every word against an argument. We may still disagree. I would rather have your honest answer than an easy assurance you do not mean."] = "orc-female\\lore2772_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I am glad to see after the useful part of the conversation is finished. Come along, friend. There is more to company than remembering the next thing to buy. If you wish, you may help choose the next scrap for the tassel. Consider it carefully. I expect a truly unreasonable combination of colors from someone I trust."] = "orc-female\\lore2821_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You tell a good riddle, and you do not let me escape with a bad answer. I appreciate a friend who can do both. Come along. We will see what the road offers. If you have been saving a difficult one, now is an excellent time to ask it."] = "orc-female\\lore2851_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I trust you to pay attention, and I have come to enjoy what you notice. Keep me company a while. We can speak of something besides the Burning Blade. Even I have interests that do not require a warning before I explain them."] = "orc-female\\lore3145_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Yes, I will come with you. You have become someone I enjoy seeing, even when you arrive with everything you need and no business to finish. That is worth a walk together. I may remind you to check your pack, but you need not bring an excuse to ask for my company."] = "orc-female\\lore3158_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I enjoy your company, my friend. Let us find a little time that need not be spent buying, selling or proving what we can catch. I would be glad simply to have you along."] = "orc-female\\lore3333_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Yes, I will walk with you. I respect your judgment, and I enjoy your company. We can leave the reports for later. Come, my friend. Tell me how you have been. There is time to listen."] = "orc-female\\lore3338_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You make time to enjoy a small thing without apologizing for it. I like that. Stay beside me. We can talk, we can eat, and neither of us needs to make the afternoon more impressive."] = "orc-female\\lore3342_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have listened to me often enough. Today I would like to listen to you. No lesson, no test. Just two friends finding their way through a conversation."] = "orc-female\\lore3344_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You keep coming back with more than a request for supplies. I like hearing what you have been doing. Come along, friend. Let us see what the road has waiting. When we return, you may walk straight across the clean floor. I would rather see you than preserve it."] = "orc-female\\lore3358_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You keep coming back, even when I have more worries than good news. I notice that. Walk with me, friend. Perhaps today we will find a little quiet worth sharing."] = "orc-female\\lore4049_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You know what I like about you? You stop and look when I show you something worth seeing. Come on, friend. We will walk a while. I may point out a roof or two. You can tell me about your own work, and I will decide whether you are boasting enough about it."] = "orc-female\\lore5811_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You can stop calling yourself a customer. I'll put another bowl out."] = "orc-female\\lore6929_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You return knowing perfectly well that I still have that joke. That says something for your courage, or your tolerance. Either way, I am glad of the company. Stay a while and tell me how you have been."] = "orc-female\\lore7731_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Good to see you again. Where are we headed? Take a moment if you need one. I like knowing the destination, but I would rather hear your answer properly than watch you set off wishing you had chosen another road."] = "orc-female\\lore12616_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back. Where do you need to go? If the rain caught you on the way here, take a moment to see to your gear before we arrange the next part. There is no sense carrying a small problem into the sky when you can settle it on the ground."] = "orc-female\\lore1387_greet_1.ogg",
            ["You have come to speak with me? Then listen before deciding what you think of my choice. There are dangers that pride makes worse, and people I mean to protect. I do not expect every decision to sit easily upon me. I do expect to consider what it will cost the people I love."] = "orc-female\\lore2772_greet_1.ogg",
            ["What do you need today? Thread, dye, tools, spices? Give me a clear request and we can get somewhere useful. If you have stopped to inspect my little tassel, that is another conversation. I am considering a new scrap for it. The colors do not agree with each other, which is becoming rather the point of the thing."] = "orc-female\\lore2821_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Ready to travel? Check what you are carrying and make sure it will stay with you. Once that is settled, you may ask me a riddle while we wait. I make no promise about finding the right answer. I can promise to consider an interesting wrong one."] = "orc-female\\lore2851_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Tell me what you have seen, and take your time with the important parts. I would rather hear an honest uncertainty than a confident mistake. Afterward, you may explain why that cloud looks like a boar lying on its back."] = "orc-female\\lore3145_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Ready to go? Check what you are carrying before you say yes. Food, water, the tools for the work you intend to do. A fine plan becomes a very dull walk home when the thing you need is still sitting where you left it. I will give you a moment. Then we can get moving."] = "orc-female\\lore3158_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good to see you. Have you brought a little patience with you? We need not be going fishing to make use of it. A walk and a good story can take their time, too."] = "orc-female\\lore3333_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Come along, and tell me what has been occupying your thoughts. You have enough sense to notice more than the next challenge in front of you. I would like to hear some of it. We can take a little time for ourselves before the day finds another task to put in our hands."] = "orc-female\\lore3338_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Have you eaten, or are you planning to glare at the road until it feeds you? Come along. We can find a place to stop before your stomach starts making the decisions."] = "orc-female\\lore3342_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Walk with me a while. I have spent the morning answering questions, and I would like to hear what has been on your mind."] = "orc-female\\lore3344_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Come through, and tell me what you need for the work ahead. Yes, I have just swept. No, you do not have to remain outside admiring it. A clean threshold is pleasant, but a customer standing beyond it is taking the victory rather too seriously."] = "orc-female\\lore3358_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good. I am glad to have you beside me. Keep your ears open as we walk. I would welcome a little birdsong after listening to so many reports of machines."] = "orc-female\\lore4049_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Look up before you hurry past. See that roof? People remember a fine set of armor, but a good hide can shelter more than one warrior. Orgrimmar needs both. If you are going hunting, bring back something worth working. And if the beast gave you a fight, I will hear about that too."] = "orc-female\\lore5811_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Tell me you packed something better than dry bread."] = "orc-female\\lore6929_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Have you eaten, or have you been saving all your strength for telling me what a difficult day you have had? Come along. We will find time for both supper and the story."] = "orc-female\\lore7731_greet_1.ogg",
            ["A rider once turned and waved just before disappearing from sight. I returned it, of course. Now I find myself watching every departure a little longer. Yes, sometimes I am still waving when nobody can see. I know."] = "orc-female\\lore12616_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Hold still a moment. There is a moth on my hand. It came out of the rain, and I am giving it somewhere dry until it decides to leave. No, I have not taken a new passenger. I am simply not in such a hurry that I need to brush it away."] = "orc-female\\lore1387_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Once, a visitor had already left before I found the answer his boasting deserved. I kept it for his return. He looked so surprised that I almost laughed before finishing. Now I give myself a moment before answering foolishness. Sometimes the answer improves while the fool becomes more certain that he has impressed me."] = "orc-female\\lore2772_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I tied a few leftover pieces of colored thread together because they were still useful. Then I added another. Someone said the colors ought to match, so I considered the matter carefully and added a color that made that considerably less possible. A small piece of work, but I remain very pleased with the decision."] = "orc-female\\lore2821_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The answer is the wind. You have not asked the question yet? Then there is still every chance I am right. A cooking pot, you say. Hm. You will have to explain the difference carefully. I was quite pleased with that answer, and I would like to defend it."] = "orc-female\\lore2851_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Look at that cloud. An enormous boar, all four feet in the air. No, I am not reading an omen. Sometimes I look up because something is funny. You may enjoy it too. Our duties will survive a moment without our frowns."] = "orc-female\\lore3145_idle_1.ogg",
            ["That was meant to land in my left hand. You saw the idea, even if you did not see a successful catch. Give me a moment before you offer advice. I know where both hands are. It is the copper that keeps choosing a different destination, usually somewhere inconvenient to reach."] = "orc-female\\lore3158_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The fish was a little larger than that. In this telling, at least. The afternoon was exactly as pleasant as I remember, and that is the part I am not improving."] = "orc-female\\lore3333_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Have one if you like. They are tart, and I am telling you that before you decide I have played some great trick on you. Yes, the first one still catches me sometimes. You may laugh when it does. I have no intention of turning a handful of berries into a test of anyone's dignity."] = "orc-female\\lore3338_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I once waited for the street to go quiet before biting an apple. Wanted to hear the crunch properly. A cart went past at just the wrong moment. Ruined the experiment. Improved the afternoon considerably."] = "orc-female\\lore3342_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I recognize that look. Someone has a question and is deciding whether it sounds foolish. Ask it. We will learn far more that way than by standing here looking wise."] = "orc-female\\lore3344_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I once meant to finish sweeping before another pair of boots crossed the floor. Orgrimmar disagreed. These days I enjoy the clean patch while it lasts. Then someone arrives, the dust returns, and there is a person to talk to. The broom can wait until they have finished."] = "orc-female\\lore3358_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I tried to answer a bird near camp. The first two notes were almost right. It stayed for the third, which I consider either encouragement or a very poor opinion of my chances."] = "orc-female\\lore4049_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Someone asked me which trophy made me proudest. I pointed to a roof. You should have seen the fool searching for the head! A thick hide is good for more than a warrior's shoulders. Let the rain come. People beneath sound work have something better to do than admire their own armor."] = "orc-female\\lore5811_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A red center. A little salt. Why do people insist on making supper difficult?"] = "orc-female\\lore6929_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Someone asked how much farther the road would take them. I said, axe me after supper. Yes, that was the joke. That groan is familiar. Give it a moment; it usually turns into a laugh eventually."] = "orc-female\\lore7731_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Give yourself a moment with what you have learned. There will be another question soon enough. You need not rush past this one just to prove you are ready."] = "orc-female\\lore3344_learned_1.ogg",
            ["The lizards of Thunder Ridge have hides too thick for most armor. That does not make them worthless. Peons need sturdy material for the walls and roofs as Orgrimmar grows. Learn what a hide is good for before cutting it. A careless worker can waste the best part of a difficult hunt."] = "orc-female\\lore5811_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Look at what you have before deciding what must be bought. A useful supply can save another journey if you know where you put it. Then tell me clearly what is missing. Thread, vials, tools, spices: each has its purpose. Keep a little scrap aside if it catches your eye. Mine eventually became something worth a conversation."] = "orc-female\\lore2821_loot_1.ogg",
            ["Look at what you have before you shove it into the first space you find. If it is useful, give it room to arrive in useful condition. If you do not need it, decide that now. I have seen plenty of people carry a bag full of trouble and still insist they are well prepared."] = "orc-female\\lore3158_loot_1.ogg",
            ["Keep the hooks covered and the useful gear together. It is easier to enjoy an outing when finding what you need does not involve emptying your whole bag beside the water."] = "orc-female\\lore3333_loot_1.ogg",
            ["Or'Kalar bears an old hatred for my husband. My auguries warn of a trap, and I have kept its signs from Drum because I fear how quickly he would rush toward it. You may question my silence. I have questioned it myself. That has not made me willing to surrender his life to another person's revenge."] = "orc-female\\lore2772_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Good. Tell me what happened, including the part that did not go as you expected. That is often the part we most need to understand. You did useful work. Give yourself the credit, then help me see what it has taught us."] = "orc-female\\lore3145_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Good. Now consider what the effort taught you. Strength matters, but so do the way you approach a challenge and the care you take in meeting it. Remember what can be learned from subtlety and mercy. Bring thought to your actions, and you will have more to show than proof of a successful hunt."] = "orc-female\\lore3338_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Thank you for doing something. The work is not finished, but that does not make your effort small. We will need strength, and we will need wisdom enough to know what comes next."] = "orc-female\\lore4049_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Sit down and give the first bite a moment. There will be plenty of time for the story afterward. Sometimes a meal is worth enjoying before we turn it into another thing to hurry through."] = "orc-female\\lore3342_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Sit down. You don't have to earn every moment of rest."] = "orc-female\\lore6929_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Sit. A good rest is part of getting through the next hard day. You can tell me about the battle once you have caught your breath. For now, let the fire and the company do their work."] = "orc-female\\lore7731_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Have your destination settled? Good. Take a moment to say your farewells, and enjoy the view when you are ready. If you turn to look behind you, there may be someone down there still wishing you a good journey."] = "orc-female\\lore12616_taxi_1.ogg",
            ["Settle your gear and take your place. We will see you on your way. If something feels wrong before you leave, say so while we can still attend to it here. A little care on the ground is a better beginning than a surprise in the air."] = "orc-female\\lore1387_taxi_1.ogg",
            ["Check your gear before we leave. A loose strap does not become more secure in the air. There. Now settle yourself. You may spend the flight considering your next riddle. If it has anything to do with the wind, I expect to have a considerable advantage."] = "orc-female\\lore2851_taxi_1.ogg",
        },
        ["orc-male"] = {
            ["A full bag is an excellent argument for planning the next one. Think about what you carry before choosing the pattern. Cloth, thread, and a little attention can save a great deal of muttering on the road. Unfortunately, I do not sell a pattern for deciding what to leave behind."] = "orc-male\\lore3364_bagsFull_1.ogg",
            ["I know what strength looks like when it returns from a hard fight. You have earned my respect, and I will not pretend otherwise. Stand beside me, friend. There is still danger enough for both of us, and I would rather meet it with someone whose tenacity I trust. Come. We have spent enough time talking about it."] = "orc-male\\lore2771_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I know your step now. You have become someone whose return I notice, and whose company I am willing to keep. Come, friend. I cannot promise a bright answer for every day ahead. I can say that I am glad you came back today. We need not make a speech of more than that before we walk together."] = "orc-male\\lore2792_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You stayed to hear the ending even after you knew nothing terrible would happen. I appreciate that. Come along. We have plenty to see, and perhaps we can find a pleasant little part of the day for ourselves as well."] = "orc-male\\lore2861_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would be glad to have your company. There, you heard me. You have earned more than another task to carry away from the Den. Tell me where you would like to go, and I will try to leave a few of my warnings behind."] = "orc-male\\lore3143_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have brought questions worth considering, and company I have come to value. Come along, friend. There are things we may learn without turning every moment into a lesson. When we stop to eat, you may help me decide which half of the bread to begin with."] = "orc-male\\lore3173_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Fine, I'll come along. You've done more than turn up hungry and disappear when there's work to be done. I like having you around. There, said it. You needn't stand looking surprised until dinner. Come on, we'll find somewhere to stop when it's time to eat."] = "orc-male\\lore3191_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You're more than a fare and a destination to me, friend."] = "orc-male\\lore3310_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have learned when to speak and when to let a quiet moment stay quiet. I value that. Walk beside me. You need not find something useful to say just to earn your place there."] = "orc-male\\lore3317_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I enjoy your company. There. Said it before I could add a correction. Come along, friend. If you keep walking, I might manage another compliment before we get back."] = "orc-male\\lore3347_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You pay attention to the ordinary things, and you are willing to ask what you have missed. I enjoy that in a companion. Come along, friend. Show me something familiar through your eyes. I shall try to notice it before deciding that I already know everything worth knowing about it."] = "orc-male\\lore3348_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have given me more than a list of supplies to remember you by. Come along, friend. I would like to see some of the places behind your stories. Perhaps afterward you can tell me what color the day was. I promise not to turn every answer into a sale."] = "orc-male\\lore3364_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone whose company I enjoy before we discuss anything that needs making. Come along, friend. Tell me what you would choose to do with an afternoon of your own. You need not persuade me that it serves an important purpose. I am pleased to hear what would make you grin."] = "orc-male\\lore3366_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have earned my trust. I do not say that merely to give you another task. Today I would be glad of your company, even if we find nothing worth putting in a report."] = "orc-male\\lore3389_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have given me more than help with another task. You have stayed. I do not know how to repay that, but I would be glad to walk beside you as a friend."] = "orc-male\\lore3432_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You keep turning up without needing another assignment. I like that. Come, friend. Give me a little news that belongs to you, before someone brings us another list of things to do."] = "orc-male\\lore3449_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Gladly. You have become someone I look forward to seeing, even when you arrive with no bundle to send and no flight to catch. That seems a fine reason to spend some time together. Let us take a walk, my friend. We can decide where it is going after we have begun enjoying the company."] = "orc-male\\lore3615_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I value your company. With you, I can ask an ordinary question and receive an ordinary answer. That is a greater kindness than you may realize. Come, let us see where today leads."] = "orc-male\\lore4047_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone whose answer I enjoy hearing even when there is nothing to sell. Come along, friend. Tell me what sounds good after the road, and I will consider changing my mind again. We can disagree without spoiling the meal. I would rather share the company than spend dinner defending something I declared yesterday."] = "orc-male\\lore4954_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Gladly. We have shared enough talk that I should like to share some of the road as well. You have become good company to me, and that is worth making time for. No, you need not earn another welcome before you ask. You are my friend. Come on, let us see what story we bring home together."] = "orc-male\\lore6928_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I am glad to see without a sale or repair waiting between us. Come along, friend. Tell me plainly when something needs attention, and I will do the same for you. If you happen to find a particularly fine curl of wood, keep it safe. I still mean to finish that stern greeting without laughing."] = "orc-male\\lore9555_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Stay a moment, friend. Yes, I mean you this time. You have become someone whose company I enjoy after the practical business is finished. Come along. We need no misunderstanding to arrange a little more conversation. I trust you to notice when something needs patience, and I am pleased to share the road with someone who does."] = "orc-male\\lore9976_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Look over what you need before leaving. Bows, arrows, a quiver, and repairs are practical matters. There is no honor in discovering halfway down the road that you admired your own plans more carefully than your equipment. Show me the damage now. You will have enough to concern you once the next fight begins."] = "orc-male\\lore9555_gear_1.ogg",
            ["You have come to Hammerfall. Good. Now give me reason to believe you can help keep it standing. The Witherbark and Boulderfist would drive us from these lands, and I have no intention of making that easy. Bring strength, bring tenacity, and leave the empty boasting for someone with time to listen to it."] = "orc-male\\lore2771_greet_1.ogg",
            ["You have come back. I heard your step before I looked up. There is no need to arrive with a speech about what I ought to feel. Stand beside me if you wish, or tell me something plain about the road. I can listen without promising the answer you may have hoped to hear."] = "orc-male\\lore2792_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Have a destination in mind? We can talk while you decide. I was just telling a story about a traveler who reached somewhere pleasant and had an ordinary evening. I think he has earned another one."] = "orc-male\\lore2861_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Still in one piece? Good. Come here and tell me what you have been doing. I expect there is something worth hearing beneath all that dust. If you have done well, I might even say so without immediately finding another thing to warn you about."] = "orc-male\\lore3143_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, friend. What brings you here today? A question about your next lesson, or something that needs a little time to understand? We can begin with either. If you have come before breakfast is settled, I may ask for your judgment on a less demanding matter first."] = "orc-male\\lore3173_greet_1.ogg",
            ["All right, let's go. If you've skipped a meal to get here, say so now. I don't want to hear about your great plans while your stomach argues louder than you do. A little food and some sense will carry you farther than pretending you need neither of them."] = "orc-male\\lore3191_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Ready? There's a whole world beyond the edge of that tower."] = "orc-male\\lore3310_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Ready to go? Make sure you can move your shoulders properly. A fine-looking outfit is little use if it fights you at every step. There. Much better. Let us see where the road takes us."] = "orc-male\\lore3317_greet_1.ogg",
            ["You again. Good. I could use a walk before someone asks whether a rarer herb would improve the mixture. First I would like them to try measuring the ordinary one."] = "orc-male\\lore3347_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back. Do you need supplies, or have you found something worth a closer look? It need not be rare. We pass useful things every day while imagining that the answer must grow somewhere more distant. Tell me what caught your attention before you tell me how difficult it was to obtain."] = "orc-male\\lore3348_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Back again? Good. Tell me what you are making before we count the thread. If you need blue dye, I have blue dye. If you need the color of a morning when everything finally went right, I may have the same bottle and a little more interest in your story."] = "orc-male\\lore3364_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good to see you. What are you planning to make? Something for the next journey, or something you would enjoy working on for its own sake? There is room for both among the supplies. I am always pleased when someone gives the leather-ball pattern a little attention beside the more serious purchases."] = "orc-male\\lore3366_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good. I know I can count on you to pay attention. Walk with me, and keep an eye on the ground as well as the road. There is a small column I would rather not disturb."] = "orc-male\\lore3389_greet_1.ogg",
            ["You came back. I am glad. We can walk for a while if you wish. I may not have much to say, but I would welcome your company."] = "orc-male\\lore3432_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Come along. I have heard enough useful news today. Tell me something that made you grin, and try not to start with the number of supplies we are missing."] = "orc-male\\lore3449_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Are we going somewhere in particular, or shall we enjoy a little walk? I spend enough time helping people get where they need to be. It is pleasant to have company without an urgent delivery waiting at the far end. Tell me what you have in mind, and we can get moving."] = "orc-male\\lore3615_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Shall we walk? You may choose the direction. If you have something pleasant planned, there is no need to explain it. I would enjoy finding out along the way."] = "orc-male\\lore4047_greet_1.ogg",
            ["What will you have? Think of the road ahead before you decide that you need nothing. If you want my favorite, I can give you an answer with great certainty. It may be different from the answer you heard yesterday. Another customer has reminded me of the quail, and I am considering the matter again."] = "orc-male\\lore4954_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Ready for a walk, or have you been running since dawn and calling that preparation? Tell me before we set out. I like a fine adventure as much as the next orc, but I prefer my companions with enough strength left to enjoy coming home. We can begin with a drink if you need one."] = "orc-male\\lore6928_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Need a bow, arrows, or a quiver? Tell me what you came for, and let me see what needs repair before you head out again. A proud story about your next fight can wait until you have the things to meet it. If you caught me examining this curl of wood, the story behind that can wait too."] = "orc-male\\lore9555_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Easy now. Give the creature a moment to settle before hurrying into the next thing. If I ask someone to stay, notice whom I am looking at. A hunter once obeyed while the beast kept walking. We sorted it out without shouting. A little attention would have saved us the trouble, though I enjoyed the laugh afterward."] = "orc-male\\lore9976_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Back again. Good. Put your burdens down before you start describing how heavy they were. There is time to hear what happened, and time to let the road leave your shoulders. To your safe return, then. It may be an ordinary toast, but I would rather have you here to hear it than invent a grander one without you."] = "orc-male\\lore6928_hearth_1.ogg",
            ["I once split a practice post with a blow that deserved a better opponent. I said as much. Then I tested a piece with my boot to make certain the wood had not been rotten. It was sound enough. A satisfying blow, then. I would still have preferred something that tried to strike back."] = "orc-male\\lore2771_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A familiar step can tell you who is coming before you turn your head. I have learned a few of them here. Once, I was certain I knew a visitor's boots and looked up to find someone else. He stayed awhile anyway. I found I did not much mind being wrong about the sound."] = "orc-male\\lore2792_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Then the traveler found a seat, put down his pack, and enjoyed the view. What happened next? Nothing troubling. I know, an unusual ending. The world can provide its own dangers. I am giving this fellow a peaceful afternoon."] = "orc-male\\lore2861_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Well done. That should be simple enough to say. Two words. Yet somehow I keep finding a warning to put after them. You may remind me to stop when I have already made my point. Once. Do not make a new habit of it."] = "orc-male\\lore3143_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Plain bread, or honey? It is a small choice, but the day has room for one small choice to be made slowly. I usually cut the bread in two. A satisfactory arrangement. Now I have a quiet moment, something sweet, and no reason to hurry either half."] = "orc-male\\lore3173_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Those seeds are for planting. Not rubbish, not a decoration, and not something I put aside because I enjoy making more work for myself. The troops get enough meat and fish. I'd like to see something sweet growing closer to hand. There's nothing complicated about wanting that."] = "orc-male\\lore3191_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Some riders count the coins. I watch for the smile when they come back."] = "orc-male\\lore3310_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A cat once fell asleep on a shirt I meant to sell. I could have moved it. Instead, I found another shirt. A little purring was doing more for the afternoon than another hurried sale."] = "orc-male\\lore3317_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Whuut has talent. I will say that much. Getting him to slow down long enough to use it properly is another matter. Still, I would rather teach someone who wants to learn everything."] = "orc-male\\lore3347_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I once paid rather well for an unfamiliar dried herb. Then someone showed me the same plant growing beside my usual walk. I kept the wrapping. It reminds me that an impressive journey to the shelf does not mean I understand what is sitting there. An ordinary plant can be an expensive lesson."] = "orc-male\\lore3348_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Someone once asked me for a blue that felt like the rain had finally stopped. The dye was ordinary enough. The name stayed with me. Next time they came in, I asked about the weather. They laughed, and told me the week had improved. A useful thing to know."] = "orc-male\\lore3364_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A customer once laughed at the leather-ball pattern while buying supplies for armor. I thought the pattern had already done something worthwhile. There is skill in work that people enjoy. I like hearing what someone would make if they allowed themselves to choose a project simply because it looked like fun."] = "orc-male\\lore3366_idle_1.ogg",
            ["An ant found a stone in its path. Went around it. The rest followed without a single argument. I watched for longer than I intended. No, there is no inspection report about it."] = "orc-male\\lore3389_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Her name is Olgra. I want that remembered when people speak of what happened. She was more than the loss that brought me to the Crossroads."] = "orc-male\\lore3432_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I ought to ask Jin'Zil for an ordinary bit of news. A bad joke would do. Something completely useless, just to know he still remembers how to make me regret asking for a story."] = "orc-male\\lore3449_idle_1.ogg",
            ["My wind riders can make good time through this heat. I am quite proud of that. But when the work is finished, I enjoy taking a walk at my own pace. Sometimes I stop longer than I intended. That is part of the pleasure when nobody is waiting for me to deliver something."] = "orc-male\\lore3615_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A visitor once took every question I asked as proof that I knew the answer. We had a very long conversation, and I learned almost nothing about what he wanted."] = "orc-male\\lore4047_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I gave a customer a very firm answer about my favorite meal. Then the next order reminded me of another choice, and I began again. This has happened more than once. I see no fault in it. If a question keeps giving you a reason to look forward to dinner, it is a question worth considering carefully."] = "orc-male\\lore4954_idle_1.ogg",
            ["To the putting away of supplies, without which every grand victory would end in an argument about where the food went. No? Too long? I am still working on that one. It deserves a little dignity. People notice a warrior at the gate, but they certainly notice when the shelves behind him are empty."] = "orc-male\\lore6928_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A shaving of wood curled so neatly that I held it beneath my nose and tried a stern greeting on a visitor. An impressive mustache. A very short performance. He laughed, and I could not keep the face. I have been practicing. The trouble is remembering the expression before I start enjoying the mustache myself."] = "orc-male\\lore9555_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I asked a departing beast to stay a moment, and its hunter stopped instead. The beast had other intentions. Once I explained whom I meant, the hunter laughed. Now I make the instruction clearer. Sometimes I do mean the hunter should stay. There is no harm in enjoying the conversation after the animal has settled."] = "orc-male\\lore9976_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Greater power is not the same as greater readiness. You have shown patience in your studies, and that matters. Take what you have learned into the next lesson. Knowing when to act is useful. Knowing when to stay your hand deserves just as much attention."] = "orc-male\\lore3173_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Speargrass and cattail. Nothing exotic. Whuut could hardly believe what a careful hand made from them. Remember that when someone tells you the secret must be an expensive ingredient."] = "orc-male\\lore3347_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Yelmak wanted Whuut to give the local plants another look. The apprentice has talent, but talent needs practice as well as rare ingredients. I helped gather what Yelmak needed for the lesson. New eyes on old ingredients can lead somewhere interesting, if pride leaves enough room for a useful question."] = "orc-male\\lore3348_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Read the pattern and give the work its proper attention. Whether the finished piece is meant for a difficult journey or a little amusement, someone will appreciate the care. I sell patterns for armor kits and for a leather ball. I am pleased when both sorts of project find their way into capable hands."] = "orc-male\\lore3366_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Wrap the hard edges before you put that among the cloth. A little care now saves a great deal of cursing later. I have heard enough arguments with torn sleeves to know how those end."] = "orc-male\\lore3317_loot_1.ogg",
            ["The enemy you have already beaten is no reason to grow comfortable. There are harder foes ahead, and Hammerfall needs fighters who can meet them. Finish the task, return, and tell me what happened. If battle tests you, let it find tenacity. I have respect for someone who keeps answering the challenge when it grows harder."] = "orc-male\\lore2771_quest_1.ogg",
            ["You followed it through. Well done. I was about to add something about the next task, but that can wait. Let the work you finished have its moment. An honest effort deserves recognition, and you should not have to dig through three warnings to find it."] = "orc-male\\lore3143_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Good. Useful work finished, and something to show for it. That's worth more than a fine account of what you nearly did. Now put what you've brought somewhere it won't be crushed, scattered, or stepped on. The last bit of care still matters when you're almost done."] = "orc-male\\lore3191_quest_1.ogg",
            ["You did well. Tell me what happened while the details are clear. Courage matters, but so does giving the next person enough knowledge to stand where you stood and do the work properly."] = "orc-male\\lore3389_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Good work. Tell it plainly. If somebody else did the dangerous part, give them the credit. A useful account names the right person, even when the story would sound better with your name in it."] = "orc-male\\lore3449_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Tell me what you know, and what remains uncertain. We can be grateful for good work without pretending every mystery is settled. Some answers will require more time and more careful eyes."] = "orc-male\\lore4047_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Stay a moment if you wish. You need not search for the words that will put an old memory right. Tell me something ordinary, or let the silence stand. I have heard enough people speak as though a better sentence would settle everything. For now, I am willing to share this moment with you as it is."] = "orc-male\\lore2792_rest_1.ogg",
            ["We can stop here. There need not be a speech, or another promise made before we go on. Stay a little while, my friend. That is enough to ask for now."] = "orc-male\\lore3432_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Take the time to enjoy what you brought. Provisions are worth remembering before a journey, and a meal is worth noticing once you stop. Tell me what you chose. I may already have decided on something else, but there is still time to hear your argument. The road will give us enough to hurry over afterward."] = "orc-male\\lore4954_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Let the creature settle before asking for more. You can use the moment yourself. A quieter voice and a little attention often make the next part easier than another shouted instruction would. There is time to see how your companion is doing. If I ask you to stay, I may simply be enjoying the company while we wait."] = "orc-male\\lore9976_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Know where you are headed before you leave. Then, when there is a moment, enjoy the view. A journey does not have to become a grand tale to be worth making. Some of the best ones end with a simple welcome."] = "orc-male\\lore2861_taxi_1.ogg",
            ["Hands steady. Pack secure. Now look out there... that's yours to see."] = "orc-male\\lore3310_taxi_1.ogg",
            ["Before you settle in, make certain everything you are carrying is secure. A little care now makes the journey easier to enjoy. And when you arrive somewhere new, remember to meet its wind rider master. Knowing where you can return is a useful part of knowing where you have been."] = "orc-male\\lore3615_taxi_1.ogg",
        },
        ["skyborne-female"] = {
            ["Welcome back!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_alive_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Gave me a fright."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_alive_2.ogg",
            ["Back on your feet! Good."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_alive_3.ogg",
            ["Good as new. Well, nearly."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_alive_4.ogg",
            ["Don't scare me like that again."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_alive_5.ogg",
            ["Bravo!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_applaudToo_1.ogg",
            ["Well done!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_applaudToo_2.ogg",
            ["Encore!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_applaudToo_3.ogg",
            ["I'll wait here."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_away_1.ogg",
            ["Take your time. I'm not going anywhere."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_away_2.ogg",
            ["I'll keep an eye on things."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_away_3.ogg",
            ["Off you go. I'll mind the spot."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_away_4.ogg",
            ["Wake me if anything exciting happens."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_away_5.ogg",
            ["Welcome back. No, I had not prepared a speech for the occasion. Well, perhaps the beginning of one. Never mind that now. Tell me where you went, and whether it was anything like you expected. I would much rather hear your story than finish rehearsing mine."] = "skyborne-female\\lore251362_back_1.ogg",
            ["There you are."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_back_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_back_2.ogg",
            ["Ah, you're back. Shall we?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_back_3.ogg",
            ["Ah, good. I was starting to talk to myself."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_back_4.ogg",
            ["Ready? Me too."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_back_5.ogg",
            ["Don't try to force everything in on top of the fruit. Sort it out properly. You've carried that lot this far; there's no sense bruising it now because you're too impatient to put the bag down. A little care at the end still counts as work."] = "skyborne-female\\lore252800_bagsFull_1.ogg",
            ["Your bags are bursting. Time to sell a few things."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_bagsFull_1.ogg",
            ["No room left? I know a merchant or two."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_bagsFull_2.ogg",
            ["You're carrying half the countryside."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_bagsFull_3.ogg",
            ["Your pack's going to split at the seams."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_bagsFull_4.ogg",
            ["I am glad you asked me along. Usually I watch someone take their first steps and wonder what they will find beyond the village. This time I get to share a little of the journey. You needn't impress me every moment; I am here because I enjoy your company."] = "skyborne-female\\lore251362_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have listened without pretending every question has an easy answer. I value that. Come with me, friend. There is much worth noticing, and I would like your company while we look. If I bring my drawings, you may tell me honestly whether the bird has become any more convincing."] = "skyborne-female\\lore251487_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have given me company I value, and allowed me time to grow comfortable saying so. Come along, friend. We may find something worth learning together. If you tell me afterward that you enjoyed the day, I will try to let those words remain exactly as you offered them."] = "skyborne-female\\lore252382_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Fine. You're my friend. I thought I'd say it plainly before you started looking for another errand to earn the privilege. You've stayed long enough for me to know I like having you around. Come on, then. We can have a little company without putting a price on it."] = "skyborne-female\\lore252800_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would be glad to come with you. Your visits have become one of the things I look forward to, and it will be lovely to have a conversation that does not end with my hurrying off to fetch something. Today I can simply be your friend for a while."] = "skyborne-female\\lore254089_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have stayed for more than a lesson or a plate of food. I have come to look forward to your visits, and I would be glad to travel with you. Wherever we go, we can make room for a meal and a familiar voice beside it."] = "skyborne-female\\lore257006_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Likewise."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_bowBack_1.ogg",
            ["An honor."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_bowBack_2.ogg",
            ["The pleasure's mine."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_bowBack_3.ogg",
            ["{friend} is your Buddy now? The more the merrier!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_buddy_1.ogg",
            ["Another Buddy. Should I be jealous?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_buddy_2.ogg",
            ["Another Buddy! Your circle's getting crowded."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_buddy_3.ogg",
            ["Good choice. I'd vouch for them."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_buddy_4.ogg",
            ["Hooray!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_cheerAlong_1.ogg",
            ["Huzzah!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_cheerAlong_2.ogg",
            ["Three cheers!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_cheerAlong_3.ogg",
            ["Who are you calling chicken?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_chickenBack_1.ogg",
            ["Bawk yourself."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_chickenBack_2.ogg",
            ["I'm brave! I'm just brave quietly."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_chickenBack_3.ogg",
            ["Well fought!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatEnd_1.ogg",
            ["That's how it's done."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatEnd_2.ogg",
            ["Everyone in one piece? Good."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatEnd_3.ogg",
            ["Ha! They won't try that again."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatEnd_4.ogg",
            ["I'll admit, my heart was pounding."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatEnd_5.ogg",
            ["Nicely done."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatEnd_6.ogg",
            ["Is it over? It's over. Good."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatEnd_7.ogg",
            ["Remind me never to make you angry."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatEnd_8.ogg",
            ["Not bad at all!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatEnd_9.ogg",
            ["Victory! I'll be telling everyone about that one."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatEnd_10.ogg",
            ["Catch your breath. You earned it."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatEnd_11.ogg",
            ["And not a scratch on me. Thanks to you."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatEnd_12.ogg",
            ["Hold on, it's weakening!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatLong_1.ogg",
            ["Don't give up now!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatLong_2.ogg",
            ["Steady. Steady."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatLong_3.ogg",
            ["This one's stubborn. Keep at it!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatLong_4.ogg",
            ["It's tiring! I can see it!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatLong_5.ogg",
            ["Long fight. You've got more in you."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatLong_6.ogg",
            ["Keep at it!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_1.ogg",
            ["Good hit!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_2.ogg",
            ["Watch your back!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_3.ogg",
            ["That's it, that's it!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_4.ogg",
            ["You've got it on the run!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_5.ogg",
            ["Don't let up!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_6.ogg",
            ["Ha! Did you see that?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_7.ogg",
            ["Nearly there!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_8.ogg",
            ["Hit it again!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_9.ogg",
            ["It's on its last legs!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_10.ogg",
            ["Mind your footing!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_11.ogg",
            ["That one's going to leave a mark!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_12.ogg",
            ["Go on! Go on!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_13.ogg",
            ["You make this look like a dance!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_14.ogg",
            ["Swing that blade! Go on!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_15.ogg",
            ["Into the thick of it! That's the way!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_16.ogg",
            ["The Light's with you! Now hit it!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_17.ogg",
            ["Let your pet have a go!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_18.ogg",
            ["Nice shot! Right on target!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_19.ogg",
            ["Where'd you go? Oh! There you are! Stab it!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_20.ogg",
            ["Patch yourself up, then smite it!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_21.ogg",
            ["Call the storm down on it!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_22.ogg",
            ["Burn it! Burn it all! Well, just that one."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_23.ogg",
            ["Whatever that green fire is, keep doing it!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_24.ogg",
            ["Turn into something big and scary!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatMid_25.ogg",
            ["Look out!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatStart_1.ogg",
            ["Here they come!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatStart_2.ogg",
            ["Give them what for!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatStart_3.ogg",
            ["Stay sharp!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatStart_4.ogg",
            ["On your guard!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatStart_5.ogg",
            ["Here we go again!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatStart_6.ogg",
            ["Watch it, it's coming right at you!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatStart_7.ogg",
            ["Show them what you've got!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_combatStart_8.ogg",
            ["Chin up. It'll be all right."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_comforted_1.ogg",
            ["I'm here if you need me."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_comforted_2.ogg",
            ["Thank you. I needed that."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_comforted_3.ogg",
            ["Ha! All right, I'll dance."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_danceAlong_1.ogg",
            ["I haven't danced in ages!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_danceAlong_2.ogg",
            ["Well, if you insist!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_danceAlong_3.ogg",
            ["Watch my feet. Or don't."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_danceAlong_4.ogg",
            ["Easy now. Let's get you back on your feet."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_died_1.ogg",
            ["That looked like it hurt."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_died_2.ogg",
            ["Don't worry. Happens to the best of us."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_died_3.ogg",
            ["We'll come back stronger."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_died_4.ogg",
            ["Oh, that's not good."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_died_5.ogg",
            ["Well. That could have gone better."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_died_6.ogg",
            ["Let's agree that one didn't count."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_died_7.ogg",
            ["Lie still. I'll keep watch."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_died_8.ogg",
            ["Keep close in here."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_dungeon_1.ogg",
            ["I don't like the look of this place."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_dungeon_2.ogg",
            ["Watch your step. And your back."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_dungeon_3.ogg",
            ["It's dark in here. I don't love the dark."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_dungeon_4.ogg",
            ["Stay together. Nobody wander off."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_dungeon_5.ogg",
            ["Very impressive."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_flexBack_1.ogg",
            ["Don't hurt yourself."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_flexBack_2.ogg",
            ["Put those away before someone gets hurt."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_flexBack_3.ogg",
            ["That looks good on you."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_gear_1.ogg",
            ["New armor? Very sharp."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_gear_2.ogg",
            ["You'll turn heads in that."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_gear_3.ogg",
            ["Shiny! Did you polish that yourself?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_gear_4.ogg",
            ["That suits you. Very heroic."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_gear_5.ogg",
            ["Now you look the part."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_gear_6.ogg",
            ["Come on, your body's this way."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_ghost_1.ogg",
            ["I'll walk with you. Don't mind the chill."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_ghost_2.ogg",
            ["You look a bit see-through. It's fine. Mostly fine."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_ghost_3.ogg",
            ["Follow the road. I'll be right here."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_ghost_4.ogg",
            ["Is it cold, being a ghost? You look cold."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_ghost_5.ogg",
            ["There you are. Take a breath before we set off; excitement has a way of making everything feel urgent. You do not need an answer to every question today. We can begin with the path in front of us, and you can tell me what you are looking forward to."] = "skyborne-female\\lore251362_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back. What have you noticed on your travels? Take a moment before answering. I would rather hear one thing you truly observed than a grand explanation assembled in haste. And if you have come to inspect my latest drawing, I should first mention that it has wings."] = "skyborne-female\\lore251487_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back. Have you brought a question, or news of what you have learned? I am glad to hear either. If you have come simply to thank me, I shall try to accept it without immediately listing everyone else who deserves a share of the credit."] = "skyborne-female\\lore252382_greet_1.ogg",
            ["All right, I'm coming. If we're going to walk, you can tell me what you've been doing while we go. Preferably something better than promising to help and vanishing. Oh, don't look like that. If I thought you were that sort, I wouldn't be here beside you."] = "skyborne-female\\lore252800_greet_1.ogg",
            ["A walk with you sounds rather pleasant. I have spent enough time telling other people to take a break that I ought to manage one myself. Shall we find somewhere comfortable along the way? You can tell me your news without having to lean across a counter to do it."] = "skyborne-female\\lore254089_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Come along, then. There is always something to learn beyond the kitchen, though I make no promises about passing a good ingredient without stopping. Have you eaten? We can discuss the day's grand plans much more comfortably when neither of us is thinking about an empty bowl."] = "skyborne-female\\lore257006_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Lead the way, {name}."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Glad to come along, {name}!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_greet_2.ogg",
            ["Where are we off to today?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_greet_3.ogg",
            ["I told the others I'd be out for a while. Let's make it count."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_greet_4.ogg",
            ["It's good to get away from the counter for once."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_greet_5.ogg",
            ["Ready when you are, {name}."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_greet_6.ogg",
            ["Some fresh air will do me good."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_greet_7.ogg",
            ["Don't walk too fast. I'm not used to all this adventuring."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_greet_8.ogg",
            ["Well met, {name}! Good to see a friendly face."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_greet_9.ogg",
            ["Right behind you. Where to first?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_greet_10.ogg",
            ["I packed a lunch. Just in case."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_greet_11.ogg",
            ["Off on an adventure! Don't tell my boss."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_greet_12.ogg",
            ["Fresh boots, fresh start. Let's go."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_greet_13.ogg",
            ["I've been looking forward to this all week."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_greet_14.ogg",
            ["More company! Wonderful."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_group_1.ogg",
            ["Strength in numbers."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_group_2.ogg",
            ["New faces! Hello, everyone."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_group_3.ogg",
            ["A whole party. Now it's an adventure."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_group_4.ogg",
            ["Homeward, then. I hope you will put your things down before planning the next departure. A familiar room can do a great deal for a tired traveler, especially when there is someone pleased to see you in it. Stay long enough to enjoy being welcomed back this time."] = "skyborne-female\\lore254089_hearth_1.ogg",
            ["Home again!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_hearth_1.ogg",
            ["Off to the inn. My treat. Well, your treat."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_hearth_2.ogg",
            ["Home sweet home."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_hearth_3.ogg",
            ["Back to a warm bed. Finally."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_hearth_4.ogg",
            ["Oh! Well. That's nice."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_hugged_1.ogg",
            ["Aw, thank you."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_hugged_2.ogg",
            ["Oh, you big softie."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_hugged_3.ogg",
            ["I had a fine welcome planned once. Very impressive, very polished, and entirely too much like giving orders. I tried saying less. People found it easier to answer me then. A conversation is a better beginning than making someone stand patiently through all your carefully chosen words."] = "skyborne-female\\lore251362_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I began drawing birds to practice looking carefully. Every feather seems quite clear until I put them together on the page. Then something rather unexpected appears. Still, I ask others to exercise their gifts. It would be a poor example if I abandoned mine at the first awkward attempt."] = "skyborne-female\\lore251487_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A learner thanked me for making a difficult path clearer. I explained how much their own patience had done. They thanked me again. Apparently both things could be true. I am practicing a shorter reply now. It requires less explanation than I keep wanting to give it."] = "skyborne-female\\lore252382_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A galestrider will help itself to your apples and then look offended when you object. Bandits have much the same manners, though at least the bird doesn't try to explain that taking your harvest is some ancient right you've failed to appreciate. Give me the bird's honesty any day."] = "skyborne-female\\lore252800_idle_1.ogg",
            ["That extra cup people keep asking about is mine. A reminder to sit down once everyone is settled. It works rather well, provided nobody begins a particularly interesting story. Then I forget the drink entirely, and by the time I remember it, I have another cold cup to explain."] = "skyborne-female\\lore254089_idle_1.ogg",
            ["That little scowling face beside the recipe? Mine. The first attempt deserved it. The next was better, and eventually I drew a smile. I leave them all there. A learner ought to know that the cook offering advice has also made something she would rather not serve."] = "skyborne-female\\lore257006_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Nice day for it."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_1.ogg",
            ["{zone} is lovely this time of year."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_2.ogg",
            ["Don't mind me. I'm enjoying the company."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_3.ogg",
            ["You know, I don't get out nearly enough."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_4.ogg",
            ["My feet are already sore. In a good way."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_5.ogg",
            ["I wonder how things are back home without me."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_6.ogg",
            ["Every road looks different when you're not working."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_7.ogg",
            ["Have you ever just stopped and listened to the wind?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_8.ogg",
            ["I could get used to this."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_9.ogg",
            ["Don't tell anyone, but this beats standing in one spot all day."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_10.ogg",
            ["If you need a hand, just say the word."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_11.ogg",
            ["Good company makes the miles shorter."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_12.ogg",
            ["Mind if I stretch? Old bones."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_13.ogg",
            ["Getting late. The stars will be out soon."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_14.ogg",
            ["Quiet night. I like quiet nights."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_15.ogg",
            ["We've been at it for a while. You're tireless, you know that?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_16.ogg",
            ["I used to wonder what was past the next hill. Now I know: another hill."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_17.ogg",
            ["Do you ever get used to all this walking?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_18.ogg",
            ["I've heard stories about you, you know. Some of them are even nice."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_19.ogg",
            ["Smell that? Somebody's cooking something good nearby."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_20.ogg",
            ["If anyone asks, I'm on important business."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_21.ogg",
            ["You're easy company. I mean that kindly."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_22.ogg",
            ["I keep thinking I left something on the stove."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_23.ogg",
            ["Look at that sky."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_24.ogg",
            ["Back home they'll never believe where I've been."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_25.ogg",
            ["I should have brought a better pair of boots."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_26.ogg",
            ["Funny how a quiet road can feel like a holiday."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_27.ogg",
            ["Do adventurers ever take a day off? Asking for a friend. The friend is me."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_28.ogg",
            ["I've counted twelve birds since we set out. Thirteen. Never mind."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_29.ogg",
            ["One of these days you'll have to tell me how you got started."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_30.ogg",
            ["You can tell a lot about someone by how they walk. You walk like you mean it."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_31.ogg",
            ["I'm not complaining. I'm just saying my feet have opinions."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_32.ogg",
            ["Sorry, I've had the same tune stuck in my head all day."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_33.ogg",
            ["If we pass a merchant, remind me I need thread."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_34.ogg",
            ["I wonder what the folks back home are gossiping about."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_35.ogg",
            ["Every time I think I've seen it all, you take me somewhere new."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_36.ogg",
            ["It's peaceful out here. Until it isn't."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_37.ogg",
            ["I could do with a cup of something warm."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_38.ogg",
            ["Morning air's the best air."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_39.ogg",
            ["Early start, eh? I approve."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_40.ogg",
            ["The light's going gold. Best time of day."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_41.ogg",
            ["Stars are out. Makes you feel small, doesn't it?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_42.ogg",
            ["Shouldn't we both be in bed by now?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_43.ogg",
            ["Long day. Good day, though."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_44.ogg",
            ["Still going? I'll say this for you: you don't quit."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_idle_45.ogg",
            ["Ha! I'll have to remember that one."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_jokeBack_1.ogg",
            ["Oh, that's terrible. Tell it again."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_jokeBack_2.ogg",
            ["I'm stealing that one."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_jokeBack_3.ogg",
            ["Oh my."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_kissed_1.ogg",
            ["Well, I never."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_kissed_2.ogg",
            ["Now you've made me blush."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_kissed_3.ogg",
            ["Safe and sound."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_landed_1.ogg",
            ["Good landing. I'll tell the birds."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_landed_2.ogg",
            ["Solid ground. Feels strange after all that sky."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_landed_3.ogg",
            ["Down we come. Legs still work? Good."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_landed_4.ogg",
            ["That was a fine flight."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_landed_5.ogg",
            ["Ha! Good one."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_laughAlong_1.ogg",
            ["Heh. You're funny."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_laughAlong_2.ogg",
            ["Ha! That laugh of yours is catching."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_laughAlong_3.ogg",
            ["A gift needs practice, and practice needs attention. For Windshapers, Skysight can bring the mortal and spiritual closer together. The convergence strengthens its boon. Remember what you learn there when you travel onward. Understanding matters more than returning with a confident claim that you have mastered it all."] = "skyborne-female\\lore251487_learned_1.ogg",
            ["The power of the elements is not a possession to hold without thought. Respect it in your travels, as you did while learning to approach it. A completed trial is a beginning. What you carry from it should include understanding, not only the sign that you succeeded."] = "skyborne-female\\lore252382_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Learning something new? Good for you."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Always improving. I admire that."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_learned_2.ogg",
            ["Something new up your sleeve? I'll be watching."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_learned_3.ogg",
            ["The more you know, the better. That's what I always say."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_learned_4.ogg",
            ["Level {level}! Well done, {name}!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_levelUp_1.ogg",
            ["Look at you, {name}. Level {level} already."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_levelUp_2.ogg",
            ["Level {level}! That calls for a cheer!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_levelUp_3.ogg",
            ["Level {level}. I've seen a lot of adventurers come and go. You're one of the good ones."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_levelUp_4.ogg",
            ["Ha! Level {level}! Well earned."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_levelUp_5.ogg",
            ["Level {level}. Wait until I tell everyone back home."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_levelUp_6.ogg",
            ["Stronger every day. I can see it."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_levelUp_7.ogg",
            ["Another level! I knew you had it in you."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_levelUp_8.ogg",
            ["Well, look who's moving up in the world."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_levelUp_9.ogg",
            ["Another step up. Mind you don't get a big head."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_levelUp_10.ogg",
            ["{item}! Now that's a find."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_loot_1.ogg",
            ["Well, look at that. {item}."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_loot_2.ogg",
            ["{item}! Lucky day."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_loot_3.ogg",
            ["Ooh, what did you find?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_loot_4.ogg",
            ["Anything good in there?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_loot_5.ogg",
            ["Pockets full! Nice."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_loot_6.ogg",
            ["You're hurt! Get out of there!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_lowHealth_1.ogg",
            ["Careful! You're nearly done in!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_lowHealth_2.ogg",
            ["Back off and catch your breath!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_lowHealth_3.ogg",
            ["You're bleeding! Fall back!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_lowHealth_4.ogg",
            ["Get out of there!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_lowHealth_5.ogg",
            ["Drink something! Anything!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_lowHealth_6.ogg",
            ["This isn't worth dying over!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_lowHealth_7.ogg",
            ["Run! I'll tell everyone you were brave!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_lowHealth_8.ogg",
            ["Bandage! Potion! Something!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_lowHealth_9.ogg",
            ["Hang on! Don't you dare go down!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_lowHealth_10.ogg",
            ["Looks like you've got mail."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_mail_1.ogg",
            ["Someone's written to you. How nice."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_mail_2.ogg",
            ["A letter! I hope it's good news."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_mail_3.ogg",
            ["Mail for you. Somebody's thinking of you."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_mail_4.ogg",
            ["Level {level}! There's nothing left to teach you, is there?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_maxLevel_1.ogg",
            ["The very top! I'm honored to have come along for it."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_maxLevel_2.ogg",
            ["That's the peak. Where do you go from here? Anywhere you like, I suppose."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_maxLevel_3.ogg",
            ["Riding in style, I see."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_mount_1.ogg",
            ["Fine animal you've got there."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_mount_2.ogg",
            ["I'll just walk alongside, shall I?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_mount_3.ogg",
            ["Now that's a proper way to travel."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_mount_4.ogg",
            ["Does it have a name? It looks like it should have a name."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_mount_5.ogg",
            ["{friend} seems friendly."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_newFriend_1.ogg",
            ["I've heard good things about {friend}."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_newFriend_2.ogg",
            ["Another friend! You collect them like coins."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_newFriend_3.ogg",
            ["Another friendly face. You're good at this."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_newFriend_4.ogg",
            ["You make friends faster than I make tea."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_newFriend_5.ogg",
            ["What is it? I don't see anything."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_pointToo_1.ogg",
            ["Where? Oh! No, I still don't see it."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_pointToo_2.ogg",
            ["Is it something good? Or something bad?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_pointToo_3.ogg",
            ["Yes, {name}?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_1.ogg",
            ["Hm? Something on your mind?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_2.ogg",
            ["I'm right here."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_3.ogg",
            ["Careful, now."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_4.ogg",
            ["Ha! You're a funny one."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_5.ogg",
            ["Need something?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_6.ogg",
            ["Still here, still with you."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_7.ogg",
            ["What is it? Did you see something?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_8.ogg",
            ["If that's how you say hello where you're from, all right."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_9.ogg",
            ["I'm listening."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_10.ogg",
            ["Still breathing, if that's what you're checking."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_11.ogg",
            ["Was that a poke or a question?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_12.ogg",
            ["Easy! I bruise like a peach."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_13.ogg",
            ["You have my full attention. Mostly."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_14.ogg",
            ["Hm? Sorry, I was miles away."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_15.ogg",
            ["Ask away."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_16.ogg",
            ["Ow. Was that necessary?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_17.ogg",
            ["What, did I miss something?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_18.ogg",
            ["Present and accounted for."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_19.ogg",
            ["Yes, yes, I see you."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_poke_20.ogg",
            ["All right, all right, I'm awake!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_pokeMany_1.ogg",
            ["Is this going to keep happening?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_pokeMany_2.ogg",
            ["You'd think I was a doorbell."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_pokeMany_3.ogg",
            ["I'm starting to think you enjoy this."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_pokeMany_4.ogg",
            ["Enough! I surrender!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_pokeMany_5.ogg",
            ["One more and I'm going home. I mean it. Probably."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_pokeMany_6.ogg",
            ["Another job done. Nicely handled."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Well done! They'll be grateful."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_quest_2.ogg",
            ["You've a knack for helping folk."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_quest_3.ogg",
            ["That's one more person sleeping easier tonight."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_quest_4.ogg",
            ["Good work. Who's next?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_quest_5.ogg",
            ["Word gets around. People will remember that."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_quest_6.ogg",
            ["Nicely done. Somebody's going to tell that story at the inn."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_quest_7.ogg",
            ["That's the way!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_quest_8.ogg",
            ["You make it look easy."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_quest_9.ogg",
            ["Done and done. What's next?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_quest_10.ogg",
            ["Another errand? I like your spirit."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_questAccepted_1.ogg",
            ["Off we go, then."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_questAccepted_2.ogg",
            ["Somebody's lucky you came along."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_questAccepted_3.ogg",
            ["Here we go again. I love it."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_questAccepted_4.ogg",
            ["Sounds like trouble. Count me in."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_questAccepted_5.ogg",
            ["Hm? Did I doze off?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_reload_1.ogg",
            ["Strange. I could swear the world just blinked."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_reload_2.ogg",
            ["Where was I? Oh, right. With you."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_reload_3.ogg",
            ["Hm. I lost my train of thought. Something about the road."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_reload_4.ogg",
            ["Sit a moment. When I used to make those journeys, people wanted the crawler meat almost before I had arrived. It is the welcome I remember as much as the food. We cannot make every journey again today, but we can still share a good meal here."] = "skyborne-female\\lore257006_rest_1.ogg",
            ["A good place to rest our feet."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Nothing like a warm inn."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_rest_2.ogg",
            ["I could sit here all day."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_rest_3.ogg",
            ["A chair, a fire, good company. That's living."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_rest_4.ogg",
            ["Let's stay a moment. My feet insist."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_rest_5.ogg",
            ["Easy there, tiger."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_roarBack_1.ogg",
            ["Very fierce. I'm terrified."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_roarBack_2.ogg",
            ["Was that a roar or a yawn?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_roarBack_3.ogg",
            ["Charming."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_rudeBack_1.ogg",
            ["I'll pretend I didn't see that."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_rudeBack_2.ogg",
            ["Well, I never! Actually, I have. But still."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_rudeBack_3.ogg",
            ["At your service."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_saluteBack_1.ogg",
            ["Sir! Or madam."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_saluteBack_2.ogg",
            ["Standing ready!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_saluteBack_3.ogg",
            ["Oh, it's {friend}! Say hello for me."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_seeFriend_1.ogg",
            ["{friend}! Good to see a friendly face."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_seeFriend_2.ogg",
            ["Look who it is! Give them a wave."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_seeFriend_3.ogg",
            ["Oh, I know them! Small world."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_seeFriend_4.ogg",
            ["No need to be shy."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_shyToo_1.ogg",
            ["Aw, don't hide."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_shyToo_2.ogg",
            ["You're among friends here."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_shyToo_3.ogg",
            ["Don't mind if I do."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_sitToo_1.ogg",
            ["Good idea. My knees agree."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_sitToo_2.ogg",
            ["Ah, that's better."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_sitToo_3.ogg",
            ["I could use a nap myself."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_sleepToo_1.ogg",
            ["Wake me when it's time to go."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_sleepToo_2.ogg",
            ["A nap does sound nice."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_sleepToo_3.ogg",
            ["Up we go! Never gets old."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_taxi_1.ogg",
            ["Look at it all down there."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_taxi_2.ogg",
            ["A good gryphon is worth its weight in gold."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_taxi_3.ogg",
            ["Hold on tight!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_taxi_4.ogg",
            ["I'll never get tired of this view."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_taxi_5.ogg",
            ["Don't look down. Actually, do. It's lovely."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_taxi_6.ogg",
            ["The wind up here! Hold on to your hat."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_taxi_7.ogg",
            ["Anytime."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_thanked_1.ogg",
            ["Happy to help."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_thanked_2.ogg",
            ["Don't mention it."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_thanked_3.ogg",
            ["{friend} thinks of you as {tier} now. I'm not surprised."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_tier_1.ogg",
            ["Making friends everywhere you go, aren't you?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_tier_2.ogg",
            ["People really warm to you, don't they?"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_tier_3.ogg",
            ["That friendship's growing. Nice to see."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_tier_4.ogg",
            ["Hello!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_waveBack_1.ogg",
            ["Hi there!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_waveBack_2.ogg",
            ["Well, hello to you too."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_waveBack_3.ogg",
            ["Right back at you!"] = "skyborne-female\\npc_waveBack_4.ogg",
            ["So this is {zone}."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_zone_1.ogg",
            ["{zone}, eh? Lead on."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_zone_2.ogg",
            ["I haven't been to {zone} in years."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_zone_3.ogg",
            ["{zone}. Stay sharp."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_zone_4.ogg",
            ["Ah, {zone}. Look at that view."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_zone_5.ogg",
            ["New place, new faces."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_zone_6.ogg",
            ["Keep your eyes open. I don't know these parts."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_zone_7.ogg",
            ["I've only ever heard stories about this place."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_zone_8.ogg",
            ["Look at it all. Worth the walk."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_zone_9.ogg",
            ["Smells different here. Not bad, just different."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_zone_10.ogg",
            ["I'd better remember the way back."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_zone_11.ogg",
            ["Well, this is a change of scenery."] = "skyborne-female\\npc_zone_12.ogg",
        },
        ["skyborne-male"] = {
            ["Welcome back!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_alive_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Gave me a fright."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_alive_2.ogg",
            ["Back on your feet! Good."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_alive_3.ogg",
            ["Good as new. Well, nearly."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_alive_4.ogg",
            ["Don't scare me like that again."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_alive_5.ogg",
            ["Bravo!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_applaudToo_1.ogg",
            ["Well done!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_applaudToo_2.ogg",
            ["Encore!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_applaudToo_3.ogg",
            ["I'll wait here."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_away_1.ogg",
            ["Take your time. I'm not going anywhere."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_away_2.ogg",
            ["I'll keep an eye on things."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_away_3.ogg",
            ["Off you go. I'll mind the spot."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_away_4.ogg",
            ["Wake me if anything exciting happens."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_away_5.ogg",
            ["There you are."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_back_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_back_2.ogg",
            ["Ah, you're back. Shall we?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_back_3.ogg",
            ["Ah, good. I was starting to talk to myself."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_back_4.ogg",
            ["Ready? Me too."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_back_5.ogg",
            ["Your bags are bursting. Time to sell a few things."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_bagsFull_1.ogg",
            ["No room left? I know a merchant or two."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_bagsFull_2.ogg",
            ["You're carrying half the countryside."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_bagsFull_3.ogg",
            ["Your pack's going to split at the seams."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_bagsFull_4.ogg",
            ["You have given the grove your effort, and me the pleasure of your company. I would be glad to accompany you. Let us put aside the next trial for a little while. Friendship need not always arrive carrying another duty, however much work the day may still hold."] = "skyborne-male\\lore251361_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would be glad to accompany you. We have spent much of our time considering what must be done, and there is value in that. But I have also come to value the person beside me. Let us share a little of the road without making every step another trial."] = "skyborne-male\\lore251374_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["A friend for the road! I would be delighted. You have helped with more than the work, you know. It is good to have someone who stays for the conversation after the business is done. Come along, then; we can decide where to pause for a meal together."] = "skyborne-male\\lore251905_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would be glad to come with you. You have become someone whose visits I enjoy for more than the questions you bring. Let us share a stretch of the road, then. There is room for a little ordinary conversation alongside all the things we still hope to understand."] = "skyborne-male\\lore254082_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I am pleased to see before I know whether you want anything from the inn. That is a fine beginning for friendship. Come along. I would like to hear the rest of your story, and perhaps help it reach a place with supper waiting at the end."] = "skyborne-male\\lore255940_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Likewise."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_bowBack_1.ogg",
            ["An honor."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_bowBack_2.ogg",
            ["The pleasure's mine."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_bowBack_3.ogg",
            ["{friend} is your Buddy now? The more the merrier!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_buddy_1.ogg",
            ["Another Buddy. Should I be jealous?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_buddy_2.ogg",
            ["Another Buddy! Your circle's getting crowded."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_buddy_3.ogg",
            ["Good choice. I'd vouch for them."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_buddy_4.ogg",
            ["Hooray!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_cheerAlong_1.ogg",
            ["Huzzah!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_cheerAlong_2.ogg",
            ["Three cheers!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_cheerAlong_3.ogg",
            ["Who are you calling chicken?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_chickenBack_1.ogg",
            ["Bawk yourself."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_chickenBack_2.ogg",
            ["I'm brave! I'm just brave quietly."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_chickenBack_3.ogg",
            ["Well fought!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatEnd_1.ogg",
            ["That's how it's done."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatEnd_2.ogg",
            ["Everyone in one piece? Good."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatEnd_3.ogg",
            ["Ha! They won't try that again."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatEnd_4.ogg",
            ["I'll admit, my heart was pounding."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatEnd_5.ogg",
            ["Nicely done."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatEnd_6.ogg",
            ["Is it over? It's over. Good."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatEnd_7.ogg",
            ["Remind me never to make you angry."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatEnd_8.ogg",
            ["Not bad at all!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatEnd_9.ogg",
            ["Victory! I'll be telling everyone about that one."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatEnd_10.ogg",
            ["Catch your breath. You earned it."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatEnd_11.ogg",
            ["And not a scratch on me. Thanks to you."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatEnd_12.ogg",
            ["Hold on, it's weakening!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatLong_1.ogg",
            ["Don't give up now!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatLong_2.ogg",
            ["Steady. Steady."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatLong_3.ogg",
            ["This one's stubborn. Keep at it!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatLong_4.ogg",
            ["It's tiring! I can see it!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatLong_5.ogg",
            ["Long fight. You've got more in you."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatLong_6.ogg",
            ["Keep at it!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_1.ogg",
            ["Good hit!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_2.ogg",
            ["Watch your back!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_3.ogg",
            ["That's it, that's it!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_4.ogg",
            ["You've got it on the run!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_5.ogg",
            ["Don't let up!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_6.ogg",
            ["Ha! Did you see that?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_7.ogg",
            ["Nearly there!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_8.ogg",
            ["Hit it again!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_9.ogg",
            ["It's on its last legs!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_10.ogg",
            ["Mind your footing!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_11.ogg",
            ["That one's going to leave a mark!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_12.ogg",
            ["Go on! Go on!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_13.ogg",
            ["You make this look like a dance!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_14.ogg",
            ["Swing that blade! Go on!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_15.ogg",
            ["Into the thick of it! That's the way!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_16.ogg",
            ["The Light's with you! Now hit it!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_17.ogg",
            ["Let your pet have a go!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_18.ogg",
            ["Nice shot! Right on target!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_19.ogg",
            ["Where'd you go? Oh! There you are! Stab it!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_20.ogg",
            ["Patch yourself up, then smite it!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_21.ogg",
            ["Call the storm down on it!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_22.ogg",
            ["Burn it! Burn it all! Well, just that one."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_23.ogg",
            ["Whatever that green fire is, keep doing it!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_24.ogg",
            ["Turn into something big and scary!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatMid_25.ogg",
            ["Look out!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatStart_1.ogg",
            ["Here they come!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatStart_2.ogg",
            ["Give them what for!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatStart_3.ogg",
            ["Stay sharp!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatStart_4.ogg",
            ["On your guard!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatStart_5.ogg",
            ["Here we go again!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatStart_6.ogg",
            ["Watch it, it's coming right at you!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatStart_7.ogg",
            ["Show them what you've got!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_combatStart_8.ogg",
            ["Chin up. It'll be all right."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_comforted_1.ogg",
            ["I'm here if you need me."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_comforted_2.ogg",
            ["Thank you. I needed that."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_comforted_3.ogg",
            ["Ha! All right, I'll dance."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_danceAlong_1.ogg",
            ["I haven't danced in ages!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_danceAlong_2.ogg",
            ["Well, if you insist!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_danceAlong_3.ogg",
            ["Watch my feet. Or don't."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_danceAlong_4.ogg",
            ["Easy now. Let's get you back on your feet."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_died_1.ogg",
            ["That looked like it hurt."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_died_2.ogg",
            ["Don't worry. Happens to the best of us."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_died_3.ogg",
            ["We'll come back stronger."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_died_4.ogg",
            ["Oh, that's not good."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_died_5.ogg",
            ["Well. That could have gone better."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_died_6.ogg",
            ["Let's agree that one didn't count."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_died_7.ogg",
            ["Lie still. I'll keep watch."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_died_8.ogg",
            ["Keep close in here."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_dungeon_1.ogg",
            ["I don't like the look of this place."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_dungeon_2.ogg",
            ["Watch your step. And your back."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_dungeon_3.ogg",
            ["It's dark in here. I don't love the dark."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_dungeon_4.ogg",
            ["Stay together. Nobody wander off."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_dungeon_5.ogg",
            ["Very impressive."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_flexBack_1.ogg",
            ["Don't hurt yourself."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_flexBack_2.ogg",
            ["Put those away before someone gets hurt."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_flexBack_3.ogg",
            ["That looks good on you."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_gear_1.ogg",
            ["New armor? Very sharp."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_gear_2.ogg",
            ["You'll turn heads in that."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_gear_3.ogg",
            ["Shiny! Did you polish that yourself?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_gear_4.ogg",
            ["That suits you. Very heroic."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_gear_5.ogg",
            ["Now you look the part."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_gear_6.ogg",
            ["Come on, your body's this way."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_ghost_1.ogg",
            ["I'll walk with you. Don't mind the chill."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_ghost_2.ogg",
            ["You look a bit see-through. It's fine. Mostly fine."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_ghost_3.ogg",
            ["Follow the road. I'll be right here."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_ghost_4.ogg",
            ["Is it cold, being a ghost? You look cold."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_ghost_5.ogg",
            ["Come, let us walk together. There will be time for whatever questions you have brought, and perhaps a few moments in which neither of us needs to speak. Attend to the small things along the way. A place is kept whole by more than the deeds that earn a great telling."] = "skyborne-male\\lore251361_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Come, let us go together. You need not fill every quiet moment with an answer. Look at what is before you, and give it your attention. The winds are not the only teachers we have, nor is their silence a reason to neglect the lessons still within our reach."] = "skyborne-male\\lore251374_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Ho there! Good company and a little fresh air will do me well. If we happen upon some useful ingredients, so much the better. There is always another meal to think about, and I find the planning far more pleasant when someone is willing to discuss what ought to go in it."] = "skyborne-male\\lore251905_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Come along. I would welcome a little company between lessons. Tell me what you have been learning, and take your time with it. A thought does not become wiser merely because we hurry it out, and I have no need to turn our walk into an examination."] = "skyborne-male\\lore254082_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome to the Calmbreeze Inn. Something to eat, something to drink? You are welcome to bring a story as well, though I reserve the right to object if it sends the room looking for an escape. A traveler with an appetite is much better company than a fleeing customer."] = "skyborne-male\\lore255940_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Lead the way, {name}."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Glad to come along, {name}!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_greet_2.ogg",
            ["Where are we off to today?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_greet_3.ogg",
            ["I told the others I'd be out for a while. Let's make it count."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_greet_4.ogg",
            ["It's good to get away from the counter for once."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_greet_5.ogg",
            ["Ready when you are, {name}."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_greet_6.ogg",
            ["Some fresh air will do me good."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_greet_7.ogg",
            ["Don't walk too fast. I'm not used to all this adventuring."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_greet_8.ogg",
            ["Well met, {name}! Good to see a friendly face."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_greet_9.ogg",
            ["Right behind you. Where to first?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_greet_10.ogg",
            ["I packed a lunch. Just in case."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_greet_11.ogg",
            ["Off on an adventure! Don't tell my boss."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_greet_12.ogg",
            ["Fresh boots, fresh start. Let's go."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_greet_13.ogg",
            ["I've been looking forward to this all week."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_greet_14.ogg",
            ["More company! Wonderful."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_group_1.ogg",
            ["Strength in numbers."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_group_2.ogg",
            ["New faces! Hello, everyone."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_group_3.ogg",
            ["A whole party. Now it's an adventure."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_group_4.ogg",
            ["Home again!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_hearth_1.ogg",
            ["Off to the inn. My treat. Well, your treat."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_hearth_2.ogg",
            ["Home sweet home."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_hearth_3.ogg",
            ["Back to a warm bed. Finally."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_hearth_4.ogg",
            ["Oh! Well. That's nice."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_hugged_1.ogg",
            ["Aw, thank you."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_hugged_2.ogg",
            ["Oh, you big softie."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_hugged_3.ogg",
            ["Myriaal believes a sudden landing is an excellent way to improve my day. I have explained the need for judgment several times. Yes, a little practice is acceptable. No, I do not intend to announce that quite so loudly that it becomes the beginning of another competition."] = "skyborne-male\\lore251361_idle_1.ogg",
            ["An ordinary stone, yes. It holds the pages down. I once spent longer retrieving a note than I had spent writing it, and decided there was wisdom in avoiding a second performance. You may consider that a lesson if you wish. I consider it a very satisfactory paperweight."] = "skyborne-male\\lore251374_idle_1.ogg",
            ["You thought I was considering some great matter? Ho ho! Only what to serve beside a fine plate of eggs. The pipe helps me think, even when I have not lit it. Give a cook a solemn expression and everyone assumes the question must be more complicated than dinner."] = "skyborne-male\\lore251905_idle_1.ogg",
            ["No, that is not an ancient song. I made it up. The beginning is quite satisfactory; the ending remains a matter for consideration. You may laugh if you wish. I am allowed one small question that need not be answered before the next lesson can begin."] = "skyborne-male\\lore254082_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I once improved a frightening story by having everyone return safely for supper. Apparently that spoiled the ending. I thought the people in it would have been delighted. A warm meal, familiar faces, no one missing. You would think a room full of travelers might appreciate that sort of conclusion."] = "skyborne-male\\lore255940_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Nice day for it."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_1.ogg",
            ["{zone} is lovely this time of year."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_2.ogg",
            ["Don't mind me. I'm enjoying the company."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_3.ogg",
            ["You know, I don't get out nearly enough."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_4.ogg",
            ["My feet are already sore. In a good way."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_5.ogg",
            ["I wonder how things are back home without me."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_6.ogg",
            ["Every road looks different when you're not working."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_7.ogg",
            ["Have you ever just stopped and listened to the wind?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_8.ogg",
            ["I could get used to this."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_9.ogg",
            ["Don't tell anyone, but this beats standing in one spot all day."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_10.ogg",
            ["If you need a hand, just say the word."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_11.ogg",
            ["Good company makes the miles shorter."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_12.ogg",
            ["Mind if I stretch? Old bones."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_13.ogg",
            ["Getting late. The stars will be out soon."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_14.ogg",
            ["Quiet night. I like quiet nights."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_15.ogg",
            ["We've been at it for a while. You're tireless, you know that?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_16.ogg",
            ["I used to wonder what was past the next hill. Now I know: another hill."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_17.ogg",
            ["Do you ever get used to all this walking?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_18.ogg",
            ["I've heard stories about you, you know. Some of them are even nice."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_19.ogg",
            ["Smell that? Somebody's cooking something good nearby."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_20.ogg",
            ["If anyone asks, I'm on important business."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_21.ogg",
            ["You're easy company. I mean that kindly."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_22.ogg",
            ["I keep thinking I left something on the stove."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_23.ogg",
            ["Look at that sky."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_24.ogg",
            ["Back home they'll never believe where I've been."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_25.ogg",
            ["I should have brought a better pair of boots."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_26.ogg",
            ["Funny how a quiet road can feel like a holiday."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_27.ogg",
            ["Do adventurers ever take a day off? Asking for a friend. The friend is me."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_28.ogg",
            ["I've counted twelve birds since we set out. Thirteen. Never mind."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_29.ogg",
            ["One of these days you'll have to tell me how you got started."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_30.ogg",
            ["You can tell a lot about someone by how they walk. You walk like you mean it."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_31.ogg",
            ["I'm not complaining. I'm just saying my feet have opinions."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_32.ogg",
            ["Sorry, I've had the same tune stuck in my head all day."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_33.ogg",
            ["If we pass a merchant, remind me I need thread."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_34.ogg",
            ["I wonder what the folks back home are gossiping about."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_35.ogg",
            ["Every time I think I've seen it all, you take me somewhere new."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_36.ogg",
            ["It's peaceful out here. Until it isn't."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_37.ogg",
            ["I could do with a cup of something warm."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_38.ogg",
            ["Morning air's the best air."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_39.ogg",
            ["Early start, eh? I approve."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_40.ogg",
            ["The light's going gold. Best time of day."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_41.ogg",
            ["Stars are out. Makes you feel small, doesn't it?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_42.ogg",
            ["Shouldn't we both be in bed by now?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_43.ogg",
            ["Long day. Good day, though."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_44.ogg",
            ["Still going? I'll say this for you: you don't quit."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_45.ogg",
            ["Ha! I'll have to remember that one."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_jokeBack_1.ogg",
            ["Oh, that's terrible. Tell it again."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_jokeBack_2.ogg",
            ["I'm stealing that one."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_jokeBack_3.ogg",
            ["Oh my."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_kissed_1.ogg",
            ["Well, I never."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_kissed_2.ogg",
            ["Now you've made me blush."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_kissed_3.ogg",
            ["There. Arriving safely is a worthy result in itself. I trust nobody has offered you imaginary points for landing at my feet this time. A gift used wisely will serve you far better than a fine surprise, though I concede the surprise can be difficult to forget."] = "skyborne-male\\lore251361_landed_1.ogg",
            ["Safe and sound."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_landed_1.ogg",
            ["Good landing. I'll tell the birds."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_landed_2.ogg",
            ["Solid ground. Feels strange after all that sky."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_landed_3.ogg",
            ["Down we come. Legs still work? Good."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_landed_4.ogg",
            ["That was a fine flight."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_landed_5.ogg",
            ["Ha! Good one."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_laughAlong_1.ogg",
            ["Heh. You're funny."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_laughAlong_2.ogg",
            ["Ha! That laugh of yours is catching."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_laughAlong_3.ogg",
            ["Take care with what you have learned. A new gift is not made greater by using it without thought. Earth teaches endurance and resolve; the winds alone cannot answer every question we bring. We will need understanding of all four elements to find the voice we are seeking."] = "skyborne-male\\lore251374_learned_1.ogg",
            ["There we are! A beginning worth making. Cooking will serve you beyond the next tasty meal; a good fire gives you somewhere to stop and settle yourself in the wilds. Keep practicing, and give the plain little things their due. They are what make a camp feel welcoming."] = "skyborne-male\\lore251905_learned_1.ogg",
            ["A useful beginning. Keep listening as your knowledge grows, and remember that another teacher may hear something you have not yet learned to recognize. I send learners to Olariaan for a reason. Understanding is not made smaller by knowing when to seek guidance from someone else."] = "skyborne-male\\lore254082_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Learning something new? Good for you."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Always improving. I admire that."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_learned_2.ogg",
            ["Something new up your sleeve? I'll be watching."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_learned_3.ogg",
            ["The more you know, the better. That's what I always say."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_learned_4.ogg",
            ["Level {level}! Well done, {name}!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_levelUp_1.ogg",
            ["Look at you, {name}. Level {level} already."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_levelUp_2.ogg",
            ["Level {level}! That calls for a cheer!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_levelUp_3.ogg",
            ["Level {level}. I've seen a lot of adventurers come and go. You're one of the good ones."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_levelUp_4.ogg",
            ["Ha! Level {level}! Well earned."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_levelUp_5.ogg",
            ["Level {level}. Wait until I tell everyone back home."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_levelUp_6.ogg",
            ["Stronger every day. I can see it."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_levelUp_7.ogg",
            ["Another level! I knew you had it in you."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_levelUp_8.ogg",
            ["Well, look who's moving up in the world."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_levelUp_9.ogg",
            ["Another step up. Mind you don't get a big head."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_levelUp_10.ogg",
            ["{item}! Now that's a find."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_loot_1.ogg",
            ["Well, look at that. {item}."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_loot_2.ogg",
            ["{item}! Lucky day."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_loot_3.ogg",
            ["Ooh, what did you find?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_loot_4.ogg",
            ["Anything good in there?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_loot_5.ogg",
            ["Pockets full! Nice."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_loot_6.ogg",
            ["You're hurt! Get out of there!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_1.ogg",
            ["Careful! You're nearly done in!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_2.ogg",
            ["Back off and catch your breath!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_3.ogg",
            ["You're bleeding! Fall back!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_4.ogg",
            ["Get out of there!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_5.ogg",
            ["Drink something! Anything!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_6.ogg",
            ["This isn't worth dying over!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_7.ogg",
            ["Run! I'll tell everyone you were brave!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_8.ogg",
            ["Bandage! Potion! Something!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_9.ogg",
            ["Hang on! Don't you dare go down!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_lowHealth_10.ogg",
            ["Looks like you've got mail."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mail_1.ogg",
            ["Someone's written to you. How nice."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mail_2.ogg",
            ["A letter! I hope it's good news."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mail_3.ogg",
            ["Mail for you. Somebody's thinking of you."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mail_4.ogg",
            ["Level {level}! There's nothing left to teach you, is there?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_maxLevel_1.ogg",
            ["The very top! I'm honored to have come along for it."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_maxLevel_2.ogg",
            ["That's the peak. Where do you go from here? Anywhere you like, I suppose."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_maxLevel_3.ogg",
            ["Riding in style, I see."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mount_1.ogg",
            ["Fine animal you've got there."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mount_2.ogg",
            ["I'll just walk alongside, shall I?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mount_3.ogg",
            ["Now that's a proper way to travel."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mount_4.ogg",
            ["Does it have a name? It looks like it should have a name."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_mount_5.ogg",
            ["{friend} seems friendly."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_newFriend_1.ogg",
            ["I've heard good things about {friend}."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_newFriend_2.ogg",
            ["Another friend! You collect them like coins."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_newFriend_3.ogg",
            ["Another friendly face. You're good at this."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_newFriend_4.ogg",
            ["You make friends faster than I make tea."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_newFriend_5.ogg",
            ["What is it? I don't see anything."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pointToo_1.ogg",
            ["Where? Oh! No, I still don't see it."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pointToo_2.ogg",
            ["Is it something good? Or something bad?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pointToo_3.ogg",
            ["Yes, {name}?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_1.ogg",
            ["Hm? Something on your mind?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_2.ogg",
            ["I'm right here."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_3.ogg",
            ["Careful, now."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_4.ogg",
            ["Ha! You're a funny one."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_5.ogg",
            ["Need something?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_6.ogg",
            ["Still here, still with you."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_7.ogg",
            ["What is it? Did you see something?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_8.ogg",
            ["If that's how you say hello where you're from, all right."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_9.ogg",
            ["I'm listening."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_10.ogg",
            ["Still breathing, if that's what you're checking."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_11.ogg",
            ["Was that a poke or a question?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_12.ogg",
            ["Easy! I bruise like a peach."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_13.ogg",
            ["You have my full attention. Mostly."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_14.ogg",
            ["Hm? Sorry, I was miles away."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_15.ogg",
            ["Ask away."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_16.ogg",
            ["Ow. Was that necessary?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_17.ogg",
            ["What, did I miss something?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_18.ogg",
            ["Present and accounted for."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_19.ogg",
            ["Yes, yes, I see you."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_poke_20.ogg",
            ["All right, all right, I'm awake!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pokeMany_1.ogg",
            ["Is this going to keep happening?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pokeMany_2.ogg",
            ["You'd think I was a doorbell."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pokeMany_3.ogg",
            ["I'm starting to think you enjoy this."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pokeMany_4.ogg",
            ["Enough! I surrender!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pokeMany_5.ogg",
            ["One more and I'm going home. I mean it. Probably."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_pokeMany_6.ogg",
            ["Another job done. Nicely handled."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Well done! They'll be grateful."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_2.ogg",
            ["You've a knack for helping folk."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_3.ogg",
            ["That's one more person sleeping easier tonight."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_4.ogg",
            ["Good work. Who's next?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_5.ogg",
            ["Word gets around. People will remember that."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_6.ogg",
            ["Nicely done. Somebody's going to tell that story at the inn."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_7.ogg",
            ["That's the way!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_8.ogg",
            ["You make it look easy."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_9.ogg",
            ["Done and done. What's next?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_quest_10.ogg",
            ["Another errand? I like your spirit."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_questAccepted_1.ogg",
            ["Off we go, then."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_questAccepted_2.ogg",
            ["Somebody's lucky you came along."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_questAccepted_3.ogg",
            ["Here we go again. I love it."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_questAccepted_4.ogg",
            ["Sounds like trouble. Count me in."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_questAccepted_5.ogg",
            ["Hm? Did I doze off?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_reload_1.ogg",
            ["Strange. I could swear the world just blinked."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_reload_2.ogg",
            ["Where was I? Oh, right. With you."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_reload_3.ogg",
            ["Hm. I lost my train of thought. Something about the road."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_reload_4.ogg",
            ["There we are. A chance to enjoy some refreshment and finish a conversation properly. No need to hurry past the ending. Tell me how everyone fared, and whether they found somewhere welcoming afterward. If the answer is no, I shall have a few suggestions for improving the story."] = "skyborne-male\\lore255940_rest_1.ogg",
            ["A good place to rest our feet."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Nothing like a warm inn."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rest_2.ogg",
            ["I could sit here all day."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rest_3.ogg",
            ["A chair, a fire, good company. That's living."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rest_4.ogg",
            ["Let's stay a moment. My feet insist."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rest_5.ogg",
            ["Easy there, tiger."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_roarBack_1.ogg",
            ["Very fierce. I'm terrified."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_roarBack_2.ogg",
            ["Was that a roar or a yawn?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_roarBack_3.ogg",
            ["Charming."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rudeBack_1.ogg",
            ["I'll pretend I didn't see that."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rudeBack_2.ogg",
            ["Well, I never! Actually, I have. But still."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_rudeBack_3.ogg",
            ["At your service."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_saluteBack_1.ogg",
            ["Sir! Or madam."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_saluteBack_2.ogg",
            ["Standing ready!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_saluteBack_3.ogg",
            ["Oh, it's {friend}! Say hello for me."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_seeFriend_1.ogg",
            ["{friend}! Good to see a friendly face."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_seeFriend_2.ogg",
            ["Look who it is! Give them a wave."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_seeFriend_3.ogg",
            ["Oh, I know them! Small world."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_seeFriend_4.ogg",
            ["No need to be shy."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_shyToo_1.ogg",
            ["Aw, don't hide."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_shyToo_2.ogg",
            ["You're among friends here."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_shyToo_3.ogg",
            ["Don't mind if I do."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_sitToo_1.ogg",
            ["Good idea. My knees agree."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_sitToo_2.ogg",
            ["Ah, that's better."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_sitToo_3.ogg",
            ["I could use a nap myself."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_sleepToo_1.ogg",
            ["Wake me when it's time to go."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_sleepToo_2.ogg",
            ["A nap does sound nice."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_sleepToo_3.ogg",
            ["Up we go! Never gets old."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_taxi_1.ogg",
            ["Look at it all down there."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_taxi_2.ogg",
            ["A good gryphon is worth its weight in gold."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_taxi_3.ogg",
            ["Hold on tight!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_taxi_4.ogg",
            ["I'll never get tired of this view."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_taxi_5.ogg",
            ["Don't look down. Actually, do. It's lovely."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_taxi_6.ogg",
            ["The wind up here! Hold on to your hat."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_taxi_7.ogg",
            ["Anytime."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_thanked_1.ogg",
            ["Happy to help."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_thanked_2.ogg",
            ["Don't mention it."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_thanked_3.ogg",
            ["{friend} thinks of you as {tier} now. I'm not surprised."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_tier_1.ogg",
            ["Making friends everywhere you go, aren't you?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_tier_2.ogg",
            ["People really warm to you, don't they?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_tier_3.ogg",
            ["That friendship's growing. Nice to see."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_tier_4.ogg",
            ["Hello!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_waveBack_1.ogg",
            ["Hi there!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_waveBack_2.ogg",
            ["Well, hello to you too."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_waveBack_3.ogg",
            ["Right back at you!"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_waveBack_4.ogg",
            ["So this is {zone}."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_1.ogg",
            ["{zone}, eh? Lead on."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_2.ogg",
            ["I haven't been to {zone} in years."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_3.ogg",
            ["{zone}. Stay sharp."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_4.ogg",
            ["Ah, {zone}. Look at that view."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_5.ogg",
            ["New place, new faces."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_6.ogg",
            ["Keep your eyes open. I don't know these parts."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_7.ogg",
            ["I've only ever heard stories about this place."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_8.ogg",
            ["Look at it all. Worth the walk."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_9.ogg",
            ["Smells different here. Not bad, just different."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_10.ogg",
            ["I'd better remember the way back."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_11.ogg",
            ["Well, this is a change of scenery."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_zone_12.ogg",
        },
        ["tauren-female"] = {
            ["You are welcome without a story to entertain me or a task to explain your visit. I enjoy having you here. Today, let us spend a little time together simply because we would both be glad of it."] = "tauren-female\\lore11106_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have made time to return, and I look forward to your company. Come along, friend. We may find something to be grateful for in the day, and we need not make a grand performance of noticing it together when we do."] = "tauren-female\\lore269068_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have shared your time as freely as your questions. I am glad of both. Come along, friend. There is room for your piece beside mine, and I would like to see what we learn away from the workbench as well as at it."] = "tauren-female\\lore3007_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have stayed without asking me for a promise I cannot make. Thank you. I would like to be your friend, even on the days when all I can offer is my company."] = "tauren-female\\lore3009_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have made these visits something I look forward to. I am glad we have time to share more than a greeting. Come along. We need not wait for a grand occasion to enjoy a little of the day together, you and I."] = "tauren-female\\lore3014_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You know when to ask a useful question, and when to let me pretend I am keeping a secret. I appreciate both. Come along, friend. We can enjoy some time beyond the shop. If I begin asking about your favorite colors, you may smile without saying why."] = "tauren-female\\lore3015_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I am glad you came. We can call tonight a celebration if you like, but I would be just as happy sharing a plain supper and hearing about your day."] = "tauren-female\\lore3026_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would be glad to share your path for a while. Tell me what has stayed with you from the day. A lesson, a worry, or something that made you smile. Good company leaves room for all of them, and I have come to value yours."] = "tauren-female\\lore3062_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would be happy to accompany you. We have spent enough time speaking of what must be learned; I have also come to enjoy the person doing the learning. Let us share a little of the road as friends. There need not be another task at the end of every conversation."] = "tauren-female\\lore3064_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would enjoy that. We have shared enough pleasant moments that I look forward to the next one, even before I know what we will be doing. You need not arrive hungry or carrying an errand to have my company. Come, let us find a little time to spend together, and perhaps somewhere nice to sit."] = "tauren-female\\lore3884_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have learned to remain without demanding that every thought become a lesson for you. I find that agreeable. Come along. We may speak when there is something worth saying, and enjoy the interval when there is not. Your company has become familiar enough that I need not account for every silence."] = "tauren-female\\lore4046_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I am glad to see before I ask what you are carrying. Come along, friend. Perhaps we can enjoy a chapter in which nothing needs recovering and nobody is waiting to be rescued. If the road is quiet, we can spend a little of that good fortune talking about something pleasant."] = "tauren-female\\lore4877_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Your visits have become something I look forward to, my friend. Let us have a little time together without another duty waiting between us. I would be glad simply to hear how you are."] = "tauren-female\\lore6746_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I am pleased to sit beside after the cups are filled. Come along, friend. We can enjoy a little of the road together. Later, I hope you will tell me what you thought of it. I may have another argument prepared in defense of a very ordinary loaf."] = "tauren-female\\lore7737_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I enjoy talking with even when neither of us needs anything from the other. Come along, friend. We can see where the day takes us. If I ask a question that seems very simple, remember how patiently I listened when you could not quite name that little thing."] = "tauren-female\\lore8361_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Your visits have become something I look forward to, my friend. You need not bring a discovery every time. I would be glad to share a quiet stretch of the road."] = "tauren-female\\lore8385_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I am glad to share an unfinished thought with. Come along, friend. We can look at what the road offers without deciding too quickly what it means. If I grow rather proud of an explanation, you may ask whether anyone has moved the pot. I will know what you mean."] = "tauren-female\\lore9087_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Before the next journey, take a moment to look over what you will depend on. A bow, a quiver, the supplies inside it. Repairs are easier to remember here than after you have left the city. Tell me what needs attention, and we will begin there."] = "tauren-female\\lore3015_gear_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Come along, and leave a little space in the day for a proper rest. I would like to hear where you have been, once the road has stopped making quite so much noise in your thoughts."] = "tauren-female\\lore11106_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, friend. Take a moment to catch your breath. There is no need to make your arrival more dignified than the road has left you feeling. I am glad you came. If you need to sit before saying anything else, there is time."] = "tauren-female\\lore269068_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, friend. Bring your work closer, if you would like me to look at it. There is room here for a careful question and an uneven first attempt. I have made both. What matters is whether you are willing to learn something from them."] = "tauren-female\\lore3007_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Walk with me a little. I have been bent over that table too long. If someone needs us, we will stop. Until then, tell me how the day has treated you."] = "tauren-female\\lore3009_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back. Is there an occasion? There need not be one. Sometimes a little color and familiar company are enough to make an ordinary day worth enjoying. Come along. We can take a moment to notice what is pleasant about this one."] = "tauren-female\\lore3014_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, friend. Need a bow, arrows, or a look at something that came back damaged? We can see to that. I also have one very ordinary question about your favorite color. You may answer without investigating my reasons. It would help me considerably if you did."] = "tauren-female\\lore3015_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are! I have packed something for the road. I was going to give it a magnificent name, but I thought we had better taste it first."] = "tauren-female\\lore3026_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, friend. Come and tell me what you have learned since we last spoke. There is time to listen. If you notice my foot tapping, I have a small rhythm caught in my thoughts. It may escape the moment I try to explain it."] = "tauren-female\\lore3062_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Come, let us walk together. There is always more to notice than a lesson has time to contain. You may tell me what has been occupying your thoughts, or we can enjoy a quiet stretch of the path. Your company need not arrive carrying a question to be welcome."] = "tauren-female\\lore3064_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good to see you. Shall we take something to eat before we go? I would rather share a loaf along the way than discover you have spent the whole walk hungry. We can find a pleasant place to stop. There is no need to save every good part of the day until the work is finished."] = "tauren-female\\lore3884_greet_1.ogg",
            ["You have returned. Take a moment before telling me everything you think I ought to hear. Listen to what is around you, and decide which question matters. I have time for a thoughtful visitor. I am less inclined to spend it untangling an answer demanded before the question was properly considered."] = "tauren-female\\lore4046_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good to see you. How was the road? If you tell me everyone arrived safely and nothing went missing, I will count that a fine report. You need not apologize for leaving out a battle. Freewind Post depends on people making the journey, and I am pleased when they have little trouble to describe afterward."] = "tauren-female\\lore4877_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Come along, and tell me how you have been. I hope there is something pleasant in the day's news, but you are welcome to share the difficult parts too."] = "tauren-female\\lore6746_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, traveler. Set your pack down and take a moment to choose something you will enjoy. We have spice bread, pie, and a plain loaf I am always pleased to defend. If you find it tough, try a little milk before passing judgment. There is no need to hurry the first taste."] = "tauren-female\\lore7737_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Have you remembered what you need, or only the part where it fits into your plans? Either will do for a beginning. Tell me a little more, and we can work from there. I would rather ask a useful question than sell you an impressive mistake."] = "tauren-female\\lore8361_greet_1.ogg",
            ["I am glad you came. There is much I still hope to understand, but I can put the questions aside for a little while. Tell me how you have been."] = "tauren-female\\lore8385_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, friend. Have you found something that deserves a closer look? You need not arrive with an explanation already prepared. A careful observation can be a good beginning. I have learned to check a surprising result twice, especially when a seedling appears to have grown farther than its pot will reasonably allow."] = "tauren-female\\lore9087_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Someone asked whether all those cheeses argued at supper. I said Dwarven Mild was a patient listener. The brie, perhaps less so. I have been imagining their negotiations ever since. A very lively table."] = "tauren-female\\lore11106_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A visitor once apologized for yawning during my welcome. I was about to reassure them when I yawned too. That rather settled the matter. We laughed, they sat down, and the rest of the conversation became a great deal more comfortable."] = "tauren-female\\lore269068_idle_1.ogg",
            ["That crooked square in my pennant? It is mine. An old piece of work, and a useful thing to keep. People arrive expecting a teacher's hands to have been certain from the beginning. I like watching them discover that mine had to learn too."] = "tauren-female\\lore3007_idle_1.ogg",
            ["That orange scrap looks a little like sunrise. I keep it beside my bowl. Such a small thing to remind me to eat, and yet I still need the reminder some days."] = "tauren-female\\lore3009_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Someone once chose flowers for their own window. I had been wondering whom the gift was for. A window, they told me, with room for some color. I thought about that afterward. Now I sometimes choose a few simply because I like them."] = "tauren-female\\lore3014_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A surprise should not require so many revealing questions. I know that. But suppose I choose the wrong color? Then I ask which color they prefer, and what size, and whether they would like... You see the difficulty. By then, we are both looking forward to it."] = "tauren-female\\lore3015_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I announced a grand feast once, just to get everyone to sit down. It was stew. Nobody complained, and several people stayed long enough to help with the washing up."] = "tauren-female\\lore3026_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I like listening to rain on the tent. A few drops find a rhythm, and I try following it with my foot. Then the pattern changes, and I have to begin again. It is a pleasant way to discover how quickly certainty can turn into laughter."] = "tauren-female\\lore3062_idle_1.ogg",
            ["That cloud has the look of a sleeping bear. There, with its nose tucked in. You see only a hill? That is quite all right. It is a small pleasure of mine, not a test of your wisdom. The sky may keep its clouds, and I may keep my bears."] = "tauren-female\\lore3064_idle_1.ogg",
            ["You may prefer the neat slices. I like the heel. There is a satisfying bite to it, and I do not mind its shape being a little uneven. You need not make an occasion of saving it for me, either. A small piece of bread and a quiet moment are already a very pleasant arrangement."] = "tauren-female\\lore3884_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A visitor once decided that my silence concealed a particularly important lesson. The longer I waited, the more carefully he tried to explain it to himself. I had merely paused. It was instructive to hear what he supplied. People reveal a great deal when they are certain someone else knows the answer."] = "tauren-female\\lore4046_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I have been thinking of an adventure story. The travelers set out with everything packed properly. They arrive when expected. Every bundle is still there, and nobody requires rescuing. Some people might want another chapter with more excitement. I would rather hear that ending again. It leaves everyone free to enjoy a pleasant evening."] = "tauren-female\\lore4877_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Three small good things. That is all I try to remember after a busy day. Someone rested, someone laughed, and a friend came by without needing anything at all."] = "tauren-female\\lore6746_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A guest once told me the plain loaf was hardly fit for a meal. I offered a piece dipped in milk. After that, the only complaint was that I had given too small a piece. I enjoy remembering that whenever someone decides the most expensive food must be the best part of supper."] = "tauren-female\\lore7737_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Someone once asked me for the little thing used with a spell. That left quite a few possibilities. Asking what they hoped to do helped more than guessing. Later I found myself asking a cook for the brown ingredient from supper. It was useful to remember how that feels."] = "tauren-female\\lore8361_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Such a warm color in that fallen leaf. It need not hold a hidden answer to be worth noticing. Sometimes I gather something simply because it is beautiful."] = "tauren-female\\lore8385_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I once thought a seedling had grown remarkably overnight. Then I discovered its pot had been moved beside the measuring slat. After correcting my mistake, I found a new leaf. I was glad I had looked again. There was something wonderful there, even if it was smaller than my first explanation suggested."] = "tauren-female\\lore9087_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Cairne brought us to a place with possibilities. Teaching is one way I can pass that good fortune on. When you help someone understand what you have learned, it goes farther still. That pleases me more than keeping a skill where only I can use it."] = "tauren-female\\lore3007_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Start with a fire you can cook over, then give the food your attention. There will be time for elaborate recipes. A simple meal done well is already worth learning."] = "tauren-female\\lore3026_learned_1.ogg",
            ["You have taken another step. Give yourself time to understand it, and bring me the questions that follow. I hope each lesson leaves you better prepared, but you need not pretend that learning is finished. We can speak again, and look at what experience has shown you."] = "tauren-female\\lore3062_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Give yourself time to understand what you have learned. A lesson is more than the words we can repeat afterward. Consider what it asks of your actions, and where another teacher may help you see farther. That is part of why I send learners onward when they are ready."] = "tauren-female\\lore3064_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Remembering the name is useful. Understanding what you need it for is useful too. There is no shame in asking about either. A spell may sound grand when it is finished, but preparation is often a matter of small things remembered before the moment you need them."] = "tauren-female\\lore8361_learned_1.ogg",
            ["There are many reasons to spread incense to the winds: seeking guidance, asking care for someone, marking an occasion. Practices differ, and people bring their own reasons. Take part with reverence, and leave room for the gratitude you find in your own life."] = "tauren-female\\lore269068_quest_1.ogg",
            ["For Eylah's incense tradition, my part is the herbs. Other hands provide the other supplies, and the person taking part brings their own reason for doing so. It is a good thing to have occasions for gratitude, including the quiet ones."] = "tauren-female\\lore3014_quest_1.ogg",
            ["When Stonetalon's troubles were brought before me, I directed the petitioners toward Apothecary Zamah. The Forsaken are allies whose knowledge deserves consideration. Carry a message accurately, and distinguish the words you were given from the conclusions you have added. A useful envoy understands the importance of both listening and restraint."] = "tauren-female\\lore4046_quest_1.ogg",
            ["The supplies we recover will help until another shipment arrives. Keeping the harpies from driving every caravan away matters for the journeys after that as well. Bring back what you can, and let me know how the road stands. I would like to send our suppliers better news before they decide the next trip is too dangerous."] = "tauren-female\\lore4877_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Thank you for seeing it through. A little help can reach farther than you know. I came to Silverpine hoping to offer some, and I have learned to appreciate receiving it, too."] = "tauren-female\\lore8385_quest_1.ogg",
            ["The morrowgrain you bring helps our research, and the lives spared from Kelris matter far beyond any reward. Remember what the work is meant to serve. When an object calls for wisdom beyond our own, there is honor in taking it to someone better prepared to understand it. Knowledge should bring care with it."] = "tauren-female\\lore9087_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Sit for a while. We can hear about the dangerous places after you have caught your breath. Supper will not demand a heroic account before allowing you to enjoy it. At least, mine never has."] = "tauren-female\\lore11106_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Yes, I will sit. You need not make a ceremony of persuading me. Put the bowl here, please. And stay a moment. It is easier to remember a meal when someone shares it."] = "tauren-female\\lore3009_rest_1.ogg",
            ["This seems a good place. Sit down, put the work aside for a moment, and enjoy what you have brought. It need not be a grand feast to deserve your attention. A loaf tastes better when you give yourself time to notice it, and I would be glad to hear how you have been while we eat."] = "tauren-female\\lore3884_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Put down what you can for a moment. You have carried the day's work this far. A little rest and good company may help you notice that something pleasant happened along the way too."] = "tauren-female\\lore6746_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Let that piece of bread soften a little. There is no prize for swallowing a meal before you have enjoyed it. We can talk while we wait. A modest loaf, a cup of milk, and someone willing to stay at the table can make a very good end to a difficult day."] = "tauren-female\\lore7737_rest_1.ogg",
        },
        ["tauren-male"] = {
            ["I value the attention you give to what is actually before you. You can stay beside me without finding another task to justify it. There is time for a little company before the next report arrives."] = "tauren-male\\lore10537_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You need no errand to explain coming back. I enjoy seeing you, and I would be glad to spend a little time together. Choose a place to settle. Today, I have made room for a proper visit."] = "tauren-male\\lore11116_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have brought more than useful news to this post. I look forward to your company, too. Stay beside me a while. I would like to hear something that matters to you, whether or not it belongs in a report."] = "tauren-male\\lore11259_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Yes, I would be glad to walk beside you. We have shared concern for what needs care, and I have come to value the person who brings that concern to me. You are welcome without a task to finish or an offering to deliver. Let us enjoy a little time together simply as friends."] = "tauren-male\\lore2948_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would be glad to come along. You seem to remember there are people at the end of the road who need what we bring back. That matters to me. And if we find a good meal, I promise to divide the last spoonful fairly."] = "tauren-male\\lore2980_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would welcome a walk with you. There is much we can notice when we give ourselves time. Tell me where your path has taken you, and what you have found worth remembering. I am glad to share a little of the journey."] = "tauren-male\\lore2981_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would welcome your company. We can speak of what you have learned, or find something pleasant to notice along the path. A friend need not bring a test to every meeting. I will even spare you my worst rhyme, unless you ask to hear it."] = "tauren-male\\lore2982_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I am glad to see between journeys, my friend. I would enjoy sharing one with you, and perhaps a quiet moment at the end of it as well."] = "tauren-male\\lore2995_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You listen, and you are willing to look again when something surprises you. I enjoy that in a companion. Let us go a little farther together. The basket can wait until we return."] = "tauren-male\\lore3013_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I have enjoyed our time together. There is a seat beside me whenever you want it. I cannot promise a good catch, or good poetry, but I can promise the company."] = "tauren-male\\lore3028_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become a friend whose company I welcome beyond the business brought before a chieftain. Walk beside me. Tell me what you have seen, and what you hope to find. I am glad to hear your own account of the road, before another storyteller gives it a more remarkable ending."] = "tauren-male\\lore3057_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would enjoy walking with you. Tell me what you see, and we can compare our observations. There is always something I might have missed. And if you hear a poor attempt at a bird call, remember that everyone needs practice at something."] = "tauren-male\\lore3061_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would be glad to come with you. A good companion makes even an ordinary meal worth remembering, and I have enjoyed our time together. You need not bring a recipe or a question every time we meet. Your company is reason enough to sit down and share what we have."] = "tauren-male\\lore3067_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I am glad our paths have kept crossing. Encouraging a traveler is one thing; sharing the road with a friend is another. I would be pleased to join you."] = "tauren-male\\lore3418_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Your help has meant much to me. Your company has come to mean something more, my friend. I would be glad to share a stretch of the road without asking another task of you."] = "tauren-male\\lore3448_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I look forward to seeing before I know what you need. I would be glad to walk with you, friend. We can begin without making a ceremony of leaving. I shall save at least one farewell for when we actually part, though you may have to remind me."] = "tauren-male\\lore3934_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone whose view I am glad to hear before another journey needs arranging. Come along, friend. Tell me what you notice above the road. I may begin by finding another kodo, but I will listen to your explanation. There is pleasure in seeing something familiar change when a friend looks at it differently."] = "tauren-male\\lore4312_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You take time to notice things, and to hear why they matter to someone else. That is good company. Walk with me. We will find enough work and trouble along the way; there should be room for a little pleasure in the day."] = "tauren-male\\lore6410_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Yes, I would enjoy your company beyond the doorway. I have heard a little of your travels, and now I should like to share some of the road with you. We can take our time. You have become more than a familiar visitor to me, and I am glad of that."] = "tauren-male\\lore6747_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become more than a familiar face at the inn. I enjoy your company, my friend. Let us have a little time together before the road calls you onward again."] = "tauren-male\\lore7714_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You return as someone whose company I look forward to, and that is worth more than another purchase. Come along, friend. I would enjoy seeing a little of the road with you. If the conversation becomes too serious, I have been saving a particularly poor joke for a trusted audience."] = "tauren-male\\lore9501_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Come along. Keep your eyes open as we go. A useful account begins with noticing what is there, rather than deciding in advance what you expect to find. We can speak without losing sight of the road."] = "tauren-male\\lore10537_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back. Come along, and let the road loosen its hold on you a little. There will be time to tell me where you have been. I am glad you found your way here again."] = "tauren-male\\lore11116_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome. Come and walk beside me. You can tell me what you have seen along the road, and I will try not to interrupt when you reach the part about stopping for a meal."] = "tauren-male\\lore11259_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Come, my friend. We can walk a little, and you may tell me what has held your attention today. It need not be a great deed or an urgent trouble. I am glad to hear those things, but I would also like to know whether you have found a quiet moment worth enjoying."] = "tauren-male\\lore2948_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, friend. What has the day brought you? A useful hunt, I hope, or at least a story we can enjoy over a meal. I have been keeping an eye on the stew pot. There may yet be something worth sharing at the bottom."] = "tauren-male\\lore2980_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, my friend. Sit with me a moment. I have been working on a small carving between other duties. A leaf, nothing elaborate. There is pleasure in letting a simple shape take its time. Tell me how your own work has been going."] = "tauren-male\\lore2981_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome. You have come with something on your mind. Speak, and I will listen. If you catch me pausing afterward, do not assume the answer is a mystery. I may simply be trying to stop a very poor rhyme from escaping into the conversation."] = "tauren-male\\lore2982_greet_1.ogg",
            ["It is good to see you. Shall we spend a little time together before the next journey calls? I have found that a familiar view is better when someone stays to share it."] = "tauren-male\\lore2995_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Come along. We need not fill every basket before returning. There is time to notice what grows beside the path, and perhaps to leave a few things exactly where we found them."] = "tauren-male\\lore3013_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good to see you. I brought my line and a little verse I have been working on. We can try the fishing first, if you would like to postpone the verse."] = "tauren-male\\lore3028_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, friend. There is shelter here for the people of the Horde, and time to hear what brings you to our bluffs. Tell me of your journey. A home grows stronger through those willing to defend it, and through those who remember why it is worth defending when the fighting is done."] = "tauren-male\\lore3057_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome. What have you noticed today? There is more to learning the plains than remembering where to aim. I have been listening to a bird near camp. It answers my whistle now and then. Whether that means I am improving is another question entirely."] = "tauren-male\\lore3061_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good to see you. Shall we take a walk? I have brought something to eat, though I make no promises about its shape when we stop. The flavor should still be there. If you have room for a bowl, we will be prepared for either a trailcake or a pleasant collection of crumbs."] = "tauren-male\\lore3067_greet_1.ogg",
            ["It is good to see you again. Whatever lies ahead, you need not face every uncertain moment alone. I will walk with you for a while, my friend."] = "tauren-male\\lore3418_greet_1.ogg",
            ["It is good to see you. Let us take a little time together. The questions will still be there afterward, and I would rather not overlook a friend while considering them."] = "tauren-male\\lore3448_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back, friend. Have you come a long way, or only far enough to remember something you meant to ask? Either way, you are welcome here. I shall try to give you everything useful before you reach the door. That would make a pleasant change for both of us."] = "tauren-male\\lore3934_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Where would you like to fly? Take a moment if you have not decided. The journey begins more comfortably when you can say what you want from it. While you consider that, look at the cloud above us. I think there is a kodo in it. You may have another suggestion worth hearing."] = "tauren-male\\lore4312_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back. Have you noticed how much good work asks for very little attention? A latch closes, a piece fits, and someone goes on with their day. I enjoy noticing it. Come, perhaps we will find something worth a moment together."] = "tauren-male\\lore6410_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are, my friend. We can walk a little before you settle in, if that is what you wish. But tell me honestly when your feet have had enough. There is no prize for arriving too tired to enjoy the welcome, and I would rather hear your story while you are comfortable."] = "tauren-male\\lore6747_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Come along, and tell me how your day has been. I have heard plenty about traveling pumpkins lately. A little news of my friend would be welcome."] = "tauren-male\\lore7714_greet_1.ogg",
            ["You are welcome here, friend. Put down what you are carrying and take a moment to arrive. There is cheese, something to drink, and company if you want it. I shall try to keep the conversation mild. Unless you would prefer something sharp. There, you have had fair warning."] = "tauren-male\\lore9501_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Back to the Crossroads. Let the road wait while you come inside. There is food and drink, and I would like to hear how the journey went. Tell me before you are ready to leave again. I have a habit of remembering my best questions as someone reaches the door."] = "tauren-male\\lore3934_hearth_1.ogg",
            ["Home again. Take a moment before you begin planning the next departure. Put down what you have carried, let your shoulders settle, and notice that you have arrived. The road will be there when you are ready for it. For now, I am pleased to have you here, safe and in good company."] = "tauren-male\\lore6747_hearth_1.ogg",
            ["Pulling this cord only tightened the knot. I had to stop and follow each turn before it made sense. I could have cut it, of course. That would rather spoil the small pleasure of working it loose."] = "tauren-male\\lore10537_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I know which chair I would choose for a long break. So do several guests, apparently, because I keep offering it to them. I shall sit there eventually. For now, it is good to see it being enjoyed."] = "tauren-male\\lore11116_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I have an imaginary map of meals I would like to try. It is a poor guide to the road. Whole stretches seem to disappear between the interesting parts. I suspect traveling by it would take months."] = "tauren-male\\lore11259_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Someone goes to fill a waterskin, then carries it home. Nothing remarkable happens on the way. That sounds like a small thing until the water is no longer safe to drink. I would be pleased to hear many such uneventful stories. There is much worth protecting in a day that gives us little cause for worry."] = "tauren-male\\lore2948_idle_1.ogg",
            ["You can keep the grand trophy. Give me a good hide, meat for the pot, and something useful to carry home. Those are things the camp will remember when the boasting is over. Though I admit I am especially attentive when the pot is nearly empty."] = "tauren-male\\lore2980_idle_1.ogg",
            ["This little leaf came from a scrap I had set aside. I found I liked working at the curve in quiet moments. One edge is still uneven. I may leave it that way. It rests pleasantly in my hand, and that is reason enough to enjoy it."] = "tauren-male\\lore2981_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Bristleback. Whistle back. Yes, I know. There must be a better use for those words than the one I have found. You need not look so solemn. I am allowed to enjoy a foolish rhyme without declaring it part of the rites."] = "tauren-male\\lore2982_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I have seen that view many times, yet the light still finds a way to change it. A long journey is not the only way to notice something new."] = "tauren-male\\lore2995_idle_1.ogg",
            ["After rain, I sometimes close my eyes and guess what I am standing on. Grass, dust, stone. Once I was smelling the wet bundle in my own basket. A very confident mistake."] = "tauren-male\\lore3013_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I had a fine last line a moment ago. Then the float moved, and I lost both the rhyme and the fish. I shall have to be less ambitious next time."] = "tauren-male\\lore3028_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A visitor once told me a fine account of a journey I remembered rather well. Some details had traveled farther than the people in the tale. I let him finish. There was pleasure in hearing what the story had become. He was quite surprised when I mentioned that I had been there."] = "tauren-male\\lore3057_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The bird makes it sound so easy. One little call, clear as anything. Mine needs work. I think it answered that last attempt, though I cannot say whether it approved. It is useful for a teacher to remember what being a beginner feels like."] = "tauren-male\\lore3061_idle_1.ogg",
            ["This batch held together rather well until I put my other belongings in the pack. I could call that a success and carry nothing else, but it would be a strange sort of traveling food. Still, the pieces taste good. We should not let a small disappointment become a wasted meal."] = "tauren-male\\lore3067_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I remembered a better joke just after our last conversation. I have kept it ready ever since. Now, if I could only remember how it begins."] = "tauren-male\\lore3418_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I have repaired this cup more carefully than its value might suggest. It still serves me well. Some things are worth keeping because we have learned to care for them."] = "tauren-male\\lore3448_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I once called a traveler back three times before he managed to leave. Food for the road, a direction he had asked about, and something else that seemed important. Then I went outside and forgot my own errand. Remembered it while saying farewell to the next person. A well-practiced habit."] = "tauren-male\\lore3934_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A traveler once saw something quite different in a cloud I had decided was a kodo. After hearing the explanation, I could see it too. I defended my kodo for another moment. The conversation was pleasant, and the cloud was changing quickly enough that we might both have been right before we finished speaking."] = "tauren-male\\lore4312_idle_1.ogg",
            ["There is a particular sound a well-fitted latch makes. Small and clean. Sometimes I open one again just to hear it close properly. Yes, I know it was finished the first time. I am allowed to enjoy the result twice."] = "tauren-male\\lore6410_idle_1.ogg",
            ["You can hear something of a journey in the way a traveler comes through a door. Sometimes it is eagerness, sometimes weariness, and sometimes a boot that needs attention. I do not pretend to understand every footstep. But I like hearing those same feet leave with a little more ease the next morning."] = "tauren-male\\lore6747_idle_1.ogg",
            ["The pumpkin has apparently reached a mountain now. I am waiting to hear how it climbed. It is a shared story, so someone else must explain that part."] = "tauren-male\\lore7714_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A traveler once thanked me with a cheese joke so poor that I was still laughing after they had gone. I have been finding replies ever since. A good welcome need not be clever. That is fortunate, because several of these are a long way from clever."] = "tauren-male\\lore9501_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A new lesson. Give it care before you measure yourself by how quickly you master it. Even a small carving asks the hand to learn. With patience, the next attempt may teach you something the first one could not."] = "tauren-male\\lore2981_learned_1.ogg",
            ["A new lesson asks something of you beyond remembering its words. Try it with care, and notice where your understanding holds. There is no shame in a question. I would rather hear one honest uncertainty than watch someone mistake a proud face for wisdom."] = "tauren-male\\lore2982_learned_1.ogg",
            ["A steady cast, a sound knot, and your eyes on the water. We can practice those together. Save a little patience for yourself as well as for the fish."] = "tauren-male\\lore3028_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Good. Try it carefully before deciding you have mastered it. Watch what changes when you slow down. One successful attempt is worth enjoying, and the next one is worth your full attention. That applies to a fine shot, or to a very stubborn whistle."] = "tauren-male\\lore3061_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Good. Now give yourself time to practice. A lesson begins a skill; it does not finish it. When you are ready for more, seek the teachers and books that can carry you farther. There is no shame in needing another lesson. I would worry more about someone who believed they had learned everything."] = "tauren-male\\lore3067_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Tell me what happened. Begin with what you saw, then what you did, and what changed afterward. A clear report matters. I would rather hear an uncertainty plainly than have to untangle it from a confident guess."] = "tauren-male\\lore10537_quest_1.ogg",
            ["You have given your effort, and that should be remembered. The work we do for the land reaches farther than the place where we stand. Those who drink, those who graze, and those who depend upon them all have a part in what has been protected. Take a moment to understand the good your care can do."] = "tauren-male\\lore2948_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Good work. Think of what those supplies will become. A meal, a mended shelter, clothing that keeps someone warm. It is easy to see only the hunt while you are out there. I like to remember what happens after we carry it home."] = "tauren-male\\lore2980_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Service to the people continues beyond the first deed that earns their respect. Bring your strength, your judgment, and a willingness to see the work through. When the hunting is done, remember those who will gather the meat and hide. A fine deed should leave something useful for the community behind it."] = "tauren-male\\lore3057_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Your help has made a difference. Remember that when the next task looks unfamiliar. Courage is easier to find when you know your strength can do some good."] = "tauren-male\\lore3418_quest_1.ogg",
            ["That is useful work. A creature helped or a finding understood gives us something to build upon. Thank you for bringing your care as well as your strength to it."] = "tauren-male\\lore3448_quest_1.ogg",
            ["In the Charred Vale, a matriarch suffers in a place that has lost much of its life. The horn is proof of a task, but the task has a purpose beyond carrying something home. Remember what your strength was asked to do."] = "tauren-male\\lore6410_quest_1.ogg",
            ["This looks like a good place to stop. Set the pack where it will not trouble your feet, and give yourself time to become comfortable. Rest is worth taking properly, even when the next part of the journey seems urgent."] = "tauren-male\\lore11116_rest_1.ogg",
            ["A good place to stop. Tell me about a meal you remember from your travels. Not the grandest feast, necessarily. Sometimes the right company makes a simple supper the one you keep thinking about afterward."] = "tauren-male\\lore11259_rest_1.ogg",
            ["A good camp takes a little preparation. If you are trying an incense candle, remember the campfire first, and give the people in town their space. Then sit down and enjoy the company."] = "tauren-male\\lore3013_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Set down what you can, and let yourself be comfortable. You need not earn every quiet moment with another errand. Sometimes a seat and good company are quite enough."] = "tauren-male\\lore7714_rest_1.ogg",
            ["There is no need to apologize for stopping. You have been carrying the day long enough to set it down for a while. A little food, a drink, familiar company. We can leave the next danger outside the conversation until you are ready. I can offer a worse joke instead."] = "tauren-male\\lore9501_rest_1.ogg",
            ["There is the lift of the wings. Keep your bundle secure and let yourself notice the journey. Strength and speed are fine things, but the view is worth a little attention too."] = "tauren-male\\lore2995_taxi_1.ogg",
            ["Choose where you wish to go, then give yourself time to settle before the flight. If you have a question, ask it. A nervous traveler need not pretend that everything is already understood. There will be plenty to notice along the way. I hope you find something in the view worth telling another person about afterward."] = "tauren-male\\lore4312_taxi_1.ogg",
        },
        ["troll-female"] = {
            ["You understand that quiet company is still company. I like having you beside me. When I find time for the next first cast, I would be glad if you stayed to share that moment with me."] = "troll-female\\lore12031_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You remember to tell me that everyone came through before you begin the long version. That is kindness, mon. Come along. I would enjoy being part of a little of your day, and hearing the rest when you are ready to tell it."] = "troll-female\\lore12032_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You can take the work seriously and still enjoy a little foolishness when there is room for it. That is good company, mon. Come along. There should be something in the day we can enjoy without turning it into another important test."] = "troll-female\\lore266881_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You will give me an honest opinion and then stay for more than the choosing. I like that. Come along, mon. We can enjoy a little of the day without spending all of it wondering whether another hat would have been better."] = "troll-female\\lore270582_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Yes, I would like to come along. You notice things, and you listen when I tell you why they matter. That makes a walk much more pleasant. We need not gather anything every time, either. Some days it is enough to share the road and find something small to laugh about together."] = "troll-female\\lore3185_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You can ask questions, bring an idea back, and stay without making a ceremony of it. Zamja likes that. Come along. We will find something worth noticing, and neither of us has to pretend to know everything before we start the day."] = "troll-female\\lore3399_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. I saved a little space in my tune for you. No need to sing well. I would just like to hear what it sounds like with a friend."] = "troll-female\\lore3403_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I am happy to see without preparing a lesson first. Come along, friend. We can look at what is growing beside the road. You need not name every leaf or tell me what it would fetch. Sometimes I enjoy a stubborn little plant simply because it is doing well."] = "troll-female\\lore3404_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Yes, I will walk with you. I have seen that you can listen, think, and give care where it is needed. Those things matter to me. You need not stand as though every word between us is another test. We have come to know one another, and I am pleased to call you my friend."] = "troll-female\\lore3706_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You listen even when the subject is something I am still learning. I appreciate that more than another compliment about my magic. Come, friend. We have time for a proper conversation."] = "troll-female\\lore5882_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would enjoy a walk with you. Keep your eyes open and tell me what catches your attention. We need not turn every observation into a lesson. A little curiosity and good company can make the journey pleasant enough by themselves."] = "troll-female\\lore5884_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I have come to enjoy your visits for more than the news you bring. Let us spend a little time together, my friend. There is room in a good day for company as well as work."] = "troll-female\\lore7953_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["A look should please the person wearing it. Take a moment to notice your own reaction before you begin imagining everyone else's. I can help with the appearance, mon. The choice is more satisfying when you recognize it as your own."] = "troll-female\\lore270582_gear_1.ogg",
            ["Come along, mon. I have spent enough time getting everyone else ready to fish. Let us leave a little room in this day for ourselves. You can tell me where you have been as we walk."] = "troll-female\\lore12031_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are, mon. Good, you made it back. Now I can enjoy hearing about the journey. Start wherever you like, and take your time. I listen much better once I know the person telling the story came through it safely."] = "troll-female\\lore12032_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good to see you, mon. We can look at the work in a moment. First, watch one very modest attempt. Paper, an empty cup, and no magic to help it along. If I miss, I will collect it and try again later."] = "troll-female\\lore266881_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back, mon. Have a look in mind, or would you like a little time to choose? I can offer an opinion. When we get to my own hats, you may have to remind me that I already liked the first one."] = "troll-female\\lore270582_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Come walk with me, and keep your eyes on more than the road ahead. Durotar has green things worth noticing, even where a hurried traveler sees nothing useful. I can show you a few places. If I give one a strange name, there is probably a story behind it."] = "troll-female\\lore3185_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Back already? Good. What did you learn out there? Put down the pack before you try to show Zamja. There is always room for another useful idea in the kitchen, and she would rather see it done than hear a grand name for it."] = "troll-female\\lore3399_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good to see you, friend. May the spirits protect us on the road. And if I start humming, you are welcome to join me. I make no promises about the tune."] = "troll-female\\lore3403_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Come closer, mon. What do you see in that cup? Look at the leaves before you decide how rare it is. A fine container can fool an eager student. We can begin with careful eyes, then talk about what you hope to learn. There is more to herbalism than making a confident guess."] = "troll-female\\lore3404_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good, you are here. Come along, and bring your attention with you. There is more to learn from a walk than how far your legs can carry you. Watch the people beside you. Notice who needs help before they have to ask. That is a useful habit, whatever strength you have to offer."] = "troll-female\\lore3706_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. I have news, though you must promise to give it the proper attention. The plant by my window has a new leaf. Yes, the ordinary one. I am quite pleased."] = "troll-female\\lore5882_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Come and sit a moment. I have found a pleasant angle for this little fan, and I am prepared to enjoy it. Tell me what you have been learning. You may find I have an opinion, especially if you tried to hurry the lesson."] = "troll-female\\lore5884_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Shall we have a little time together? You can tell me how your day is going, and I will try not to turn the whole conversation into another riding lesson."] = "troll-female\\lore7953_greet_1.ogg",
            ["For the first cast, I like to let the line settle before thinking about anything else. No supplies to count. No errands to remember. Just that little moment when fishing is all I am doing."] = "troll-female\\lore12031_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I can wait over a fishing line without a word. A traveler starts telling me about a snapped rope, though, and I need to know how it ends. Once everyone is safe, I am happy to hear every little detail again."] = "troll-female\\lore12032_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A scrap of paper and an empty cup. I flick, it misses, I pick it up. There is something pleasant about a mistake that asks so little of you. When one finally lands, I allow myself a thoroughly unnecessary little celebration."] = "troll-female\\lore266881_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I tell people to trust that first pleased reaction. Sensible advice. Then I try a hat, another hat, and the first one again. Usually the first was right. Knowing that has not entirely stopped me from trying one more, just to be sure."] = "troll-female\\lore270582_idle_1.ogg",
            ["That spot is Mind Your Elbow. No, that is not the name of the herb growing there. It is the name of the lesson I learned while reaching for it. You may laugh. I did, after I stopped rubbing my arm. A gathering route is easier to remember when it has a few stories."] = "troll-female\\lore3185_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Someone showed Zamja a little trick once. She tried it, asked to see it again, and practiced after they left. What, a teacher cannot learn? Roll up your sleeves. If you have something worth showing, she has time to pay attention."] = "troll-female\\lore3399_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Someone asked me how that little tune ends. I wish I knew. Every time I try to finish it, another few notes come along and ask to stay."] = "troll-female\\lore3403_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I put a common weed in a fine cup while arranging my samples. A visitor asked what such a valuable plant might cost. He had looked at the cup first. I keep it there now. It makes a useful lesson, and I admit those stubborn little leaves have grown on me in their own way."] = "troll-female\\lore3404_idle_1.ogg",
            ["You think this cord must hold some secret power because I keep working at it? No. It holds a knot I made while my mind was elsewhere. I know how it began. That does not mean pulling harder will tell me how to undo it. You may smile. A teacher can still give herself an awkward lesson."] = "troll-female\\lore3706_idle_1.ogg",
            ["It is an ordinary kitchen herb. No hidden enchantment, no secret formula. I was informed that I had simply given it too much water. A surprisingly effective lesson, once I stopped arguing with it."] = "troll-female\\lore5882_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A scrap of paper, a few folds, and a little care with the angle. That is all this fan needs. I like the moment when a small adjustment makes it work better. It pays to notice what the thing in your hand is actually doing."] = "troll-female\\lore5884_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Those were two perfectly ordinary steps. Perhaps three. If a learner finally understands a difficult turn, I am allowed to look pleased about it. You may look pleased with me."] = "troll-female\\lore7953_idle_1.ogg",
            ["There comes a time when a learner needs more than I can teach. A good book, another patient teacher, a little more practice. That is progress, mon. I would rather point you toward it than pretend I have nothing left to learn myself."] = "troll-female\\lore12032_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Good. Now take your time putting that lesson to use. Look closely, learn what you are gathering, and bring it back with a little care. A crushed bundle teaches you less than one you can examine properly. You will get quicker with practice. You need not begin by rushing past the important part."] = "troll-female\\lore3185_learned_1.ogg",
            ["When a teacher has shown you what she knows, find the next lesson. Then come back and share a little of it. Zamja can learn too. A kitchen stays interesting when the people in it bring more than their old habits to the work."] = "troll-female\\lore3399_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Take your time. You do not have to make it look effortless on the first try. I would rather see you stop and ask than carry a mistake into the next lesson."] = "troll-female\\lore3403_learned_1.ogg",
            ["An incense candle is something a learning herbalist can bring to camp. Give the work care, then take it into the wilderness where a camp belongs. Remember the fire before arranging the rest. A cooking trainer can teach you that beginning. A useful lesson works better when you have remembered what it needs."] = "troll-female\\lore3404_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Remember what that knowledge is for. Healing can keep an ally alive, and protection can help them stay that way. There is wisdom in using your power before another wound is struck. Do not measure your worth only by what falls before you. Notice who is still standing because you were there."] = "troll-female\\lore3706_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Knowing one art does not spare you from being a beginner at another. Ask the question, listen to the answer, then try it properly. You may quote me on that, with suitable discretion."] = "troll-female\\lore5882_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Good. Now give yourself time to understand what you have learned. Watch what changes when you try it carefully. Confidence has its uses, but I am much more interested in the moment when you can explain why something worked."] = "troll-female\\lore5884_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Take a moment before you hurry away. Feel how your mount moves, and pay attention to what it is telling you. Confidence will serve you better when it has some understanding behind it."] = "troll-female\\lore7953_mount_1.ogg",
            ["Zalazane's pendants carry binding magic. Learn to recognize what you are removing, and remember the people who wore them. Their deaths are a sorrow. With those bindings gone, their spirits can rest. There is more to this work than collecting something that shines."] = "troll-female\\lore266881_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Yes, let us stop. There is always another thing waiting to be done, but it can wait a little longer. Even a day with no great catch can be a good day beside the water."] = "troll-female\\lore12031_rest_1.ogg",
        },
        ["troll-male"] = {
            ["Before you force anything else into that bag, check the dye and the vials. It is easier to pack carefully now than explain afterward why every useful thing has turned blue."] = "troll-male\\lore3482_bagsFull_1.ogg",
            ["Make a little room before the grand departure. A bag full of impressive finds can still be missing the small thing you meant to bring. I am happy to supply a suitable introduction for the person who remembers it in time. They deserve a little credit before the journey begins."] = "troll-male\\lore3490_bagsFull_1.ogg",
            ["You know when I am angling for a favor, and you still come back just to talk. I appreciate that. Today, let us enjoy the company. I promise there is no bucket waiting at the end."] = "troll-male\\lore11317_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have shown me care as well as strength, and I trust both. Come along, friend. A difficult purpose is easier to carry with someone who understands why the small things matter. If I check my pouch once more before we leave, give me a moment. I may also be remembering something I wanted to tell you."] = "troll-male\\lore2703_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I am glad to have beside me when an answer does not come easily. Come along, friend. I value your willingness to think, to try, and to return when the first attempt has disappointed us. There is room for laughter as well. If my joke ends differently this time, perhaps we will discover the better version together."] = "troll-male\\lore2706_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have made these quiet days more pleasant. I would like to come along for a while, my friend. Save me a little room when you stop to rest."] = "troll-male\\lore3184_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would be glad to walk with you. We can speak along the way, and leave some quiet between the words. Tell me what you have noticed. A familiar path may still have something to show us when we share it with a friend."] = "troll-male\\lore3188_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I would like your company. You need not find the right words for everything. Tell me what you can see from here, or sit quietly beside me. It helps to have a friend who sees more than the trouble I am in."] = "troll-male\\lore3287_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have shown patience, and you can admit learning something without dressing it as a triumph. I find your company agreeable. Come along. This is no apprenticeship. We may simply see what the day teaches us, then argue over which lesson was worth remembering."] = "troll-male\\lore3304_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You listen when I talk about food, and you bring more to the conversation than a shopping list. I like that. Come along, friend. We will see what the road offers. If we find something good to eat, you may enjoy it without proving anything at all to me."] = "troll-male\\lore3400_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone whose company I choose, rather than someone awaiting instruction. That is a useful distinction, my friend. Let us have a little time together without a mission attached."] = "troll-male\\lore3401_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["I enjoy seeing you even when you need nothing from the shelves. Let us spend a little time together, my friend. We can find something to talk about besides supplies."] = "troll-male\\lore3482_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have become someone I am glad to see before I know what you need from the stock. Come along, friend. I would enjoy a little company away from the supplies. I can leave the elaborate introduction behind, though you are welcome to ask for it if the road needs a little ceremony."] = "troll-male\\lore3490_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have learned the value of waiting for the last word. I enjoy that in company. Stay beside me, mon. An audience that understands the joke is a great improvement over listening to one's own echo."] = "troll-male\\lore3995_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Come sit with me when you have a moment, my friend. We can cast a line, skip a few stones, or let the water do all the talking."] = "troll-male\\lore5941_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have shown respect without making a performance of it. I value that. Today I would like your company, and perhaps your answer to a question that has nothing to do with a lesson."] = "troll-male\\lore6018_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["You have made time for more than the work, and I am glad of it. Stay beside me, mon. We can speak of your journeys, or make a little room for something that need not become a great deed at all."] = "troll-male\\lore6408_befriended_1.ogg",
            ["Thank you. I have spent enough time imagining what people would say of me. You came close enough to ask how I was. That means more than a speech about bravery. I will hold on to that kindness when fear starts talking again."] = "troll-male\\lore3287_comforted_1.ogg",
            ["Power is held in things others might overlook. The satyrs take from the forest; my gauntlet work draws upon what their hooves have gathered. Be mindful of what you bring to a crafting, and of the hands that will wear it."] = "troll-male\\lore6408_gear_1.ogg",
            ["A little walk, you say? I will come along. But if this becomes hauling crates or diving for something, we should discuss the arrangement again. I like to know when a pleasant outing turns into work."] = "troll-male\\lore11317_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, friend. Have you come to help with the work before us? Vol'jin has given me a task that will need careful hands as well as strength. Trol'kalar lies behind protections we must gather the means to open. A missing piece will not become less important because the purpose behind it is great. We begin by paying attention."] = "troll-male\\lore2703_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome, friend. There is still hope here, even among the remains of this old prison. Sometimes it takes more than a story to help someone feel it. Sometimes the first attempt fails. I will think again before I abandon the effort. If you have come to help, let us consider what we can try next."] = "troll-male\\lore2706_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Ah, there you are. Let me put the stopper in this bottle. Good. Whatever we do today, we can begin without rushing."] = "troll-male\\lore3184_greet_1.ogg",
            ["You found me. Come, sit a moment and tell me how the day has been. There is room for a difficult thought, or a small pleasant one. We need not hurry either of them away before you have finished speaking."] = "troll-male\\lore3188_greet_1.ogg",
            ["You stopped. I am glad. There is a little ant near my hand carrying something far too big for it. I have been quietly taking its side. Sit a moment, if you can. I would welcome someone taking mine as well."] = "troll-male\\lore3287_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Tell me what you learned on the way. Something useful, if you can manage it. I hear enough speeches from people convinced they are ready for an apprenticeship. A small mistake honestly understood may tell me more than all their claims together."] = "troll-male\\lore3304_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Come, tell me what you plan to cook. I have spices, supplies, and a little advice if you want it. Taste before you add more. You might find the meal was already saying something worth hearing before you invited every seasoning on the shelf to speak over it."] = "troll-male\\lore3400_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. We can walk together for a while. Pay attention to what is around you, but you need not report every observation. I am allowing myself a little company."] = "troll-male\\lore3401_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Have you packed what you need, or are we going to discover the missing tool halfway down the road? Either way, I am glad for the company."] = "troll-male\\lore3482_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Welcome back, friend. Have you remembered the little things for your next grand undertaking? I keep a number of them here. Candles, seeds, vials, and the rest of the things nobody mentions in the triumphant introduction. I have been working on an introduction that gives their supplier a little more credit."] = "troll-male\\lore3490_greet_1.ogg",
            ["There you are, mon. Come along, and do not speak over the interesting part. Every little pause has its purpose. Sometimes I am thinking. Sometimes I am giving the audience a moment to become properly nervous."] = "troll-male\\lore3995_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good to see you. Bring your patience if we go near the water. Bring a little luck, too. I have a pebble that ought to skip beautifully."] = "troll-male\\lore5941_greet_1.ogg",
            ["You have arrived at just the right time. I heard a riddle at the market, and I would like another answer. Walk with me. There is no ceremony required for this one."] = "troll-male\\lore6018_greet_1.ogg",
            ["Good to see you, mon. The spirits may follow your great deeds, but I would like to hear the smaller parts as well. Tell me what pleased you on the way here. There is room in the day for that."] = "troll-male\\lore6408_greet_1.ogg",
            ["I moved my seat to find better shade. Then I moved it again. By the time I found the perfect spot, most of the morning had gone. A successful plan. I refuse to hear otherwise."] = "troll-male\\lore11317_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I explain how much depends on gathering every sigil, then find myself counting the ordinary things in my pouch before leaving. Twice, sometimes. It is a useful habit. Less useful when someone notices that I have just told them I am ready. Give me a moment, friend. I would rather be thorough than return for something small."] = "troll-male\\lore2703_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I remember telling a joke that made someone laugh until I began laughing too. A good result. Unfortunately, I no longer remember the ending that earned it. I have tried several possibilities since then. Some have been very doubtful. Still, one person laughed at my attempt to explain the problem. Perhaps that is another ending worth keeping."] = "troll-male\\lore2706_idle_1.ogg",
            ["That little cork bird has the right idea. No errands, no battles, and nothing to do but sit comfortably on a shelf."] = "troll-male\\lore3184_idle_1.ogg",
            ["This shell is only a shell. Smooth beneath the thumb, a pleasing shape to turn in the hand. Sometimes that is enough to help a thought settle. I listen better when I leave a little space before the answer."] = "troll-male\\lore3188_idle_1.ogg",
            ["There. It dropped the crumb again. Wait before you laugh. It is going around the other side to try a different grip. I like that. A poor beginning need not decide the whole journey. I am trying to remember it myself."] = "troll-male\\lore3287_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A visitor once told me a journey had taught them to keep sand out of their cup. No heroic speech, no great revelation. I laughed. Then the wind filled my own cup, and I found the lesson had arrived exactly when it was needed."] = "troll-male\\lore3304_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I once tried to improve a meal with a little of every seasoning I could reach. By the end, I could not have told you what I had cooked. Ate an apple afterward. Best thing I had tasted all evening. That was a useful lesson, though I preferred the apple."] = "troll-male\\lore3400_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Yes, that was a crunch. The wrapping has already been dealt with. I have decided that a pleasant bite between lessons need not become another exercise in stealth."] = "troll-male\\lore3401_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Selling hot spices does not oblige me to put them in every meal. I like to taste my supper. You may call that sensible, and I will happily agree."] = "troll-male\\lore3482_idle_1.ogg",
            ["Travelers arrive with such fine introductions. Great deeds, impressive journeys, enemies defeated. I began making one for myself. Supplier of the remembered candle, keeper of the needed vial... it grows longer whenever I think of something else that helped. I have yet to finish it before a friend starts grinning."] = "troll-male\\lore3490_idle_1.ogg",
            ["I once heard my laugh return from the cave at precisely the right moment. Since then, I have been trying to reproduce the effect. The echo has no respect for rehearsal. Or perhaps I began too soon again."] = "troll-male\\lore3995_idle_1.ogg",
            ["That was a good flat pebble. Three skips, perhaps four. I am counting the little one at the end. It made an honest effort."] = "troll-male\\lore5941_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A merchant asked a little question between selling two pieces of fruit. I have thought about it longer than several very grand speeches. Wisdom can arrive without announcing all its titles."] = "troll-male\\lore6018_idle_1.ogg",
            ["A stick, a patch of sand, and a fish with a crooked tail. That is all. No secret message from the spirits. I could straighten it, but then it would look like a fish that already knows where it is going."] = "troll-male\\lore6408_idle_1.ogg",
            ["There you are. Your hands found the motion once you stopped fighting it. Give yourself time with the next lesson, too. You do not need to master everything before supper."] = "troll-male\\lore3184_learned_1.ogg",
            ["You watched, understood, and then acted. Keep that order in mind. A lesson practiced carefully here may spare you a much less forgiving correction when you are in the field."] = "troll-male\\lore3401_learned_1.ogg",
            ["Keep what you have learned with care. Understand why you use it, and respect the teaching that brought it to you. A lesson is worth more than the ability to repeat its words."] = "troll-male\\lore6018_learned_1.ogg",
            ["When you gather the fragments of the broken sigil, take them to Tor'gan. His skill can make them whole again. Do not mistake the pieces for something already ready to use, or a warded tomb for a chest left open. We need the protections answered properly if Trol'kalar is to serve the purpose Vol'jin has given us."] = "troll-male\\lore2703_quest_1.ogg",
            ["My brother Tan'jani was always searching for something. A traveler brought word of him from south of Loch Modan. Later came a bloodstained letter, with Riverglades and Rog'mar among the few things I could read. I do not know the rest. If you can find him, bring care to the search. A fragment of news leaves much unanswered."] = "troll-male\\lore2706_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Pal'juh has promise. Promise does not make going into danger alone a wise decision. I am grateful when someone brings her safely out of trouble. I would be more pleased if she learned enough from the journey not to need the same rescue again."] = "troll-male\\lore3304_quest_1.ogg",
            ["A careful hand, a good memory, and the ability to count all those eyes. Useful qualities, mon. Now let me attend to the brewing. Stand where you can see, and do try not to interrupt the best part."] = "troll-male\\lore3995_quest_1.ogg",
            ["This looks like a fine place to stop. We should test it properly before deciding to move on. A few quiet minutes, perhaps. Longer, if the conversation is good and the sun keeps its distance."] = "troll-male\\lore11317_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Here is a place to sit. Let your hands rest for a moment. You need not bring me a question every time we meet. Your company is welcome too. We can watch the light move, and speak when there is something we wish to say."] = "troll-male\\lore3188_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Now we can enjoy a meal without hurrying toward the next thing. Take a bite before you decide what is missing. Sometimes the cook has already done enough. Sometimes an apple needs nothing at all. Either way, I would rather hear that you enjoyed it than that you survived it."] = "troll-male\\lore3400_rest_1.ogg",
            ["There is more to a camp than getting ready for another fight. Put a little joy beside the fire. That is a good reason to learn the Fish Bowl lesson."] = "troll-male\\lore5941_rest_1.ogg",
        },
    },
}
